window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3001,"title":"Chapter 3001 - Untitled","paragraphs":["“It’s the enhancement liquid! It really is! She made it! OMG!","“How can she be so lucky?!”","Her eyes rolled back, and she fainted in her aunt’s arms.","Elder Dongfang was speechless.","She didn’t know how to describe her feelings now.","No one was questioning Feng Wu’s skills anymore.","Everybody had been watching when she turned the pill into the liquid.","That was much harder than making the pill, and no one again brought up the possibility that she had switched pills.","Elder Dongfang looked at her unconscious niece before giving Feng Wu a long look.","When she rose to her feet, she almost fell back onto the ground.","Xuelan immediately supported her with a solemn look on her face.","Elder Dongfang was extremely capable, but because of Feng Wu, she could barely stand up.","Elder Dongfang handed Ziyun to Xuelan before walking away.","She looked so lonely from behind.","Despite always keeping her back straight, the old lady was hunching now.","Once she left, the others focused on Feng Wu again.","A Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Feng Wu really was what she said she was.","Elder Wu had been prepared for this, and Feng Xun had always known that Feng Wu was a special girl, so he was ready to accept the information.","Xuan Yi knew Feng Wu was a genius, so he believed she could do anything.","However, Elder Helian hadn’t met Feng Wu until today.","What did Feng Wu show him?","The old man was having a difficult time accepting this.","“You...”","Elder Helian swallowed and looked at Feng Wu.","He wanted to say something, but he could only ask, “Are you really a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","Elder Helian was one of the leaders of Imperial College.","Elder Wu was Gongsun Mu’s direct superior, and Elder Helian was Elder Wu’s superior.","He was much higher up the food chain.","However, even he was too shocked by Feng Wu to make conversation.","Something like this had never happened before.","Compared with him, Feng Wu was so calm.","She glanced at Elder Helian and said, “Yes, I am.”","Was that it?","Elder Wu was anxious.","She was wasting a great opportunity to befriend Elder Helian!","Elder Wu wanted to remind Feng Wu, when a question struck him: Who was superior, a Semi-Divine medicine refiner or Elder Helian?","Elder Helian asked, “Are you really a current student?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Elder Helian said, “Why haven’t you graduated? It would be so easy for you!”"]},{"number":3002,"title":"Chapter 3002 - A Genius?","paragraphs":["The question dumbfounded Feng Wu a little.","She blinked. “I can graduate earlier than scheduled?”","Elder Helian seemed confused. “Why can’t you?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t think I have enough points.”","Elder Helian adored Feng Wu now because she was the super genius of his school. The Military Academy didn’t have such a student.","He knew Elder Dongfang had made a breakthrough and was now a level higher than he was.","When the genius teenager revealed herself, Elder Dongfang was so shocked that she slipped away.","Because of that, Elder Helian liked Feng Wu even more.","He glanced at Feng Wu and said confidently, “Kiddo, there’s something you don’t know. Geniuses have privileges.”","He didn’t even care what cultivation level Feng Wu was at.","She was such a talented medicine refiner that he couldn’t care about her cultivation level. She was already a genius!","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Can I graduate now?”","Why not? Elder Helian was about to nod, when Elder Wu whispered something in his ear.","Elder Helian froze.","He couldn’t believe his ears. “Are you kidding me?”","How could any new student rise all the way to Class A in less than six months, let alone come here?","Elder Helian had met his fair share of geniuses, but none of them was like Feng Wu.","“It’s true.” Elder Wu smiled bitterly and took out a school report.","He had brought the report here to show Elder Helian what a genius Imperial College had.","However, Elder Helian saw the girl before Elder Wu could present the school report.","Elder Wu wondered if anybody could outshine the girl.","Elder Helian read the report before looking up at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu kept her back ramrod straight and met his gaze with glowing eyes.","“Elder Helian, can I graduate now?”","Elder Helian looked down at the report and read it one more time.","Despite how calm he looked, he was shaken to the core.","“Holy crap!","“What’s going on?","“Calling her a genius is an understatement!","“If she’s a genius, Chen Ziyun is an idiot!","“Ha!","“Imperial College finally has its own genius!","“His Royal Highness is an honor graduate of both schools, so he doesn’t count.","“Feng Wu is our own!”","Elder Helian had been inferior to Elder Dongfang in the past few years.","The families of Dongfang and Helian had competed against each other for generations."]},{"number":3003,"title":"Chapter 3003 - His Royal Highness Wakes Up","paragraphs":["The two elders had been competing with each other all the way through their school years at Imperial College, and the competition continued even when they both became elders.","Elder Helian had always been on the losing side.","But now, he had Feng Wu.","Realizing he was smiling involuntarily, Elder Helian immediately put his hands on his face to wipe away the smile.","Calm down!","I must stay calm!","Being as important as he was, he couldn’t let his emotions show.","“Ahem!” Elder Helian feigned an indifferent manner and frowned at the school report. “She’s alright, I guess.”","Elder Wu saw through Elder Helian’s pretension. He looked up at the sky and rolled his eyes.","Elder Helian told Feng Wu, “You don’t have enough points, kiddo.”","Feng Wu was disappointed.","She knew things wouldn’t be that easy.","Elder Helian couldn’t bring himself to see the look on the girl’s face.","He only wanted to give the little genius some pressure so that she wouldn’t become too arrogant. However, he didn’t want to upset her either.","“Look. You still have so many points to gain.","“If you really want to graduate, you’ll have to kill a few junior Spiritual Kings of the Dongsang Kingdom.","“It’s easy, isn’t it?”","Elder Helian felt like the big bad wolf, trying to swindle Red Riding Hood.","Elder Wu tried to cut him off but failed in the end.","He hadn’t told Elder Helian how well Feng Wu did in the competition.","If Elder Helian knew what Feng Wu had done, he wouldn’t be saying such things anymore.","Feng Wu asked, “Can I graduate if I kill ten junior Spiritual Kings of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Elder Helian said, “Of course. But you’ve only just become a Spiritual King and are at Sheng Changtian’s level. Don’t do anything reckless. Practice your skills and keep yourself safe, alright?”","The same level as Sheng Changtian?","Feng Wu realized why he got that idea. He read it from the report.","That was already a few days old.","Elder Wu reminded him, “Sir, that report is from several days ago.”","Elder Helian gave him a strange look.","Of course he knew that.","Wasn’t that the latest report?","Could anyone make one breakthrough after another in a few days?","Elder Helian ignored Elder Wu’s reminder and only talked to Feng Wu. “Kiddo, I’ll let you go to the battlefield when you’re a Level 3 Spiritual King. How about that?”","Feng Wu said obediently, “Alright.”","Elder Helian was so pleased with the pretty and well-behaved girl. If it were up to him, he would have adopted her by now.","Elder Wu looked up at the sky when he recalled Feng Wu’s achievements since they met.","Just then, they heard noise inside the room.","Feng Wu immediately rushed inside.","Jun Linyuan had woken up, and the first person he saw was Feng Wu."]},{"number":3004,"title":"Chapter 3004 - What’s Wrong?","paragraphs":["“You’re awake! How do you feel? Any pain?”","Feng Wu crouched down by the bed and checked Jun Linyuan’s pulse.","His eyes were as pretty as ever, but there was no light in them.","He only stared at Feng Wu in silence.","The look was so cold that it made one shudder.","Feng Wu was the first to come in, and behind her were Feng Xun, Xuan Yi and the other elders.","The crown prince wouldn’t look at anybody else, and his face had never looked so grim.","Feng Wu’s heart sank, and she had a bad feeling about this.","It was incredible!","The next second!","The crown prince’s face was as dark as a stormy night, and there was something very domineering about him.","Even Elder Helian wanted to shudder when the crown prince glanced at him.","“Get out!” The crown prince bellowed at Feng Wu.","Feng Xun panicked.","Boss Jun got angry all the time, but he had never been so furious.","He even shouted at Feng Wu, the girl he cared about the most.","Feng Xun wanted to step forward, when the crown prince glared at him.","“Get out! All of you!”","He was furious!","The air in the room seemed to have frozen.","Everybody thought the crown prince would jump out of bed and kill them all.","However, he didn’t have any spiritual essence or the intent to kill anyone.","No one knew what to do.","Just then, he smirked.","“I’m useless now, and you won’t follow my orders anymore. Am I right?”","He was glaring at Feng Wu when he said that.","It was as if he wanted to drill holes in her with his eyes.","Feng Xun was panic-stricken.","That tone...","Feng Xun could tell Jun Linyuan’s mood from his tone. He only sounded this way when he was extremely angry.","He looked like he was going to explode.","What did he mean he was useless now?","Feng Xun recalled what Feng Wu had said earlier, so he turned around and looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Feng Wu nodded.","Boom!","Feng Xun thought his head was going to explode.","The most unthinkable thing had happened. Boss Jun, the genius crown prince, had been...","Feng Xun thought he was losing his mind.","He turned to look at the crown prince but only met the latter’s smirk.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","“I think we should leave. Everybody out.”","Feng Xun knew how proud Jun Linyuan was. He could never let anybody see his vulnerable side.","Everybody had to leave.","After some consideration, Feng Wu decided to leave the room and let Jun Linyuan calm down.","Once everybody else had left, Feng Xun went to Jun Linyuan’s side, trying to talk to him.","The crown prince stared at him.","“Even you are going to disobey my order now. Is that it?”","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine.","Boss Jun felt like a complete stranger.","How scary...","Feng Xun saw blue veins pop on Boss Jun’s forehead."]},{"number":3005,"title":"Chapter 3005 - Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["The crown prince was going to explode.","Feng Xun immediately said, “Alright, Boss Jun, please calm down. I’m leaving now.”","He rushed out of the room, but he could still feel how frustrated the crown prince was.","He quietly closed the door behind him.","Leaning on the door, he took a deep breath and hurried to Feng Wu’s side.","Elder Helian was talking to her.","“What happened? What’s going on?” Elder Helian asked anxiously.","Feng Wu suddenly asked, “Our principal is here, right?”","Elder Helian shook his head. “Our three top cultivators are confronting their counterparts. No one can be distracted.”","If something went wrong, this fortress could be destroyed.","Feng Wu looked around and saw they were alone.","She said something to Elder Helian, making his eyes pop.","“What?!” Elder Helian jumped to his feet. “How’s that possible? He’s the most talented person in our history! How...”","Feng Xun arrived at that moment.","“Xiao Wu, is it true? Has Boss Jun lost his power?”","Feng Wu nodded, then shook her head. “There’s no spiritual essence in him now, but it doesn’t have to stay that way.","“Do you remember what happened to me? My ability was destroyed five years ago. When I recovered my cultivation ability, however, I made faster progress than before, and my bloodline also became the Divine Phoenix Blood.","“Every cloud has a silver lining. Bad things may turn out for the good.”","Hearing that, everybody calmed down.","Feng Xun said, “Are you saying he has to start from scratch again?","OMG!","His Royal Highness was a Spiritual Saint. If he had to start from zero...","Feng Wu said, “I’ve checked his pulse. He’s much better than I used to be. He won’t need to repeat his cultivation process. When we find the match that’ll light the spiritual essence, his spiritual essence will start circulating again.”","Feng Xun asked, “Where’s the match?”","Feng Wu stared at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun suddenly remembered something. “I remember! You used the Immortal Spiritual Fruit!”","He still remembered how Feng Wu had pretended to be the ugly girl.","It pained Feng Xun to realize that she had experienced what Boss Jun was experiencing now.","“You were...”","Feng Wu was so young back then, and Boss Jun wasn’t in love with her yet. She had to do everything. He felt so sorry for her.","Feng Wu said, “That’s why I know how Jun Linyuan feels now.","“He needs a quiet environment.","“He also needs to accept the reality and move on from his grief. He’ll be on the rise again.","“Right now, he wouldn’t let anybody approach him.","“Let’s wait a few days. Things will be much easier when he’s willing to talk to us.”","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","She didn’t know Jun Linyuan would be so unlucky."]},{"number":3006,"title":"Chapter 3006 - Three Areas","paragraphs":["Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, Boss Jun will recover, won’t he?”","Feng Wu didn’t know the answer, but she had to comfort Jun Linyuan.","She knew Jun Linyuan must be listening to her.","Therefore, she told Feng Xun, “Not only will he recover, he’ll also be stronger than before, as long as we can find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","Feng Xun said, “I’m on it!”","Feng Wu said, “I remember the Dongsang Kingdom has some leads on the Immortal Spiritual Fruit. You can look into it.”","Feng Xun nodded and left right away.","Inside, Jun Linyuan smirked.","Feng Wu, you’re such a good liar now.","Elder Helian believed anything Feng Wu said now because she was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","He said, “Xiao Wu, why don’t you stay here and keep His Royal Highness company?”","The other three elders weren’t around, and he felt he couldn’t take the responsibility all by himself.","He was concerned about His Royal Highness...","Thump!","They heard something being smashed on the floor.","Feng Wu could tell it was a candlestick.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","Jun Linyuan was the proudest person, and she was probably the last person he wanted to see right now.","If they found the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she could make a Semi-Divine essence pill to activate Jun Linyuan’s energy channels again. His spiritual essence could circulate, and his strength would recover.","What she didn’t say was that Jun Linyuan was in the worst scenario he could be in.","However, he was also very lucky.","Feng Wu had added her heart’s blood when making the enhancement pill, which was why Jun Linyuan’s special bloodline was stirring.","He would notice it when he calmed down.","Feng Wu wasn’t so worried anymore.","She said, “Chen Ziyun told me earlier that I should stay with the current students.”","Elder Helian wasn’t familiar with that arrangement because it was too petty for someone of his status.","He looked at Elder Wu.","Elder Wu nodded. “That’s right. The east wing is occupied by the Military Academy, and we have the west wing.","“Our wing is divided into three areas, the lower, middle, and upper sections.","“The lower section is where the current students live. The middle section is for the graduates, and the upper one is where the generals and lieutenants live.","“To create a sense of competition, the living quarters of the two schools are separated by one passageway that runs from the south to the north.","“That is to say, wherever you stay, you can see the Military Academy students by simply looking across the passageway.","“This way, you can all learn and make progress from the competition.”","A map formed in Feng Wu’s head.","A straight lane running from south to north was separated into three sections. A portal was at the southern end, and the lower section was right next to it. Moving further north were the middle and upper sections. The border was at the northern end.","The most capable cultivators were the closest to the border, probably because they were meant to protect the junior ones."]},{"number":3007,"title":"Chapter 3007 - How Obedient","paragraphs":["Feng Wu nodded. “I’ll go to the lower section for now.”","As for Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu decided to let him calm down first while she searched for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","When she lost her cultivation ability, she shut herself in a room for three days before accepting reality.","She wouldn’t see anybody during those three days, and she knew Jun Linyuan felt the same right now.","He was in much better condition than she was back then.","If he paid attention, he could sense the terrifying bloodline that was dormant inside him.","Hearing Feng Wu walking away, the crown prince punched the wall in frustration.","Thump!","Because he didn’t have any spiritual essence, the punch did very little damage.","Before, that punch would have destroyed the entire upper section, but now, he couldn’t even shake the wall. Instead, he scraped his knuckles on the wall.","He was so frustrated that he threw himself back on his bed.","He could sense the power that was sealed inside his body and was trying to break free, but it couldn’t find an outlet.","He glared at the door, wondering why she had left so soon. She was never so obedient!","He was so mad.","Hmph!","Feng Wu had no idea how the crown prince felt right now.","She could only deduce his reaction based on her own experience.","When she lost her True Phoenix Blood, she wished she were dead. She didn’t want to see anybody and felt everybody was laughing at her.","Therefore, she decided to give Jun Linyuan some privacy.","Little did she know that the crown prince was tossing and turning in bed.","Feng Wu arrived at the lower section.","Somebody rushed toward her before she entered.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!”","It was Chen Ziyun.","He called her name as he ran toward her.","The boy was almost in tears.","He was thrilled to see Feng Wu.","“Xiao Wu, how’s His Royal Highness? Is he alright?” Chen Ziyun asked.","Ever since Feng Wu cut off an enemy’s head and chopped the other one into half, her team members all worshiped her.","Sun Yu and the others came out to greet Feng Wu, too.","There were other students of Class A, but they had been in Peace Grassland for a while, so they didn’t know Feng Wu well.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t tell them Jun Linyuan’s actual condition.","Everybody would panic if they knew the truth.","Feng Wu cleared her throat. “His Royal Highness is doing well. He’ll make a full recovery soon and will be more powerful than before!”","Everybody was exhilarated.","Chen Ziyun said, “We asked around about Night Owl, and they said he wasn’t doing well. Maybe that explosion will kill him in the end.”","The mention of Night Owl’s name made Feng Wu angry.","That man was so ruthless, both to other people and to himself.","Only such a man could defeat the other princes and become the crown prince of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Feng Wu’s eyes glinted.","Night Owl had pissed her off, and she would never forgive him."]},{"number":3008,"title":"Chapter 3008 - Dayless Woods","paragraphs":["Just then, three people arrived.","“Chen Ziyun,” one of them said.","Chen Ziyun turned around and saw he knew two of the three people.","One was Senior Brother Min, who had explained to him how the competition worked.","The other one was Senior Sister Lan, that unfriendly graduate.","He didn’t know the third person, but that person held a sword and behaved rather aloof. However, Senior Sister Lan respected him, and he seemed to think very highly of himself.","Chen Ziyun walked up to them.","He soon came back and asked Feng Wu, “Xiao Wu, they’re holding a hunt. Would you like to join us?”","“A hunt?” Feng Wu’s first reaction was to say no.","She didn’t have that kind of time now.","Chen Ziyun said, “It’s not what you think. We’re hunting the people of the Dongsang Kingdom.”","“What?” Feng Wu was perplexed.","Chen Ziyun said, “We usually go in teams of five. A little to the west of the border is the Dayless Woods.","“Do you remember the arena? It’s in the middle of the borders.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Chen Ziyun said, “To the left of the arena is the vast grassland, and the Dayless Woods is on the right.”","Feng Wu thought about it.","Why did that name sound so familiar? Where had she heard it before?","It sounded like an important name. Feng Wu searched her memory.","Chen Ziyun didn’t notice her reaction and went on with the explanation.","“At the center of the Dayless Woods is an erupting volcano. The crater is small, but the eruption is quite powerful.","“The Dayless Woods is about 6,000 square kilometers in size. Half of it is in the Junwu Empire, and the other half is in the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Six thousand square kilometers was about the size of a city.","“Because it’s a good place to hide, teams of both sides often fight there, ambushing and assassinating one another.","“It’s a great opportunity to win rewards.","“The Dayless Woods is divided into three circles. Current students like us can only stay in the outer circle, but look.”","Chen Ziyun pointed at the three people. “Their previous teammates are injured, and they need more people. If we go with them, we can enter the middle ring.","“Most people fighting there are Spiritual Kings. Xiao Wu, shall we give it a go?”","Feng Wu wasn’t interested in hunting the Dongsang people. After all, she hadn’t been there during the war 14 years ago.","A thought suddenly struck her.","The Dayless Woods!","That name!","She finally remembered where she had heard it.","She had caught five spies in the Secret Essence Mine, and when she interrogated them with her potion, they mentioned the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","That was right!","They had been mumbling a little, but Feng Wu recalled it now.","It was the Dayless Woods!","The second Immortal Spiritual Fruit was in the Dayless Woods!","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She forgot about the living quarters and told Chen Ziyun, “Let’s go to the Dayless Woods right now!”"]},{"number":3009,"title":"Chapter 3009 - We’re Not Going","paragraphs":["The other students envied Feng Wu and Chen Ziyun as they watched them leave.","Sun Yu and the other team members all sighed inwardly.","They had been to Peace Grassland several times, but they weren’t Spiritual Kings yet. Even if they entered the Dayless Woods, they could only stay in the outer ring.","Neither the Junwu Empire nor the Dongsang Kingdom was interested in killing current students.","Maybe the bosses had made some sort of an agreement. One wouldn’t receive any rewards for killing cultivators with much lower cultivation levels. Not only that, their current achievements would also be deducted.","If they lost too many points, their military rankings would drop.","No one would do such things unless they really hated somebody.","It was to protect the current students.","Therefore, current students were mostly ignored in Peace Grassland. Spiritual Kings were the chief fighters during this war.","Feng Wu and her team headed for the Dayless Woods.","There were five of them.","The first one was the short-tempered Senior Sister Lan, a Level 3 Spiritual King.","The second one was the good-natured Senior Brother Min, a Level 2 Spiritual King.","The third one was Chen Ziyun, a Level 1 Spiritual King.","The fourth one was Feng Wu, a peak Level 2 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu was curious when she saw Senior Sister Lan fawning on the proud senior student.","“He’s the only Level 4 Spiritual King on our team,” Chen Ziyun whispered.","Senior Sister Lan frowned when she heard their murmurs.","She turned around, glaring at Feng Wu. “Let me be clear!”","Feng Wu was perplexed.","Senior Sister Lan walked up to Feng Wu and looked down at her. “You’re on this team as an exception. If we weren’t in need of two members, you would never have been allowed to come!”","Feng Wu sighed.","Chen Ziyun didn’t like her tone.","“Senior Sister Lan, Xiao Wu is very capable. Back then, in the arena...”","Senior Sister Lan glared at Feng Wu. “If you hadn’t shown your little tricks in the fights, you wouldn’t be qualified to come with us!","“I didn’t participate in the battle. If I did, you wouldn’t stand a chance!” Senior Sister Lan said arrogantly.","Chen Ziyun was speechless.","It wasn’t like that.","Although Senior Sister Lan was a Spiritual King, she was over 20 years old and couldn’t fight in that battle. Xiao Wu was only 14!","Senior Sister Lan said, “I’m Level 3, and you’re only Level 2. Once we get there, you must follow my instructions!”","Chen Ziyun thought, “Why would a Level 3 Spiritual King brag about herself in front of a peak Level 2 Spiritual King?","“Why is she so arrogant?”","He wanted to talk back to Senior Sister Lan, but Feng Wu tugged at his sleeve and shook her head.","Chen Ziyun decided to stand up for Feng Wu. “Senior Sister Lan, if you’re behaving this way, we won’t go with you.”","Senior Sister Lan found those words idiotic. “Are you sure?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Yes! We’re not going. You can find your own teammates!”","Senior Sister Lan’s face turned livid."]},{"number":3010,"title":"Chapter 3010 - Battle in the Dayless Woods","paragraphs":["The Level 4 senior brother cast a stern look at Senior Sister Lan. “You talk too much!”","Senior Sister Lan immediately stopped talking. She gave Feng Wu a dirty look before going to stand next to the senior brother.","Senior Brother Min tried to mediate. He told Chen Ziyun, “We’ve already entered the outer ring, and you’ve paid your entrance fee. It’ll be such a waste if you go back empty-handed.”","He then lowered his voice and pointed at the unapproachable teenager. “That’s Senior Brother Ying. With his help, we can gain a lot of points. You won’t come across such an opportunity every day.”","Feng Wu was here for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit and couldn’t care less about Senior Sister Lan’s attitude.","She nodded at Chen Ziyun. “Let’s go.”","Hearing that, Chen Ziyun didn’t have any more objections.","However, he decided to follow Feng Wu closely so that Senior Sister Lan wouldn’t disrespect her again.","They headed for the middle ring.","They would run into other students, magical beasts and even assassins of the Dongsang Kingdom from time to time, but Senior Brother Ying ignored all of them. He seemed to have a specific target for this trip.","They marched on without taking any breaks. A few hours later, they finally reached the middle ring.","The deeper they went into the woods, the denser the trees became.","Above them were layers upon layers of canopy.","The leaves blocked out most of the sunlight.","All of a sudden!","Thud!","They heard a small noise nearby.","Senior Brother Ying stopped.","“Who’s there?!”","No one saw how he moved, but when they could see him again, he was holding someone in his hand.","“I’m from the Junwu Empire, too! Don’t kill me!”","It was a familiar voice.","Feng Wu raised her eyebrows. Wasn’t that Sheng Changtian?","As soon as he heard the language of the Junwu Empire and sensed the familiar spiritual essence, Senior Brother Ying threw Senior Brother Ying to the ground. “Why are you sneaking around?”","Poor Sheng Changtian.","He had been so arrogant during the competition against Imperial College.","Senior Brother Ying threw him to the ground like a rag doll, but he didn’t dare say a word.","Four more people showed up before he could do anything.","“Changtian, are you alright?”","“Ying Yuan, how dare you attack a man from the Military Academy?!”","Two people spoke at the same time.","One of them was a pretty fair-skinned girl with big eyes.","The other person’s face had turned livid. Feng Wu could tell he was the most capable member of the team and possibly the team leader.","She was right. That young man was Song Yao, the leader of Sheng Changtian’s team.","Imperial College and Military Academy had always had a competitive relationship.","When fighting the Dongsang Kingdom, they would join hands.","However, when it didn’t concern the Dongsang Kingdom, they would turn on each other.","The two schools weren’t allowed to compete head-on in Peace Grassland, but they were allowed to compete in their military rankings and the rewards they received.","The competition had been quite intense.","Ying Yuan and Song Yao glared at each other."]},{"number":3011,"title":"Chapter 3011 - Is She Here?","paragraphs":["Feng Wu frowned when she saw their reactions. She asked Chen Ziyun, “Do we earn rewards if we defeat the people of the Military Academy?”","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “No. That only happens when we defeat the people of the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Feng Wu said, “Aren’t we here to earn rewards? If we can’t get anything out of a battle, why should we bother to fight? Why don’t we beat each other up in the fortress?”","That was right —","Hearing that, everybody calmed down and no longer wanted to cut their opponent’s throat.","Song Yao glanced at Ying Yuan. “We won’t help you if you run into danger here. Let’s go!”","He led the other four team members into the woods.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Help us? They’ll be the ones who need help!”","Their journey resumed.","Feng Wu observed her surroundings and memorized all the paths they had taken. It was vital that she didn’t lose her way in the woods.","Senior Sister Lan looked back at Feng Wu and smirked.","She told Senior Brother Min, “Do you see what that fool is doing? She’s trying to memorize the routes. Doesn’t she know how complicated the terrain is? No one can remember what paths they’ve taken!”","Senior Brother Min felt embarrassed and didn’t want to reply.","However, Senior Sister Lan wouldn’t stop talking.","“I can’t believe how stupid she is. Doesn’t she know we have a built-in compass in our armband? We can walk out of the Dayless Woods just by following it. Instead, she’s using her brain. She’s hopeless!”","Senior Sister Lan was hostile toward Feng Wu because she was jealous of the girl.","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “What if the armband is broken?”","“Don’t make me laugh! How can it be broken?” Senior Sister Lan found that suggestion idiotic.","Feng Wu asked Chen Ziyun, “Do we have a repair service office for the armbands?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Yes. It’s in the exchange office.”","Feng Wu glanced at Senior Sister Lan, who looked like she was being choked and couldn’t say a word.","Soon, she sneered at Feng Wu. “Only people with low cultivation levels like you will get caught and break your armband. Senior cultivators like us will never let that happen!”","Feng Wu nodded and ignored her.","She already knew how to handle somebody like Senior Sister Lan. They always thought other people were as foolish as they were.","Feng Wu only needed an opportunity to defeat her once and for all.","She didn’t need to waste her spit.","“Look! An essence crystal!” Senior Sister Lan picked up a crystal from a crack in a rock, looking pleasantly surprised. “Look! Lucky!”","Feng Wu looked at the essence crystal.","It was her first time seeing one, and she immediately saw that the essence crystal was denser and purer than spiritual stones.","Meanwhile, in the general’s quarters of the fortress, the crown prince was tossing and turning in bed.","Feng Xun had been eavesdropping outside for a while. Hearing the noise, he decided to pop in and have a look.","What if Boss Jun wanted to kill himself?","Knock, knock, knock —","Feng Xun tapped on the door.","The sulking crown prince suddenly sat up.","Was she back?"]},{"number":3012,"title":"Chapter 3012 - Essence Crystal","paragraphs":["It was too late for her to act like this now!","The crown prince lay back down and threw the blanket over his head.","He wouldn’t forgive her that easily!","Knock, knock, knock —","Hearing no reply, Feng Xun pushed the door open.","Meanwhile, in the Dayless Woods, Chen Ziyun was explaining to Feng Wu, “Essence crystals are more advanced than spiritual stones and can only be found in special locations like Peace Grassland.","“They’re scattered throughout the Dayless Woods. There are very few in the outer ring, and we can find more if we move closer to the center.","“A substance like this can only grow in the Dayless Woods.”","Chen Ziyun pointed at the erupting volcano.","Feng Wu understood what he meant.","That was why the Dayless Woods attracted so many people, and no wonder cultivators always made rapid progress when they came to Peace Grassland.","It wasn’t a surprise that they were all drawn here.","Chen Ziyun said, “Everybody is looking for the essence crystals, including people of the Dongsang Kingdom. People are always dying in these woods.","“The weaker cultivators will stay in the outer ring, while those who think they’re strong enough will go deeper into the woods.","“Everybody gives all they can to look for essence crystals or kill their enemies so that they can get their enemies’ essence crystals.","“When one kills their enemy, they can take the latter’s essence crystals, and the rewards can be turned into points. With enough points, we can rise to a higher military ranking, which gives us access to more cultivation resources and weapons.","“We haven’t graduated yet, but our points still count. If we can accumulate enough points, we can graduate directly or reach a higher military ranking.","“We had a senior brother who rose from being a current student to a captain in the army. It was amazing!”","Senior Sister Lan rolled her eyes.","This Feng Wu didn’t know anything! She was useless!","She needed someone to teach her the most basic thing on the scene!","She was just a pretty face!","Chen Ziyun said, “Xiao Wu, you’re so lucky. I’m sure you’ll find plenty of essence crystals!”","The crown prince was in love with her; no one could be luckier than she was.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Plenty? Do you know how many people leave this place empty-handed?”","Feng Wu gave her a strange look.","Senior Sister Lan stared at her. “Why are you looking at me?”","Feng Wu said, “Can you move aside?”","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “What did you say? For a current student, you’re very bold. How dare you tell me to make way for you?”","Feng Wu frowned and cut her off. “You’re in my way. I need that essence crystal.”","Senior Sister Lan laughed.","“Is this a joke? Let me tell you how rare essence crystals are...”","Before she could finish, Feng Wu crouched down and picked up a stone the size of a fingernail. She asked Chen Ziyun, “Is this an essence crystal?”","Senior Sister Lan laughed.","She couldn’t believe she had such a foolish teammate. Did she just call a random stone an essence crystal?"]},{"number":3013,"title":"Chapter 3013 - Lucky Girl","paragraphs":["Senior Sister Lan almost felt sorry for Feng Wu.","However, Chen Ziyun screamed.","“Ahhh!”","Everybody stared at him.","Senior Sister Lan was furious and smacked him on the head.","“Shut up! Don’t you know where we are? Do you want to tell everybody we’re here?!”","She was right. The Dayless Woods were filled with enemies.","If the people of the Dongsang Kingdom heard them, they could ambush the team and annihilate them.","Senior Sister Lan’s smack nearly knocked Chen Ziyun unconscious.","He finally calmed down, but he still pointed at the small rock in Feng Wu’s hand.","It was covered with mud.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “It’s just a stone. Do you really think that’s an essence crystal?”","When Chen Ziyun wiped away the dirt, the light almost blinded Senior Sister Lan.","“An essence crystal?”","“Gosh! It’s an essence crystal!”","Senior Sister Lan and Senior Brother Min stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","They both shouted out loud, which showed how shocked they were.","Senior Sister Lan was mortified.","She stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You only found a small rock...","“How did you find it?!” She glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said innocently, “I just bent over and picked it up. Is that hard?”","Senior Sister Lan said, “You!”","Chen Ziyun was happy for Feng Wu and handed the essence crystal back to her after wiping it clean. “Put it away. It’s very hard to come back here.","“Someone who stays in the outer ring would consider themself very lucky to find one essence crystal on a trip.","“A cultivator exploring the middle ring usually won’t find more than three essence crystals.","“We just got here, and you’ve found one. You’re the luckiest girl!”","Chen Ziyun couldn’t stop admiring Feng Wu.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “It was just beginner’s luck. She’s not the only one who found an essence crystal!”","She thought,? I found the first essence crystal! I’m the luckiest girl!","Chen Ziyun glanced at Senior Sister Lan and insisted, “Xiao Wu is blessed by the goddess of luck!”","Senior Sister Lan was furious.","She wouldn’t argue with this stupid junior brother.","Reality would teach them a lesson!","Ying Yuan frowned. “Be quiet! We’ll keep moving!”","Ying Yuan was a Level 4 Spiritual King, and Senior Sister Lan immediately stopped talking.","The members were quite friendly when Senior Sister Lan didn’t try to start an argument.","Feng Wu suddenly frowned and moved to the left.","Senior Sister Lan lost her temper when she saw that Feng Wu wasn’t following the path. “You idiot! Didn’t you hear us? You’re slowing us down!”","However, Feng Wu started digging with a dagger.","Before Senior Sister Lan could say anything, Feng Wu picked up another small black stone."]},{"number":3014,"title":"Chapter 3014 - Such a Girl","paragraphs":["A little black rock?","Senior Sister Lan frowned at Feng Wu. “It’s just a dirty little rock!”","Chen Ziyun wiped the mud off the rock.","Senior Sister Lan was speechless.","It was another essence crystal!","Senior Sister Lan was astonished.","She always saw Feng Wu as just a pretty face and couldn’t believe she could be so lucky.","Even Ying Yuan, who had remained indifferent until now, looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","When Feng Wu met his gaze, he abruptly turned his head and looked away, pretending not to notice her.","His ears turned pink.","The stunning girl had given him a lot of pressure, but he still managed to maintain a nonchalant demeanor.","Because everybody was focusing on Feng Wu, no one noticed Ying Yuan’s strange behavior.","Ying Yuan only stole another glimpse at Feng Wu when Senior Sister Lan talked to her.","Senior Sister Lan’s eyes were wide open.","She stared at Feng Wu. “How did you know it was an essence crystal?”","Feng Wu said innocently, “I got lucky, I guess?”","Senior Sister Lan found that excuse acceptable.","She smirked. “You have some luck, I’ll give you that, but that’s it!","“You can’t count on just luck. It’ll leave you at your happiest moment!”","Senior Sister Lan was jealous of Feng Wu, but she couldn’t tell what she was jealous about.","Nothing about Feng Wu seemed right.","Her mere existence offended Senior Sister Lan.","Chen Ziyun was annoyed. “Senior Sister Lan, why do I feel you’re targeting Xiao Wu?”","He decided to call her “Xiao Wu” while he still could. Once they returned, the crown prince wouldn’t want to hear that.","Senior Sister Lan couldn’t believe her ears. “Targeting her? Chen Ziyun, are you blind? Who the hell does she think she is? Why should I be jealous of her? Are you saying she’s better than me?”","Chen Ziyun nodded without hesitation. “Yes!”","Senior Brother Min burst out laughing.","Senior Sister Lan threw a dirty look at him.","Senior Brother Min had always been scared of Senior Sister Lan, so he immediately turned to the other side.","If one looked closely, one would see his shoulders shaking with silent laughter.","Senior Sister Lan glowered at Chen Ziyun.","“Why do you say she’s better than me?” She pressed him for an answer.","Cheng Ziyun was about to tell the truth, when Ying Yuan said grimly, “Keep shouting at each other if you want to die here.”","Everybody stopped talking.","Senior Sister Lan thought,? Ying Yuan is still on my side. As for Chen Ziyun, I’ll make him pay for this!","Ying Yuan cast a stern look at Senior Sister Lan, finding her such a troublemaker.","His gaze briefly landed on Feng Wu’s face before he awkwardly looked away again. His tone softened a little.","“Let’s go.”","He was the first to set out.","Senior Sister Lan quickly followed him.","Ying Yuan glanced at her, feeling disappointed.","Senior Sister Lan didn’t know what he was thinking. She smiled at him and said, “It was all my fault. I shouldn’t have let such a girl join our team. Let’s ignore her!”","“Such a girl?” Ying Yuan frowned."]},{"number":3015,"title":"Chapter 3015 - Targeted","paragraphs":["Chapter 3015: Targeted","Senior Sister Lan deliberately raised her voice so that the others could hear her.","“Lucky won’t change the fact that she’s a weakling!","“A Level 2 Spiritual King isn’t worth mentioning in this team. She’s so ignorant!”","Senior Sister Lan glanced back at Feng Wu as she spoke.","Chen Ziyun almost lost his temper right there and then.","Nobody responded, and Senior Sister Lan was displeased.","She needed somebody to chime in, but nobody would back her up. As a result, she only looked like a bully who was picking on Feng Wu for no reason.","How awkward.","Senior Sister Lan glared at Senior Brother Min, but his eyes darted around and he wouldn’t meet her gaze.","Senior Sister Lan was shocked.","Feng Wu suddenly frowned and warned the others, “Watch out.”","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Feng Wu said, “Some assassins are coming from the northeast. They’re from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Senior Sister Lan looked at Senior Brother Ying, who shook his head.","Senior Sister Lan assumed an arrogant demeanor and glared at Feng Wu. “Can you stop acting? Making yourself the center of attention won’t help you with your popularity! We’ll only find you annoying!”","“Watch out!”","Feng Wu ignored Senior Sister Lan. Grabbing Chen Ziyun and Senior Brother Min with each hand, she dragged them behind a tree.","Thump!","The attackers came from the northeast.","Senior Brother Ying’s sword clashed with the attacker’s, sending sparks flying everywhere.","There were two attackers, and both were exceptionally capable.","One was a Level 4 Spiritual King like Senior Brother Ying, and the other one was a peak Level 3 Spiritual King.","His target was Feng Wu, who had become well-known in the Dongsang Kingdom because of her achievements in the battle.","Even Feng Wu herself didn’t know the price on her head at the moment.","Because Feng Wu dodged in time, the assassin charged at Senior Sister Lan instead.","Senior Sister Lan reacted in time and tilted her head.","The blade still brushed past her head and scraped off her hair.","She only had half a head of hair now.","Senior Sister Lan hadn’t noticed what had happened to her. She only turned around and stared at the assassin in astonishment.","When she touched her head, she couldn’t believe what had happened.","“Where’s my hair?!”","She was so furious that she charged at the assassin.","The assassin was equally frustrated.","His target wasn’t this sword-wielding woman. He wanted Feng Wu’s head to claim the reward!","However, Senior Sister Lan was frantically attacking him, and he had to fight back.","It was a fierce battle.","Feng Wu was struck by a thought when she saw the assassin giving her quick glances all the time.","Could it be —","Right at that moment, an arrow was shot in Feng Wu’s direction.","She was the target!","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched, and she finally realized where the strange feeling came from.","She was their mark.","Senior Sister Lan hadn’t realized it, but Feng Wu was very certain.","She dodged the arrow and sprang off, running after the person who shot the arrow at her."]},{"number":3016,"title":"Chapter 3016 - Lead on the Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["Chapter 3016: Lead on the Immortal Spiritual Fruit","Feng Wu sprang off.","The arrow was shot by a Dongsang teenage girl. She smirked maliciously when she saw Feng Wu coming at her.","“She’s just a Spiritual King. Does she have a death wish or something?”","She pointed her bow at Feng Wu’s face and shot three arrows in a row.","However, Feng Wu moved faster than the girl could imagine.","The next moment, Feng Wu stepped on the arrows and landed in front of her.","“You!”","Feng Wu put a dagger to the girl’s throat.","“Am I your mark?” Feng Wu smirked.","The girl struggled but to no avail.","She glared at Feng Wu and ground her teeth. “Kill me now!”","Feng Wu asked, “Why am I your target?”","The girl snorted. “You’re a wanted woman.","“Feng Wu, a Level 2 Spiritual King. Your head is worth a thousand points. You’re very valuable.” The girl glared at Feng Wu. “I’ve told you what you want to know. Let go of me!”","Feng Wu suddenly asked, “Have you heard of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?”","“The Immortal Spiritual Fruit?” The girl stared at Feng Wu. “Are you looking for it? Do you think I’ll tell you?”","Feng Wu said, “You know, then.”","The girl said, “I’d rather die than tell you anything!”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I won’t kill you. You’re going to tell me what I need to know.”","The girl didn’t believe her.","When Feng Wu injected the truth serum into the girl’s neck, the girl panicked.","“Let go of me! What are you doing?!”","Feng Wu had enhanced the truth serum, and it took effect much more quickly than before. In less than a minute, the girl turned red and drooled, unable to control herself.","Feng Wu pressed the girl to a tree.","“Your name.”","“Doya.”","“Your target.”","“Kill Feng Wu. Claim the reward.”","Feng Wu stared at her. “Tell me everything you know.”","The girl bit her lip but couldn’t resist in the end. “The crown prince is looking for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit to treat his condition.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “The crown prince? As in Night Owl?”","Doya nodded. “He’s lost some ability. Needs the Immortal Spiritual Fruit...”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","A thought struck her.","During the battle between Jun Linyuan and Night Owl, the latter turned himself into a bomb at the last moment.","At first, Feng Wu thought he wanted to kill Jun Linyuan at the price of his own life, but it occurred to her now that Night Owl probably knew he could find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit in the Dayless Woods. He might even know the exact location.","That was why he chose to self-detonate. He wanted to kill Jun Linyuan and use the Immortal Spiritual Fruit to recover his strength.","Feng Wu was even angrier now.","That Night Owl was abominable!","Doya ground her teeth and glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Not many people would know about Night Owl’s plan. How do you know it? What’s your relationship with him?”","“I... I...” Doya didn’t want to tell her, but she couldn’t control her mind.","“I’m Mu Yan’s maid. I won’t tell you...”"]},{"number":3017,"title":"Chapter 3017 - I’ll Keep Them","paragraphs":["Chapter 3017: I’ll Keep Them","Doya smashed her head against a tree.","Feng Wu didn’t stop her, and the girl killed herself.","Feng Wu knew the Dongsang people could easily go to extremes, and it wasn’t uncommon that they would try to prove their devotion by taking their own lives.","Chen Ziyun and the others arrived.","Feng Wu asked, “Did you kill them?”","The others were speechless.","Chen Ziyun said, “No. They got away.”","Feng Wu frowned. “How did that happen?”","She had learned from Doya that she was the target of the assassins.","Now that they had escaped, they were probably assembling more people for the next attack.","Senior Sister Lan glared at Feng Wu. “Who do you think we are? We can’t defeat a Dongsang cultivator at the same cultivation level as us! They have much better weapons! If you don’t know that, keep your mouth shut! You’re only making yourself look like a fool!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Chen Ziyun saw a person who had fallen on the ground, and he went to examine her.","“She’s dead!” Chen Ziyun raised his eyebrows when he saw Doya’s epaulet. “She’s a major! She has to be a Level 3 Spiritual King.”","He then asked deliberately, “Xiao Wu, you killed her, didn’t you? You killed an enemy above your cultivation level again!”","Again.","He was reminding Senior Sister Lan that Feng Wu had killed a Level 3 Spiritual King during the battle. She was also a Level 3 Spiritual King, so she should stop using that condescending tone.","Feng Wu didn’t deny it.","Although Doya had killed herself, she wouldn’t have stood a chance in a battle against Feng Wu.","Senior Sister Lan wanted to say something, but she felt a chill run down her spine when she saw the Dongsang girl’s bloody head.","She gave Feng Wu an indignant look but didn’t say another word.","Chen Ziyun removed Doya’s badge and put it in Feng Wu’s backpack.","He then opened Doya’s bag. Apart from food and water, there was something else.","“Essence crystals!” Chen Ziyun cried out. “She was quite a wealthy girl. There are five in her bag!”","A major had to be extremely lucky to bring five essence crystals out of these woods.","Senior Sister Lan was so jealous that her eyes turned red.","“Let me have a look!”","Senior Sister Lan snatched the essence crystals from Chen Ziyun.","She examined them, hoping they were fake, but not only were they genuine, they also had a high purity level. They couldn’t be fake.","Senior Sister Lan was furious.","She couldn’t understand why Feng Wu was so lucky.","She had killed an enemy with a higher cultivation level and found these essence crystals. Not only that, she was also so pretty!","How could she have everything?","She never competed with other people, but she was better than all of them.","Senior Sister Lan threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. “What a poser!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She couldn’t understand how she had offended this senior sister, but she couldn’t bring herself to lower herself to Senior Sister Lan’s level.","Senior Brother Ying cast a stern look at Senior Sister Lan. “Can you be quiet for a minute?”","Senior Sister Lan almost burst into tears.","She couldn’t understand why she was always the one getting the blame.","Frustrated, she glowered at Chen Ziyun. “I’ll keep the essence crystals for now!”"]},{"number":3018,"title":"Chapter 3018 - Your Hair","paragraphs":["Chapter 3018: Your Hair","Chen Ziyun glared at her. “Why should you keep them?”","Senior Sister Lan said, “We’re a team. Of course we’ll share the rewards we obtained in battle.”","Chen Ziyun said, “But...”","Senior Sister Lan said, “If we hadn’t stalled the two assassins, do you think Feng Wu could have killed this one? Do you?!”","Chen Ziyun wanted to say yes but wasn’t confident enough.","He was still hesitating when Senior Sister Lan sneered at him. “Senior Brother Ying is the most capable member of this team, and he should be the one to keep the reward, but carrying too many things on him will slow him down in battles. Hence, as the second-best member of this team, I’ll keep them.”","Senior Sister Lan then tried to put the essence crystals in her bag.","Chen Ziyun wouldn’t let her.","He grabbed the essence crystals and wouldn’t let go.","He knew if Senior Sister Lan took hold of the essence crystals, Xiao Wu would never get them back.","Senior Sister Lan was furious when she saw that Chen Ziyun wouldn’t obey her.","No one would take her orders now!","She decided to show these people her authority in this team.","However, Senior Brother Ying glanced at her. “Are you ever going to stop?”","Senior Sister Lan was shocked.","Senior Brother Ying stole a glance at Feng Wu before staring at Senior Sister Lan. “If I were you, I would take care of your hair first.”","He glanced at Feng Wu again.","Senior Sister Lan followed his gaze to Feng Wu’s beautiful hair and stunning beauty. She was shocked.","Even someone as aloof as Ying Yuan couldn’t resist a pretty girl.","Senior Sister Lan thought she was going to explode.","She had always thought Senior Brother Ying was on her side. However, he had just taken Feng Wu’s side.","“All you can see is her pretty face!” Senior Sister Lan snorted. “She’s only a Level 2 Spiritual King. If I didn’t give her a chance, she would never have been able to join us!”","Feng Wu frowned at Senior Sister Lan and decided it was time to teach the letter a lesson.","But right at that moment!","“Watch out!”","Senior Brother Ying cried out.","Feng Wu reacted in time, too. She dragged Chen Ziyun and Senior Brother Min to stand behind her and drew her Fallen Star Sword.","There were many more enemies this time.","Nine!","Feng Wu glanced at the group of people and saw that they were all Level 3 Spiritual Kings, though none of them was under 20 years old.","If one became a Level 3 Spiritual King before one was 20, one had great potential.","Seeing how capable all nine assassins were, Senior Sister Lan was scared out of her wits.","They had met groups like this before, but they always fled before they were noticed.","These nine people were obviously targeting them.","There was a course in Class A at Imperial College called “basic conversational Dongsang.”","The Dongsang Kingdom probably had a similar course.","Therefore, both sides could understand a little bit of the other side’s language.","“Die!”","The Dongsang Kingdom’s people charged at Feng Wu.","Two of them approached Senior Sister Lan.","Senior Sister Lan was so flustered that she thought her heart would stop beating.","Two Level 3 Spiritual Kings!","How was she supposed to fight them?","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Everybody was fighting everybody at the same time.","There was only the sound of blows being exchanged, and no one spoke.","Whenever the people of the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom met, they would always try to cut each other’s throats.","Feng Wu knew..."]},{"number":3019,"title":"Chapter 3019 - Who Is That?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3019: Who Is That?","Feng Wu knew this battle wasn’t like what she had experienced so far.","She had to give it her all and kill them all.","Otherwise, if they leaked the news, more people would come here to kill her.","“Ah!”","Feng Wu heard a scream.","Turning around, she saw Chen Ziyun’s right arm cut open by a sword, and blood gushed out.","Feng Wu frowned.","Chen Ziyun had been kind to her and had run around for her ever since they met.","Feng Wu could stand it when other people were unkind to her. She could always stop enduring them and get back at them for what they did.","However, she felt uneasy when other people treated her nicely. She would remember how they had helped her and would make sure she returned the favor. Otherwise, she would feel guilty.","Therefore, she was furious when she saw that Chen Ziyun was injured.","A Level 3 Spiritual King was staring at her with a malicious grin.","He said, “What a nice chick.”","Before he could continue, Feng Wu leaped into the air and struck him with her sword.","The blade cut his head open as if it was a watermelon.","The Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom were enemies.","In this battle, only one side could survive.","Feng Wu didn’t stop there.","Senior Brother Ying was surrounded by five enemies, so he hadn’t noticed Feng Wu’s battle.","Five Level 3 Spiritual Kings made a formidable force.","Senior Brother Ying wasn’t their match and was already suffering many injuries.","“They are the two assassins from earlier! Run!”","Senior Brother Ying was surrounded and knew he couldn’t defeat his enemies, so he shouted at Feng Wu. “Don’t fight them! Run! Get out of here!”","He wasn’t a particularly selfless person, but when he saw the assassins charging at Feng Wu, he ran toward her, trying to stop the Level 3 Spiritual Kings.","The assassins knew he was the most capable member of the team, so they all came at him.","They thought if they took him down, they would win the battle.","Senior Brother Ying was also fighting a Level 4 Spiritual King.","It was so hopeless.","Senior Sister Lan panicked.","She couldn’t exert her real capability and was losing ground.","She wanted to flee, but she slipped and fell.","Gosh!","Her head went blank.","I’m gonna die!","She saw the assassin raise his saber and strike down at her head.","She lost all strength and couldn’t move a muscle.","She wanted to dodge but was scared out of her wits.","At that critical moment, someone dashed toward her.","She swung her sword when she ran past Senior Sister Lan.","Yes.","Senior Sister Lan saw the person’s shadow on the ground and saw the casual movement of her hand.","The next moment, the assassin raising his saber no longer had a head.","What the hell?","Senior Sister Lan looked up and saw the head falling toward her and smashing into her face.","His mouth fell on hers.","!!!","Senior Sister Lan fell back in fear, and the head fell into her arms.","!!!","She was so scared that she was almost in tears.","Who was her savior?"]},{"number":3020,"title":"Chapter 3020 - Shocked","paragraphs":["Chapter 3020: Shocked","When Senior Sister Lan looked up, she was shocked by what she saw.","That person was...","“No, it can’t be. Something must have gone wrong!","“How can it be Feng Wu?!”","Senior Sister Lan was so astonished that she forgot what was in her hands until she looked down and saw the head.","She screamed again, but nobody cared about her.","They were all busy fighting.","Chen Ziyun and Senior Brother Min were the less capable members of the team, but they were fighting as hard as they could. Their clothes were spotted with blood.","Senior Sister Lan didn’t stand up because her legs had given in.","She looked at Senior Brother Ying, who was fighting a short distance away.","She couldn’t believe her eyes.","Surely, she was dreaming.","That was the only explanation for seeing Feng Wu wielding her Fallen Star Sword. She only knew three stances, but she cut off one head after another.","One, two, three...","There was one on the ground and one in her arms.","Five men had lost their heads, and Feng Wu killed all of them!","Senior Sister Lan trembled uncontrollably.","Oh god!","Was that really Feng Wu?","Feng Wu felt her gaze, so she looked over her shoulder at Senior Sister Lan, and that glance scared Senior Sister Lan out of her wits.","“It really is her!”","Only Senior Sister Lan could describe her feelings.","Feng Wu moved fast and killed even faster.","Before long, the only ones left were the Level 4 Spiritual King and the Level 3 one who was fighting Chen Ziyun.","Senior Brother Ying was completely blown away.","He had been under a lot of pressure at first.","He had been stabbed a few times and could be killed within seconds.","However, Feng Wu showed up, and everything changed.","He was very certain that Feng Wu was as capable as he was.","She was supposed to be a Level 2 Spiritual King!","Senior Brother Ying felt both frustrated and awed.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu stared at the Level 4 Spiritual King and smirked.","She deliberately made a mistake in her movements.","The assassin saw his chance, smirked, and ran out of Feng Wu’s attack range like an eel. He soon disappeared into the woods.","He smirked while running away. “We’ll be back!”","Senior Brother Ying wanted to go after him, but Feng Wu beat him to it.","Senior Brother Ying was about to follow them when Senior Sister Lan shouted, “Chen Ziyun, watch out!”","Senior Brother Ying looked in Chen Ziyun’s direction.","When he looked for Feng Wu and the assassin again, they were nowhere to be found.","Senior Brother Ying cast a stern look at Senior Sister Lan.","Senior Sister Lan cried, “Senior Brother Ying, please help us! We can’t hold them back anymore!”","“I hope Feng Wu can come back soon!” Senior Brother Ying sighed inwardly. He had to help Chen Ziyun and the others.","With Senior Brother Ying’s help, the Level 3 Spiritual King wasn’t going anywhere.","Seeing that he would be caught, the man stabbed his saber into his stomach.","He would rather die than become a captive.","That was how proud the men of Dongsang were."]},{"number":3021,"title":"Chapter 3021 - Suicide Mission","paragraphs":["Chapter 3021: Suicide Mission","Senior Brother Ying had seen many Dongsang men do that before, so he only frowned and didn’t make a comment.","“Where’s Xiao Wu?”","Chen Ziyun rushed over and looked around. He was frightened out of his wits when he couldn’t find Feng Wu anywhere.","Senior Sister Lan snorted. “That assassin escaped, and she went after him.","“Don’t look at me like that. She wanted to chase him. I didn’t do anything.” Senior Sister Lan didn’t sound very confident.","Senior Brother Ying hadn’t been able to follow Feng Wu because Senior Sister Lan had distracted him.","“Which direction?” Chen Ziyun was still bleeding.","Senior Sister Lan said grumpily, “Why do you want to know? It’s not like you’ll go after them.”","Chen Ziyun ignored her and turned to Senior Brother Ying. “Which way did Xiao Wu go?”","Senior Brother Ying bit his lip. He knew what Chen Ziyun wanted to do but still gave him the direction.","Chen Ziyun dashed off without hesitation.","Senior Sister Lan was astonished.","She watched Chen Ziyun leave in disbelief. “Is he an idiot? He’s so weak and has been injured. Why did he go to look for Feng Wu?","“Doesn’t he know the woods is full of assassins? He could be killed!”","Senior Brother Ying glanced at her. “Do you think he didn’t know that?”","Senior Sister Lan looked at him in astonishment.","Senior Brother Ying said, “He knew that, but he still went. He’s a braver man than me.”","Senior Sister Lan said, “He’s a fool!”","Was he? Senior Brother Ying smiled bitterly. He envied and admired Chen Ziyun for what he did.","Feng Wu ran after the assassin.","When the Level 4 Spiritual King looked over his shoulder, his eyes lit up.","Only one person was chasing him, and it was the pretty Level 2 girl!","Ha!","He stopped running, turned around, and charged at Feng Wu.","There was a price on her head.","Only junior and intermediate Spiritual Kings could enter this area. The senior ones had been taken to another battlefield.","The assassin thought he could catch Feng Wu without breaking a sweat.","To his surprise, Feng Wu was swifter than he thought.","She dodged the attack and drew out the Fallen Star Sword.","They exchanged dozens of blows within seconds.","The assassin was shocked.","What?!","He was a Level 4 Spiritual King, and she was only at Level 2.","Why couldn’t he defeat her?","He was trying to figure it out when...","WHAT?!","He stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","She made a breakthrough right in front of him.","She rose from a peak Level 2 Spiritual King to a Level 3 Spiritual King!","He couldn’t believe what had happened.","Who was she?!","“You!” The assassin stared at Feng Wu. “This can’t be happening!”","Their battle had been a draw when she was a Level 2. Now that they were only one level apart, Feng Wu immediately gained the upper hand.","Fallen Star Sword sealed the deal.","“Ground Control!","The assassin had turned around to capture Feng Wu, but he became the captive instead.","It was practically a suicide mission."]},{"number":3022,"title":"Chapter 3022 - Blood Is the Medicine","paragraphs":["Chapter 3022: Blood Is the Medicine","The blade slid across the assassin’s neck.","Blood splashed on the ground.","Feng Wu smiled at him, and the assassin shuddered.","He turned to run, but he only made two steps before the Fallen Star Sword made another cut on his throat.","The first cut was horizontal, and this one was vertical. The two cuts made a cross on his neck.","He panicked.","The blood gushed out, and he couldn’t get away.","He wanted to stab himself with his sword.","Feng Wu saw it coming and immediately kicked away the weapon. She also dislocated his joints and jaw.","She wouldn’t let him die so easily.","“You...”","The assassin lay on his stomach. He turned his head to glare at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smirked.","“I know you’re here to kill me to claim the prize.” Feng Wu crouched down and grinned at him.","“You...”","The assassin’s mouth was full of blood. He wanted to bite off his tongue but couldn’t.","“Do you want me to put your jaw back?” Feng Wu smiled. “That’s not easy, but it’s doable.","“Have you heard of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?” Feng Wu asked.","She was asking everybody about the fruit.","She knew this assassin had appeared at the same time as Doya. Since Doya was Mu Yan’s maid, this assassin should be working for her, too.","His eyes glinted when he heard the fruit’s name, but he immediately calmed down.","What a pity.","Feng Wu was watching him closely, and he couldn’t hide anything.","“You’ve heard about that fruit, haven’t you?”","“No!” The assassin denied it.","Feng Wu put a large leaf on the ground, sat on it, and took out a bottle of truth serum.","“Taro, it’s time to take your medicine.”","Feng Wu grinned.","“How do you know my name?!” The assassin could speak the Junwu Empire’s language well.","Feng Wu only said that name as a joke.","Once the truth serum was used on Taro, he had to tell Feng Wu everything he knew.","Other people wouldn’t understand it because he was speaking his own language now.","“Immortal Spiritual Fruit... No...","“In the central area...","“Miss Mu Yan... collecting it...","“For the crown prince...","“You’re wanted...","“Your blood is our medicine...”","Feng Wu frowned.","“Why is my blood a medicine?” She stared at Taro.","“Divine Phoenix Blood...","“Miss Mu Yan says... Change your blood...”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","That was why all these people were coming after her.","Somebody had told the Dongsang Kingdom about her Divine Phoenix Blood!","Who could it be?","She had come here on short notice, and most people in Peace Grassland didn’t know she had the Divine Phoenix Blood.","Even Elder Helian might not know.","How did the Dongsang Kingdom know? Who leaked the information?","A thought struck Feng Wu.","Could it be her?"]},{"number":3023,"title":"Chapter 3023 - Level 3 Spiritual King","paragraphs":["Chapter 3023: Level 3 Spiritual King","“Who told you about my Divine Phoenix Blood?” Feng Wu stared at Taro.","Taro didn’t want to tell her, but the truth serum was too potent.","His throat trembled, and he eventually said, “I don’t know... A girl from Junwu... Shan...”","Shan Jingfei?","Feng Wu had expected to hear Zuo Qingluan’s name, but it turned out to be Shan Jingfei.","Zuo Qingluan must have told Shan Jingfei what happened, and Shan Jingfei leaked the information to the Dongsang Kingdom.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","Jun Linyuan could give his life away for this empire, but these women had sided with their enemy because of their jealousy!","D*mn them!","“Where’s Mu Yan?” Feng Wu asked the most important question.","Taro shook his head and fell silent.","He was dead.","She couldn’t get any more information out of him.","Just then, she heard footsteps coming from a short distance away.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!”","It was Chen Ziyun.","He rushed to her side as soon as he spotted her. “Are you alright?!”","He then noticed the dead Level 4 Spiritual King.","What a shock!","Chen Ziyun was too astonished to speak.","“He...” Chen Ziyun pointed at the man who had bled to death.","He was the Level 4 Spiritual King who had almost slaughtered them!","He didn’t cover his face, so it was easy to recognize him.","Feng Wu said, “He’s dead.”","Chen Ziyun stared at her. “Did you...”","Feng Wu nodded. “I killed him.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Aren’t you a Level 2 Spiritual King?”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Are you sure about that?”","Chen Ziyun said, “OMG. Are you Level 3 now?!”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Chen Ziyun couldn’t believe it.","It had been minutes since they parted, and she made a breakthrough again!","Who was this girl?!","Chen Ziyun already thought very highly of Feng Wu, but she could still surprise him.","What could he do?","Nothing.","Seeing that Chen Ziyun’s arms were bleeding, Feng Wu gave him a bottle of pills. “Take this, and smear something on your wounds. You can keep the rest since you seem to be prone to injuries.”","Chen Ziyun was shocked again when he saw the pills.","They were Supreme Level pills!","Supreme Level!","He then remembered Feng Wu was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, and understood why she could give away Supreme Level pills.","She was such a great patron!","The tiniest thing she gave him was worth bragging about for the rest of his life.","Chen Ziyun was mortified when he remembered he used to be her team leader. However, he was thick-skinned enough to accept that fact.","Chen Ziyun soon took care of his wounds.","The next moment, he ran to Feng Wu’s side. “Boss Feng Wu, he was a commander. He’s quite valuable!”","Chen Ziyun took out Taro’s badge and put it in Feng Wu’s backpack. He then opened Taro’s bag.","“Jackpot!” Chen Ziyun’s eyes lit up."]},{"number":3024,"title":"Chapter 3024 - Points","paragraphs":["Chapter 3024: Points","There were 15 essence crystals in that bag.","“It’s true. The higher the risk, the higher the return!” Chen Ziyun took out the essence crystals and wanted to put them in Feng Wu’s bag, but Feng Wu shook her head.","Not only that, she also took out Doya’s badge and essence crystals before handing them to Chen Ziyun.","“What are you doing?” Chen Ziyun was perplexed.","Feng Wu said, “I haven’t graduated yet. They were right when they said I was only able to come here because of the senior members of the team.","“Therefore, all the essence crystals and badges should be considered rewards for the whole team.” Feng Wu stuffed everything in Chen Ziyun’s bag.","Chen Ziyun’s eyes widened. “Do you know how many points these things are worth?”","Feng Wu didn’t.","“To become a major, you need 6,000 points, and a lieutenant colonel needs 36,000 points.","“One major’s badge is worth 600 points, and a lieutenant colonel’s is worth 3,600 points.","“You can keep the essence crystals for your cultivation or exchange them for points. Each one is worth 100 points.","“You have one major’s and one lieutenant colonel’s badge, and 22 essence crystals. They’re worth 6,400 points in total. You can become a major!”","It was very hard for ordinary people to obtain a higher military ranking, but Feng Wu was very capable, though a lieutenant colonel was too expensive.","If Feng Wu went all out, she could become a major.","Here in Peace Grassland, one’s military ranking could determine the type of cultivation resources they could get and the level of the teams they could join. With a higher ranking, one had a higher chance of survival.","Therefore, no one ever gave away their points.","“You found these on your own. They won’t say anything even if you keep them.” Chen Ziyun felt sorry for her.","Feng Wu shook her head. “They’re just things. I don’t want to owe anybody anything. Just share them among the team members.”","She then said, “You should go with them. It’s getting too dangerous for you to stay here.”","She knew she was the assassins’ target.","If she went with her team, she would only endanger their lives.","She decided to go on her own.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know her plan. He still wanted to say something, when Feng Wu shook her head. “You should leave. I’m going to the central area to find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","Feng Wu patted Chen Ziyun’s shoulder and ran out of sight.","The central area?","Chen Ziyun felt his hair stand up.","Gosh!","The central area?!","He had no choice but to return to his team.","Senior Sister Lan was astonished to see him.","“You’re alive!","“Where’s Feng Wu?","“She’s not dead, is she?”","Chen Ziyun glared at her. “Are you blind or stupid? Didn’t you see Xiao Wu kill all those assassins?","“If it wasn’t for her, you wouldn’t still have a head on your neck. Wake up!”","“You!” Senior Sister Lan didn’t know what to say.","Chen Ziyun said, “How could Xiao Wu be killed? She’s more powerful than a Level 4 Spiritual King!”"]},{"number":3025,"title":"Chapter 3025 - I Give Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 3025: I Give Up","“I don’t believe you!” Senior Sister Lan snorted.","“See for yourself!” Chen Ziyun took out his backpack and showed them the badges and essence crystals.","“So many?” Senior Sister Lan frowned. “Where did this lieutenant colonel’s badge come from?”","Chen Ziyun sneered at her. “Where do you think?”","Senior Sister Lan seemed to have realized something but didn’t want to admit it. “How am I supposed to know?”","Chen Ziyun wouldn’t let her evade the question.","He smirked. “Of course you don’t. Xiao Wu found it. She killed that Level 4 Spiritual King assassin!”","Senior Sister Lan stared at Chen Ziyun and wanted to refute him, but when she recalled how easily Feng Wu had killed those assassins, she ground her teeth.","“So, she’s finally willing to let other people keep her things?” Senior Sister Lan smirked.","Chen Ziyun glanced at her. “Xiao Wu said she didn’t want any of the 6,400 points. She’s giving everything to our team.”","Senior Sister Lan wouldn’t believe him. “She can’t be that generous.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Suit yourself. Xiao Wu is going her own way. From now on, she’ll keep all the rewards to herself.”","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “Fine, she’s the generous one. I’d like to see how she’ll get back alive.”","Chen Ziyun handed her a piece of paper.","“What’s this?” Senior Sister Lan frowned at him.","Chen Ziyun said, “You go back on your word a lot, so we’d better put it on paper.”","“You!” Senior Sister Lan was furious. “Do you not believe me?”","Other people would have said no, but Chen Ziyun nodded. “Yes, I don’t believe you.”","Senior Brother Min almost burst out laughing.","He only wiped the smile off his face when Senior Sister Lan glared at him.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “You’re worried that I’ll ask Feng Wu to share her badges and essence crystals, aren’t you?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Yes!”","Senior Sister Lan took a deep breath. “I can’t wait to see how many points she can earn. I’ll sign it, and I’ll make sure to spread the word around when I get back!”","By that, she meant she would slander Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun chuckled. “Senior Sister Lan, I wouldn’t do that if I were you.”","Feng Wu’s patron was far beyond the reach of a Level 3 Spiritual King.","Senior Sister Lan signed her name and ignored Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun asked both Senior Brother Ying and Senior Brother Min to sign it just to be sure.","Senior Brother Min asked, “I feel like I’m taking advantage of Feng Wu.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Just sign it.”","He felt Feng Wu would surprise everybody this time!","Senior Brother Ying picked up the pen and gave Chen Ziyun a long look.","“I give up the points.” Senior Brother Ying then added, “Feng Wu earned all the badges and essence crystals. I, Ying Yuan, am willing to give up on these points.”","Chen Ziyun felt Senior Brother Ying to be a much nicer person than Senior Sister Lan.","He wouldn’t give up on the points. Otherwise, Senior Sister Lan would take them all.","Senior Sister Lan glared at Chen Ziyun. “Why are you looking at me like that?”"]},{"number":3026,"title":"Chapter 3026 - Dragon Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 3026: Dragon Phoenix Blood","Chen Ziyun said, “Senior Brother Ying has waived his rights.”","Senior Sister Lan said angrily, “Are you saying I should give up my rights, too?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Senior Brother Ying fought for us. What did you do? Feng Wu had to save you from the assassins. What did you say about her just then? Are you really going to take a share of her prize?”","Senior Sister Lan was furious.","“Alright! I give up!” Senior Sister Lan signed the paper. “Whatever Feng Wu finds later will have nothing to do with me! If I make trouble for her because of that, may lightning strike me to death!”","Senior Sister Lan sounded very determined.","Chen Ziyun said, “Well, thank you very much.”","Senior Sister Lan said, “You can save your energy for praying for Feng Wu!”","She didn’t think Feng Wu could survive the trip on her own.","In the fortress’s general’s quarters, the crown prince had a grumpy look on his face.","Feng Xun gave him a tentative glance and racked his brain.","Boss Jun didn’t seem happy.","“Boss Jun, are you hungry? How about...” He moved closer, grinning at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince glanced at him, then looked away, showing no emotion.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","Why did Boss Jun make him feel like an idiot?","“Boss Jun, you have to eat something,” Feng Xun said patiently. “You can’t go months without eating like before. You were much more capable then...”","Feng Xun stopped abruptly, realizing what he had said.","The crown prince gave him a grim look.","Feng Xun was rendered speechless.","He wanted to run away.","“How about I fetch Feng Wu?” Feng Xun tried to find a scapegoat.","This time, the crown prince stopped staring at him.","So, getting Feng Wu back here was an option.","Feng Xun asked gingerly, “Shall I go get her now?”","He backed away as he spoke.","He quickly opened the door and shut it behind him.","There was no yelling.","Until now, the crown prince had been shouting at him.","Feng Xun immediately went to find Feng Wu.","She shouldn’t be hard to find.","However, Feng Xun arrived at the students’ quarters, and she wasn’t there.","“What? She went to the Dayless Woods?” Feng Xun frowned. “Why is she so busy?”","She engaged in several battles as soon as she came to Peace Grassland.","And now, she was in the Dayless Woods.","“Luckily, current students can only stay in the outer ring, or she’d be in danger.” Feng Xun was going to return to Jun Linyuan.","Sun Yu said, “No, that’s not where she is. A team from the major’s quarters needed some members, and they needed to go to the Dayless Woods. They took her and Chen Ziyun with them.”","WHAT?!","Feng Xun’s face darkened.","“Are they going to the middle ring?” Feng Xun raised his voice.","Sun Yu nodded.","Feng Xun snapped. “Is she an idiot? Doesn’t she know she’s still a student? The middle ring isn’t for her!”","Young Lord Feng lost his temper, and the other students didn’t dare make a sound.","Sun Yu was no exception.","Feng Xun stormed off to the general’s quarters.","Hearing footsteps, the crown prince snorted quietly.","He touched his lower abdomen where his dantian lay.","He hadn’t lost his ability. A secret was hidden there.","Feng told him when he was sixteen that there was Dragon Phoenix Blood inside him. However, it had never been activated."]},{"number":3027,"title":"Chapter 3027 - Where’s Xiao Wu?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3027: Where’s Xiao Wu?","He thought, “I’m not telling Feng Wu even if she comes in now!”","The door opened with a creak.","The crown prince sat up and looked out the window.","He wouldn’t look at the door.","Feng Xun came in, sat down next to the window, and complained, “Xiao Wu just won’t stay still.","“She got in that battle when she first came here, and she’s in the Dayless Woods now!","“Not only that, she’s also gone to the middle ring.","“I heard all the senior Spiritual Kings were pulled out of the middle ring. Still, she’ll have a hard time fighting intermediate ones!","“She has no idea how much danger she could be in!”","The crown prince had been glancing out the window, but he glared at Feng Xun when he heard that.","Feng Xun was so frightened that he jumped to his feet.","“Shall I go to the Dayless Woods?” Feng Xun asked timidly when he saw the crown prince’s dark face.","The crown prince didn’t reply. He only turned the other way and pulled the blanket over his head.","Feng Xun scratched his head.","He decided to take that trip just to be sure.","Feng Xun fetched Xuan Yi and headed for the Dayless Woods.","Someone reported to him just then.","“Ying Yuan’s team is back!”","Ying Yuan?","Feng Xun’s eyes lit up.","He had asked around and knew that Feng Wu had joined Ying Yuan’s team.","“Let’s go!”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi headed for the major’s quarters.","However, he only saw four people when he got there.","Senior Sister Lan’s eyes lit up.","She wiped her face and dusted the dirt off her dress.","As for her hair, she had covered her half-shaved head with a scarf. It looked strange, but it was better than showing her scalp.","Senior Sister Lan walked toward Feng Xun with her prettiest smile,","Feng Xun rushed toward Ying Yuan. He pushed Senior Sister Lan to the side because she was in his way.","Thump!","Senior Sister Lan knocked into the wall and the scarf nearly dropped from her head.","“Where’s Xiao Wu?” Feng Xun asked. “Where’s my Xiao Wu? Didn’t she leave with you? Why are you back without her?”","“My Xiao Wu?”","Most of the people here were from the major’s quarters.","They were graduates of Imperial College from the past one to three years, and were mostly Level 1 to Level 3 Spiritual Kings.","Senior Sister Lan was taken aback.","Feng Wu and Feng Xun...","Were they a couple?","Feng Xun grabbed Ying Yuan and shouted, “Speak!”","Before Ying Yuan could say anything, Chen Ziyun told Feng Xun what had happened in the woods.","He even showed Feng Xun everything Feng Wu had earned.","“Sister Xiao Wu went to the central area on her own,” Chen Ziyun said. “I wanted to stop her, but I couldn’t!”","Feng Xun was furious.","“The central area? Doesn’t she know her capability? How could she go there?” Feng Xun was fuming.","Senior Sister Lan was dumbfounded.","What was Feng Wu’s relationship with Young Lord Feng?"]},{"number":3028,"title":"Chapter 3028 - His Royal Highness Likes Xiao Wu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3028: His Royal Highness Likes Xiao Wu","Only cultivation capability counted in Peace Grassland, and Feng Xun’s title wasn’t all that useful.","However, he was still a young lord, and his father was General Northern Feng.","No one could ignore that.","“Can Feng Wu be General Feng’s daughter?” That idea frightened Senior Sister Lan to death.","Chen Ziyun felt Feng Xun was going to break his arm. He lowered his voice and whispered to Feng Xun, “She said she was going to look for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","Feng Xun stared at him in astonishment.","Chen Ziyun nodded. “I’m sure that was what she said.”","Of course, Feng Xun knew Chen Ziyun was telling the truth because Feng Wu had asked him about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit before.","Collecting information took time.","Although he wanted to help Boss Jun, he needed more time.","Feng Xun let go of Chen Ziyun and told Xuan Yi what happened.","They entered the Dayless Woods as soon as they could.","Feng Wu had no idea of what was happening outside.","“Are Feng Wu and Young Lord Feng a couple?” Senior Sister Lan asked.","Chen Ziyun threw a dirty look at her. “Don’t spread rumors! Boss Feng Wu and Boss Feng Xun are brother and sister! His mother is her godmother!”","“So, they’re not real siblings,” Senior Sister Lan said suggestively.","Chen Ziyun was furious.","“Watch your tone! Spread your rumors if you have a death wish. Boss Feng Wu and His Royal Highness are the perfect couple. His Royal Highness adores Sister Xiao Wu!”","Of course, Senior Sister Lan wouldn’t believe him.","Even if she believed it to be true, she would find a hundred ways to convince herself it wasn’t possible.","Somebody else heard Chen Ziyun.","It was none other than Dongfang Ziyun.","Earlier, Feng Wu’s medical skills were such a hard blow to Dongfang Ziyun that she spat out a mouthful of blood and passed out.","She finally woke up now and told herself that a Semi-Divine medicine refiner didn’t mean anything.","No rule said His Royal Highness had to fall in love with a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","“His Royal Highness isn’t the superficial type that can only see a pretty face!","“He sees beyond one’s level!”","Having convinced herself of all that, Dongfang Ziyun decided to take a walk in the sunlight.","Xuelan kept her company.","She just happened to pass the area, and she heard the shocking news.","Dongfang Ziyun marched toward Chen Ziyun.","Xuelan’s eyes widened.","If she remembered correctly, Miss Dongfang was pretty weak right now.","Dongfang Ziyun stopped in front of Chen Ziyun and bellowed, “What did you say?!”","Chen Ziyun jumped in fright.","He turned around and looked at the stranger.","Senior Sister Lan knew Dongfang Ziyun, but Dongfang Ziyun didn’t know her.","Usually, Senior Sister Lan didn’t like Dongfang Ziyun. However, she now decided that an enemy’s enemy was a friend.","She reminded Chen Ziyun, “This is Miss Dongfang, the best medicine refiner in the fortress.”"]},{"number":3029,"title":"Chapter 3029 - Prison","paragraphs":["Chapter 3029: Prison","The best medicine refiner? Xuelan glanced at Dongfang Ziyun, who had been proven not to be the best one.","However, Dongfang Ziyun accepted that title.","Chen Ziyun frowned.","The best medicine refiner? Somehow, he felt Feng Wu was an excellent medicine refiner, too.","Dongfang Ziyun glared at Chen Ziyun. “What did you just say?”","Chen Ziyun frowned. “What do you mean?”","Dongfang Ziyun was furious.","She couldn’t believe this man was looking her in the eye.","Had they all learned from Feng Wu? He showed her no respect!","“What did you say their relationship was?” Dongfang Ziyun asked.","Hearing the raised voices, more people gathered around, and all eyes were on Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun looked at Dongfang Ziyun.","“I know you’re a Supreme Level medicine refiner. Why are you so mean? Xiao Wu’s medical skills are just as good as yours,” Chen Ziyun said.","Xiao Wu... Dongfang Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","She knew Feng Wu’s medical skills better than anyone else.","Because of what Chen Ziyun said, Dongfang Ziyun considered him her enemy.","“Tell me!” Dongfang Ziyun shouted.","“Fine. I’ll tell you!” said Chen Ziyun. “His Royal Highness adores Xiao Wu. She’s going to marry him!”","Many people were shocked.","Feng Wu?","His Royal Highness?","Marriage?","Everybody stared at Chen Ziyun.","Dongfang Ziyun wanted to kill him.","All the gazes made Chen Ziyun uneasy. “What? Am I wrong?”","“I don’t believe you!” Dongfang glared at Chen Ziyun. “Prove it!”","Chen Ziyun said, “I’m telling the truth. Back then, inImperial College, His Royal Highness didn’t deny it, and many people heard it. Hey, Lv Haobei, stop!”","Chen Ziyun remembered Lv Haobei was there, so he wanted the letter to confirm what he said.","Of course, Lv Haobei wouldn’t do that.","Dongfang Ziyun was an important figure in the Military Academy, and he didn’t have a death wish.","Lv Haobei said, “I don’t know. I didn’t see anything. I’m just passing by!”","He dashed off after that.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","Dongfang Ziyun smirked. “See? He wouldn’t testify. You’re lying!”","Chen Ziyun said, “I’m not!”","Dongfang Ziyun said, “Prove it!”","Chen Ziyun didn’t know how to.","Dongfang Ziyun told the other students from the Military Academy, “Take him down!”","Two people stepped out to do her bidding.","Dongfang Ziyun was the best medicine refiner in the fortress, and no one wanted to offend her.","“Why are you doing this to me?” Chen Ziyun screamed.","“You’ve slandered His Royal Highness!” Dongfang Ziyun glared at him. “Anybody who has done that should die! Lock him up!”","Nobody helped Chen Ziyun.","He was only an unimportant student, and everybody agreed with Dongfang Ziyun.","Nobody could slander the crown prince."]},{"number":3030,"title":"Chapter 3030 - Untitled","paragraphs":["Chapter 3030: Untitled","Chen Ziyun was locked up.","“When Boss Feng Wu comes back, tell her to save me!” Chen Ziyun shouted at Sun Yu.","Sun Yu was worried about him but couldn’t do anything.","He and his teammates also said the crown prince was in love with Feng Wu, but Dongfang Ziyun threatened them.","“If you slander His Royal Highness again, you’ll end up like Chen Ziyun!”","Sun Yu and the others were furious.","They were telling the truth!","How was that slandering?","These people were unbelievable!","“People nowadays... What can I say?” A young lieutenant colonel smirked. “Why haven’t I heard of her before? What’s her military rank?”","“Senior Brother Jiang.” Everybody made way for that man.","He was from Imperial College and had been in love with Dongfang Ziyun for a while. However, he hadn’t found a chance to express his feelings, so he stood up for her.","Senior Sister Lan said, “Military rank? She doesn’t have that. She’s still a student in Imperial College.”","Senior Brother Jiang acted as if he couldn’t believe his ears. “What? A student? What makes her think she can make that claim? That’s just arrogance!”","Sun Yu couldn’t stand it anymore, and Chu Qu said, “Xiao Wu is the best! You don’t know anything about her! We’ve all seen her capability in battle! She has killed Level 3 Spiritual Kings!”","Sun Yu said, “That’s right!”","Senior Brother Jiang asked, “Has she graduated? Is she a major? A lieutenant colonel?”","The others were speechless.","Senior Brother Jiang patted Chu Qu on the shoulder. “You’re still too young and have seen too little. She’s not even a major yet, and you’re making her sound like a genius. It won’t do her any good.","“You can brag about her when she becomes a lieutenant colonel, but you’ll have to wait ten years before that!” Senior Brother Jiang laughed.","It took him ten years to become a lieutenant colonel.","Sun Yu and the others clenched their fists.","“She’ll become a lieutenant colonel in a year!” Chu Qu ground his teeth.","Senior Sister Lan smirked. “A year? You better pray for her and hope she can come out of the Dayless Woods alive.”","Feng Wu had no idea what was happening outside.","All she wanted was to find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","The central region...","At her current level, going there would be courting death.","Based on what she had learned, only generals could go there.","This could be a one-way trip.","However...","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","After all, the crown prince was injured because of her.","If he hadn’t challenged Zuo Chengfeng, he wouldn’t have been injured, and Night Owl wouldn’t have taken advantage of that.","Feng Wu hated Night Owl to the core.","If she didn’t take the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, Night Owl would regain his ability and destroy their fortress.","No one would be able to stop him.","Therefore, she had to find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu rushed into the central region without a map or any guidance."]},{"number":3031,"title":"Chapter 3031 - Humiliation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3031: Humiliation","She kept running into assassins.","Right now, she was hiding in a tree to eat something, but somebody still spotted her.","Whoosh!","She heard the sound of rustling leaves.","!!","An arrow was aimed at her.","She threw the rice ball at that person’s face.","Whoosh!","She charged at him instead of trying to dodge.","Fallen Star Sword whooshed, and a head rolled on the ground.","Another Level 3 Spiritual King.","Feng Wu was a Level 3 Spiritual King now, and killing other Level 3 Spiritual Kings was a piece of cake.","Feng Wu studied the dead man.","He was obviously hunting her.","There was a high price on her head, and her Divine Phoenix Blood was extremely precious.","If she was from the Dongsang Kingdom, would she miss such a good opportunity?","Of course not!","Hence...","Feng Wu looked around.","The canopy was so thick that she couldn’t see the sky above.","Just then, she heard the sound of fighting.","Somebody said, “You Dongsang people are despicable! You set us up!”","That was the language of the Junwu Empire.","Was someone from the Junwu Empire fighting someone from the Dongsang Kingdom?","Feng Wu took out a black scarf to cover her face, then jumped from one tree to another.","She reached the place where the battle was taking place in a few jumps.","Hiding among the leaves, she observed the battle from dozens of meters away.","She recognized the fighters.","Sheng Changtian had been stabbed in the stomach.","A sword had gone through his abdomen.","He held his stomach, and blood was gushing out of his mouth. If he wasn’t treated in time, he would die.","He was one of the best students of the Military Academy. If he died now, it would be a hard blow to his school.","Feng Wu analyzed the situation.","The enemies were five Level 4 Spiritual Kings and five Level 3 ones.","Sheng Changtian’s team only had five members.","The team leader was Song Yao, a Level 4 Spiritual King. There was a fist-sized hole in his abdomen, and his intestines were pouring out.","Yang Wan, a Level 3 Spiritual King, suffered from a few injuries, too. However, they were all superficial. It was obvious the enemies were keeping her alive because of her beauty.","Sheng Changtian was severely injured.","The other two members were covered with blood as well.","The ten Dongsang people had surrounded the team of five.","The leader of the Dongsang team smirked.","He stared at Yang Wan and aimed his sword at her chest.","Yang Wan was shaking with rage.","She’d rather die than be humiliated like this.","“Stop it, Yamano!”","So, that was the name of the Dongsang team’s leader.","Feng Wu hated men like this.","Weren’t Dongsang cultivators supposed to be uninterested in women and focused on their cultivation only?","They were so disgusting!","Yamano was even more presumptuous. With a wave of his sword, Yang Wan’s dress was sliced open, revealing her arm and shoulder."]},{"number":3032,"title":"Chapter 3032 - Choice","paragraphs":["Chapter 3032: Choice","Yang Wan was shaking furiously.","She knew her team would die here. To save herself from the humiliation, she put her sword to her throat.","“Yang Wan!”","“Sister Wan!”","!!","...","The other members of the team went livid and burned with rage.","They weren’t afraid of death, but they couldn’t stand the humiliation.","“I thought the Dongsang Kingdom was a place of discipline! Do you realize what you’re doing?” Sheng Changtian shouted. “You’re breaking your law! You’re going to be punished!”","Yamano snorted. “How would my superiors know? You’ll all be dead.”","He then turned to his team members. “Guys, shall we show the girl a good time?”","His teammates grinned maliciously.","One of them smiled at Yang Wan. “Killing yourself won’t change anything. Your body will still be warm.”","Yang Wan’s eyes widened in despair.","She didn’t know what to do.","Sheng Changtian ground his teeth so hard that he spat out a mouthful of blood.","The other team members were as furious as he was.","It was unlucky of them to run into this enemy. They weren’t afraid of death, but not in this humiliating way.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","She knew it. No man could hold back their urges until they were 40 years old.","They were used to doing such unspeakable things to young women.","Feng Wu wouldn’t have it.","The battle was about to end.","Song Yao and his team were surrounded, and Yamano and his men laughed.","They were all using identical bayonets.","Yamano pointed at Song Yao with his bayonet. “On your knees! Now!","“Have your backs to us because we’re going to have a competition.","“The one who can cut most accurately and make you bleed the most will be the winner!”","Yamano and his team enjoyed killing.","Growing up in the blood tax system, they were used to elimination and death.","All of them had twisted minds.","Song Yao and his team had lost all hope.","“Is no one coming to our rescue?”","Song Yao felt the object in his chest pocket. If somebody could save them now...","“If somebody could kill these people, I’ll be grateful forever!” Song Yao screamed in his head. “I’m not afraid of death, but I don’t want to die like this!”","Sheng Changtian was forced on his knees, and a million things went through his mind.","He thought about Yang Wan, the Military Academy and Feng Wu.","He didn’t know why, but the last person he thought of before dying was that beautiful girl.","Yamano took a portrait out of his pocket and showed it to Sheng Changtian. “Have you seen her before?”","Feng Wu was about to come out, but she stopped when she saw this.","Sheng Changtian glanced at it and immediately recognized the person.","It wasn’t a very good portrait, but her eyes were unmistakable.","It was Feng Wu.","“We’ll spare anyone who can help us find her!” Yamano tempted them.","Sheng Changtian struggled inwardly.","Should he tell them?","He knew who she was!","He had fought Feng Wu in that competition!","He even knew where Feng Wu was and could lead them there..."]},{"number":3033,"title":"Chapter 3033 - Fight!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3033: Fight!","“Do you know her? Do you know where she is?” Yamano shook the portrait.","Not all Dongsang people could speak the Junwu Empire’s language, but Yamano was fluent in it.","Sheng Changtian felt conflicted.","He had to admit he disliked Feng Wu.","!!","She had defeated him, and it was understandable if he gave her up.","However, she was Feng Wu, the girl with the Divine Phoenix Blood!","Her talent was so precious to the Junwu Empire.","The Dongsang Kingdom wanted to catch her probably because they wanted to kill the young genius.","At that thought, Sheng Changtian took a deep breath and made up his mind.","“I don’t know her!”","Yamano stared at him. “Are you sure?”","Sheng Changtian insisted, “Of course I’m sure!”","Yamano gave him one last look before turning to Yang Wan.","Given what was happening to her, Yang Wan didn’t want Feng Wu to go through the same thing, so she shook her head. “I don’t know who that is!”","Yamano glared at them.","“You’ve got some integrity, but it’ll only make you die sooner!","“The other three won’t have that opportunity anymore. Go to hell!”","Yamano waved his hands in frustration. “Cut their heads off!”","His teammates had been waiting for this moment, and they raised their weapons in unison.","But right at that moment!","Yamano felt something cold at his throat.","By the time he realized what had happened, blood was gushing out of his neck.","Yamano trembled.","To defeat one’s enemy, it was always a good idea to take out their leader first.","Feng Wu couldn’t assassinate so many people at once, so she killed their leader first.","With him gone, his team members would be confused.","It was incredible!","Feng Wu moved so fast that before Yamano realized it, her dagger was in another man’s throat.","Feng Wu chose to assassinate the Level 4 Spiritual Kings first.","In an instant, the enemy lost two Level 4 members.","There were only three Level 4 Spiritual Kings and five Level 3 ones left.","Feng Wu cut the rope that tied Song Yao’s hands behind his back. “Get up and kill them!”","No matter how talented Feng Wu was, she was still very young and was only a Level 3 Spiritual King.","She had already gone above and beyond in killing two Level 4 Spiritual Kings.","She had only succeeded because the enemy hadn’t seen her coming.","Song Yao was astonished.","He had been ready to die, but the most incredible thing happened.","He grabbed the dagger Feng Wu threw at him and stabbed the Level 3 Spiritual King behind him in the heart.","The man died before he could realize what had happened.","Sheng Changtian and the others finally turned around to see what was going on.","Sheng Changtian was astonished when he saw the girl in red moving nimbly from one enemy to the next.","He even rubbed his eyes, wondering if he was hallucinating.","“Fight!”","Having experienced that humiliation, Yang Wan reacted quickly and smacked Sheng Changtian on the head.","“Yes! Of course!” Sheng Changtian finally woke up from his bewilderment.","Their injuries didn’t matter anymore. Just fight!"]},{"number":3034,"title":"Chapter 3034 Girl in Red","paragraphs":["3034 Girl in Red","When the Junwu Empire’s team took action, the Dongsang assassins also recovered from the initial shock.","The battle started.","So far, the Dongsang Kingdom still had the upper hand.","They had three Level 4 Spiritual Kings and three Level 3 ones.","With the other team, Song Yao was the only Level 4 Spiritual King, and the others were all Level 3 and below, not to mention they were all severely injured.","Luckily, Feng Wu killed Yamano first.","With the team leader gone, the others were less difficult to handle.","Feng Wu fought two Level 4 Spiritual Kings, and Song Yao fought one.","Even then, Song Yao was swaying because of his injuries.","Feng Wu knew if the battle dragged out, things would get worse for them.","“Come out!” Feng Wu urged Little Phoenix.","The bird’s capability was affected by Feng Wu. When she became a Level 3 Spiritual King, the bird rose to the same level.","Little Phoenix didn’t want to get involved because fighting was so tiresome.","However, Feng Wu had given the order, and the bird had to follow.","It flew out of Feng Wu’s sleeve and aimed at a Level 4 Spiritual King’s eye.","What happened was quicker than words could describe!","The bird pecked the man’s eye, and Feng Wu took advantage of that.","“Ground Control!”","The man immediately slowed down.","It only lasted for less than a second, but it was enough for Feng Wu.","“Fallen Star Sword, stance three!","“Fatal Thunder!","“Explode!","Feng Wu channeled her spiritual essence into the Fallen Star Sword and stabbed it into the man’s heart.","“Ah!”","The man died instantly.","There were only two Level 4 Spiritual Kings left.","Feng Wu had a much easier time after that.","Sheng Changtian couldn’t believe his eyes.","He and the others fought together and still couldn’t kill one Level 3 Spiritual King. He then saw Feng Wu bury her sword in that man’s chest.","She...","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say. He felt the world had gone insane.","However...","Feng Wu was fighting one Level 4 Spiritual King now, and he was a junior.","He panicked when he saw Feng Wu kill a teammate that was more capable than he was.","Looking up, he saw his team losing ground.","No!","He had to get away!","He turned around, only for a bird to peck his eye.","Before he could do anything, Feng Wu’s sword went through his chest from behind.","The blade pierced his heart.","He looked down at the tip of the blade that came out of his chest. This couldn’t be real...","He opened his mouth to say something, but Feng Wu drew out the sword, and blood gushed out.","The man swayed, turned around, and stared at her in astonishment.","Feng Wu had covered her face, and the assassins didn’t recognize her.","Feng Wu ignored him. She raised her sword when walking past Sheng Changtian.","The Level 3 Spiritual King that Sheng Changtian and Yang Wan had been trying to kill was cut in half.","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say.","Nor did Yang Wan."]},{"number":3035,"title":"Chapter 3035 She’s God","paragraphs":["3035 She’s God","The Dongsang assassins couldn’t recognize Feng Wu, but Song Yao and his team could.","The girl in red was Feng Wu!","Sheng Changtian looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Before long, his eyes sparkled, especially when he saw Feng Wu killing the enemy as she walked toward Song Yao.","Yes, it was as effortless as it sounded.","She cut off the heads of Spiritual Kings as easily as cutting grass.","She reached Song Yao, who was in danger.","Apart from the Level 4 Spiritual King that Song Yao was fighting, all the other Dongsang assassins were dead.","The Level 4 Spiritual King didn’t realize that until he looked around to find his teammates lying all over the ground.","Moments ago, they had been competing over cutting off their captives’ heads, but now, they were lying in their own blood.","The Level 4 Spiritual King was terrified.","Fear overtook him, and he gave up. He only wanted to flee.","Feng Wu arrived before he could do that.","She kicked him to the ground, and Song Yao cut off his head.","The head rolled around on the ground.","No one made a sound...","Leaves rustled in the wind.","Song Yao, Yang Wan, Sheng Changtian and the other two members stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","They now only realized how talented Feng Wu was.","“Aren’t you a Level 2 Spiritual King?” Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to believe anymore.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “That’s old news.”","Yang Wan and the others were amazed. Feng Wu had been a Level 2 Spiritual King when she found the Dongsang team the other day!","What Sheng Changtian said astonished them even more.","Sheng Changtian said, “You were only a Level 1 Spiritual King ten days ago when you fought me in Imperial College!”","Everybody was shocked.","Yang Wan forced a smile. “Sheng Changtian, are you joking?”","“I’m not!” said Sheng Changtian. “She became a Level 2 Spiritual King during that battle!”","The others were speechless.","They all looked at Feng Wu.","As if making two breakthroughs in ten days wasn’t enough, she could also kill enemies that had higher cultivation levels than her.","She had killed almost all five Level 4 Spiritual Kings.","“You...”","Sheng Changtian told the others, “She has Divine Phoenix Blood. It’s a million times more precious than Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood!”","Somehow, Sheng Changtian sounded so proud.","Feng Wu shook her head. Weren’t the two schools supposed to be rivals?","She took out a bottle of Supreme Level potion and tossed it to Sheng Changtian. “Drink some and put some on your wounds. You should leave the Dayless Woods now.”","She turned around after that.","Sheng Changtian said, “Aren’t you leaving?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “I have very important things to do.”","Seeing that Feng Wu was heading for the central area, he hesitantly touched the object in his chest pocket. In the end, he gritted his teeth and said, “Wait!”"]},{"number":3036,"title":"Chapter 3036 Magical Soul Vine","paragraphs":["3036 Magical Soul Vine","Feng Wu stopped and looked at Song Yao.","Song Yao fumbled in his pocket and took out a piece of paper. “We found this on a capable Dongsang man.”","Feng Wu unfolded it and saw that it was a hand-drawn map.","“It points to the central region. I don’t know what kind of treasures are hidden there, but...”","Song Yao looked Feng Wu in the eye. “This map was very precious to that man.”","Feng Wu studied it and saw a tree marked as the end point on the map.","Feng Wu was astonished!","Other people might not be able to recognize the tree, but Feng Wu could.","That was an Immortal Spiritual Tree!","She had seen one of these trees in Northern Border City before.","She had come to the Dayless Woods to look for an Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu looked up from the map and stared at Song Yao with sparkling eyes.","Song Yao nearly jumped. “What?”","Feng Wu memorized the map and nodded at Song Yao. “It’s very useful. Thank you.”","She carefully folded the map and put it in her sleeve.","Song Yao thought, “Does she know what the treasure is just by looking at the map?","“That can’t be.","“She must be trying to comfort me.”","Song Yao recalled not being friendly toward Imperial College and how he mocked its students whenever he had the chance.","He didn’t expect Feng Wu to be so considerate.","Because of that, Song Yao liked Feng Wu even more.","Feng Wu said, “You should leave now before more assassins detect the smell of your blood and track you down.”","Song Yao said, “These badges...”","Together, the badges of the ten Spiritual Kings and the essence crystals they carried were worth a small fortune.","Feng Wu waved him off. “Take them. I’ll trade them for this map.”","She left after that.","Despite what she said, Song Yao and his team didn’t see it that way, but Feng Wu didn’t know that.","She ran as fast as she could toward the central region.","The map was very brief and only had an outline of the place.","It showed that the Immortal Spiritual Tree was on a cliff in the center of the woods.","That cliff was close to the volcano.","The tree was at the center of the cliff.","It would be easy to find, but that only made the trip more dangerous.","Feng Wu couldn’t care about that anymore.","She changed her clothes because her red dress was too conspicuous.","She also wore a disguise so that she looked like an ordinary girl.","If Jun Linyuan were here, he would immediately recognize that face. She was the girl who had swindled him out of that Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu never thought she would use this mask again.","It was easy for a Dongsang person to pretend to be a resident of the Junwu Empire, but the other way round was almost impossible.","All Dongsang assassins were selected through the blood tax system, and after training, they all had the aura that was native to the Dongsang Kingdom.","The people of the Junwu Empire didn’t have it, but Feng Wu did!","When she was set up by her enemy, Jun Linyuan tried to save her, and had subdued the Magical Soul Vine for her, turning it into her pet.","The vine gave Feng Wu the aura of a Dongsang assassin and also enabled her to speak the Dongsang language fluently."]},{"number":3037,"title":"Chapter 3037 Ruthless Character","paragraphs":["3037 Ruthless Character","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were looking for Feng Wu when they ran into an injured team.","“My lord.”","Thinking they were enemies, Song Yao was about to warn his team, when he recognized Feng Xun.","Feng Xun saw that the five people were all covered in blood, and their clothes were in tatters. They looked worse than beggars.","“You...” Feng Xun frowned. “What happened?”","Sheng Changtian knew Feng Xun was close to Feng Wu, so he said, “It’s all because of Feng Wu!”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi immediately asked, “What about her? What happened to her?”","What Sheng Changtian said was quite confusing.","Seeing that Sheng Changtian wanted to continue, Song Yao pushed him aside and told Feng Xun about Feng Wu’s brave deeds.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened. “What? Xiao Wu killed five Level 4 and five Level 3 Spiritual Kings all by herself? She saved you?”","Song Yao and the others all nodded. “She killed most of them. Look. These are all her prizes.”","Feng Xun looked in the backpack and was astonished.","Since when was Feng Wu so capable?","Feng Xun soon got over the initial shock, and he asked, “Where is she? Why isn’t she with you?”","Song Yao hesitated.","Feng Xun had a bad feeling and shouted, “Speak!”","Song Yao said, “We asked her to come back with us, but she insisted on going to the central region, and we couldn’t stop her. I gave her this map...”","“What map?!” Feng Xun grew anxious.","The central region?","Why was she so bold?","Song Yao said, “We killed an enemy and found this map on him. It’s like this...”","He had a good memory and soon drew a copy for Feng Xun.","The tree looked identical to the one on the original map.","Feng Xun didn’t recognize it, but Xuan Yi frowned. “Isn’t that the Immortal Spiritual Tree?”","They had seen this tree when they accompanied Jun Linyuan to look for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","The thought of the fruit reminded Feng Xun of the ugly girl.","She had fooled him over and over again.","“Did you give this map to her?!” Feng Xun glared at Song Yao.","Song Yao didn’t know what he did wrong, and Feng Xun’s stare made him uneasy.","Feng Xun wanted to slap Song Yao.","However, he knew Feng Wu’s decision had nothing to do with Song Yao.","Feng Xun was grinding his teeth, when somebody ran toward him.","“My lord, Elder Helian needs to see you!”","It was Yuanshui, Elder Helian’s favorite servant.","Feng Xun wanted to shake his head, when Yuanshui added. “It’s about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit. Elder Helian has news on it, and it’s urgent. Mr. Sakiya is involved, too!”","Feng Xun stared at Yuanshui.","“What did you say?!”","Yuanshui nodded. “Yes, Sakiya came all the way here from the Dongsang capital city to take charge of the situation.”","Sakiya!","Feng Xun gritted his teeth.","Of course, he knew who that was.","Sakiya was a ruthless man.","He was the most relentless person!"]},{"number":3038,"title":"Chapter 3038 Catch that Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3038 Catch that Feng Wu","Sakiya was the crown prince’s teacher and one of the highest-ranking officials in the Dongsang Kingdom.","The crown prince had three teachers.","One gave him classes, one taught him how to fight, and one protected him.","Right now, Sakiya had all three titles, which was how talented the old man was.","He knew everything that had ever happened in history and was so intelligent that he didn’t seem human.","Night Owl was very capable, but he was impulsive, violent and reckless.","Sakiya was so smart and resourceful that he could make up for Night Owl’s shortcomings.","Together, they made an invincible team.","Now that Night Owl had badly injured himself, Sakiya had to come all the way here to take charge of things.","Feng Xun had fallen for Sakiya’s ploys quite a few times.","The only one who had ever outwitted Sakiya was Jun Linyuan, but he was bedridden now.","No!","Jun Linyuan might have lost his cultivation ability, but his brain still worked.","“Xuan Yi, go back now. Tell Elder Helian and Boss Jun what happened. I’ll find Xiao Wu and stop her.”","They went their separate ways after that.","Feng Wu had no idea what was going on. Right now, she was lurking behind a team.","There was a big team consisting of 50 people. The team leader was a giant with a full beard.","He was quite capable. At her current level, Feng Wu couldn’t tell his exact cultivation level.","He had to be at least a Level 5 Spiritual King.","The group he led consisted of ten individual teams. In each team, the leader was a Level 4 Spiritual King, and the members were Level 3 Spiritual Kings.","Feng Wu hid in the thick canopy of a big tree nearby and listened to them.","The team members were resting and eating.","“Our task is to catch the Level 2 Spiritual King alive. She has the Divine Phoenix Blood.” The giant’s voice boomed like thunder. He looked around and said, “I received information from a reliable source. She’s here in the Dayless Woods.","“If 50 of us can’t catch her, you can all go to hell!”","“Lord Pan, that won’t happen. Any one of us can catch her alive. How can this team fail that task?”","The other team leaders nodded.","Lord Pan was pleased. “We can ignore the other people of the Junwu Empire. Our top priority is the Divine Phoenix Blood. Mr. Sakiya says we must catch her!”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Who was Mr. Sakiya?","“Did Mr. Sakiya ask specifically for Feng Wu?”","One of the Level 4 Spiritual Kings sounded astonished. “Mr. Sakiya has never failed to catch a person he wants.”","That was the leader of Team 1.","The leader of Team 2 chimed in. “Mr. Sakiya can always predict things. If he says we have to catch Feng Wu, she can’t escape. I’m just curious. Is the Divine Phoenix Blood that important?”","The leader of Team 3 said, “I heard that the Divine Phoenix Blood is a great tonic. One drop can change the bloodline of a good-for-nothing. Isn’t that amazing?”","The leader of Team 4 said, “That’s incredible! When we catch her, can I poke her finger for a drop of her blood?”"]},{"number":3039,"title":"Chapter 3039 Feng Xun","paragraphs":["3039 Feng Xun","The leader of Team 5 said, “How can you be so stupid? Why should we poke a hole in her? We’ll beat her until she bleeds, and we’ll have as much blood as we want then!”","Lord Pan smacked him on the head. “Watch your mouth! How dare you defy Mr. Sakiya?! He’ll chop off all your heads!”","The team leaders immediately stopped talking.","They might still have a chance if they pleaded with the crown prince, but Mr. Sakiya was the kind of person who would cut off your head while smiling.","Feng Wu had a rough idea now.","Mr. Sakiya had to be extremely capable to frighten these people so much.","Feng Wu was also worried about her Divine Phoenix Blood.","As it turned out, these people were after it.","Now that Jun Linyuan wasn’t watching over her, the Dongsang Kingdom began to come up with crazy plans.","Catch her, bleed her, and use her as a tool for other people’s cultivation? Feng Wu smirked. She would show these people who would be the ones to bleed.","These Dongsang people were competing over how many Junwu people they could kill, and Feng Wu was furious.","She would make these people’s lives as hard as possible!","Feng Wu wanted to keep going, when somebody patted her head.","She raised her head, and looked into a pair of familiar eyes.","Feng Wu was astonished!","Feng Xun?!","The young lord was filled with emotions.","“You —”","Feng Wu was about to speak, but Feng Xun gave her a warning glance, gesturing at her to follow him.","Feng Wu followed Feng Xun to a creek.","They crouched down in a pit behind a giant rock and looked at each other.","Feng Wu realized what she looked like now and remembered how the ugly girl had tricked Feng Xun.","“The weather is so nice today!” She tried to digress.","Feng Xun cut her off.","He studied her mask and didn’t know what to say.","Crossing his arms, he mocked her.","“How brave of you. You’re good enough to venture into the Dayless Woods on your own, huh?","“You’re only a student. Are you prepared to go to the central region?","“I see you’ve helped some people. You must feel so good about yourself.”","Feng Wu felt a little guilty when she heard his mocking tone.","It wasn’t just because of what she had done in Northern Border City. She also felt awkward about what was happening now.","After all, she was still a student.","“I’m already a Level 3 Spiritual King. I’ve more than passed the requirement to graduate.” Feng Wu looked up at Feng Xun but then immediately lowered her head.","Feng Xun stared at her. “Do you think a Level 3 Spiritual King can get through the central region all by themselves?”","Feng Wu said, “Hm...”","Feng Xun had always been bubbly and gullible. Feng Wu had never seen him so serious before.","Feng Xun jabbed her forehead with a finger. “Xuan Yi has gone to see Elder Helian. This is a matter that has to involve the high-ranking officials of our empire. Your attempt will only get you killed!”","Feng Wu said, “No, I’m not...”","Feng Xun said, “Everywhere I went, I heard them hunting a girl in red, who has the Divine Phoenix Blood.”"]},{"number":3040,"title":"Chapter 3040 Seven Beast Kings","paragraphs":["3040 Seven Beast Kings","Luckily, Feng Xun recognized her disguise, or he wouldn’t have known who she was.","“You’re not the type of person to flaunt your bloodline. How did they find out?” Feng Xun frowned.","The thought frustrated Feng Wu.","“Zuo Qingluan and Shan Jingfei!” Feng Wu described to Feng Xun what she had heard. “They’re working with the Dongsang Kingdom. You should pay more attention to them.”","Feng Xun frowned. “I can see why Zuo Qingluan would do it, but who’s Shan Jingfei?”","Feng Wu then told Feng Xun about Shan Jingfei.","Feng Xun stared at her. “Why are you always in trouble? You attract even more attention than Boss Jun.”","Feng Wu pouted. “He’s the reason I’m in so much trouble in the first place!”","Feng Xun suddenly said, “Wait. What do you mean by ‘you should’ just now? Aren’t you coming back with me?”","Of course not.","No one knew when Elder Helian and the others would arrive.","Moreover, the high-ranking officials had too many scruples. It would take them forever to make a decision.","Feng Wu had already made up her mind. She would go off on her own.","“No!” Feng Xun cut her off. “I won’t have it! You’re coming back with me!”","Feng Wu grinned, stuck out her tongue, and sprinted off.","Feng Xun wanted to go after her, but his feet were stuck to the ground.","He couldn’t believe what had happened.","That girl!","She set this trap while talking to him!","She had done the same thing when she took the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Xun was astonished.","He decided to abandon his shoes. He cut open his boots, almost injuring himself in the process. However, she was long gone by the time he freed himself.","Feng Xun ran after her, filled with anxiety.","They were almost in the central region now.","That region was so famous for a reason.","There were seven formidable beast kings in the Dayless Woods.","No one knew how powerful they were.","According to Jun Linyuan, they were somewhere between the Spiritual Overlord and Spiritual Saint stages.","They could kill a junior Spiritual King like Feng Wu with a flick of their finger.","Feng Xun was worried sick.","Seeing Feng Xun chasing her, Feng Wu headed for the central region without hesitation.","The chase soon caught Lord Pan’s attention.","He was having his meal. Suddenly, he tossed his bowl aside and jumped to his feet.","“Something’s happening! Spread out and see what’s going on!” Lord Pan gave the order.","Feng Xun was scared to death when he saw Feng Wu enter the central region.","“OMG!","“She’s going to die!”","She had already stepped into one of the beast kings’ territories.","“Stop! Feng Wu, stop right there!” Feng Xun could only speak to her in a hushed voice.","He ran as fast as he could in bare feet.","Feng Wu would never go back with him, so she ran as fast as she could as well.","She wanted to lose Feng Xun and hide in a remote corner."]},{"number":3041,"title":"Chapter 3041 Sacred Imperial Spider","paragraphs":["3041 Sacred Imperial Spider","Feng Wu wanted to change her disguise once she found a remote corner.","That way, Feng Xun wouldn’t know what she looked like.","She didn’t have much disguise paste left and could only change her disguise no more than twice.","Just then, Little Phoenix cried out, “Stop! I sense something dangerous!”","Feng Wu stopped abruptly.","She could hear footsteps on fallen leaves.","Before Little Phoenix could go on, Feng Xun caught up with her and grabbed her arm. “You naughty girl! I finally caught you!","“Do you know how dangerous this place is?","“There are seven beast kings in the central region, and each of them is either a Spiritual Overlord or a Spiritual Saint!","“They can kill you with a single touch!","“Do you have a death wish?","“What’ll happen to Boss Jun if you’re dead? The empire will be in chaos! Come back with me now!”","Feng Xun scolded Feng Wu.","He dragged her in the opposite direction, but he was too late.","A sinister voice came from behind them.","“Where are you going? Stay.”","The eerie laughter gave Feng Wu and Feng Xun the creeps.","It was so intimidating!","They sensed a force more powerful than Elder Wu or even Elder Helian.","Feng Wu knew she was nowhere near capable enough to fight this creature.","Feng Wu and Feng Xun exchanged looks.","Feng Xun stared at her, fighting back his impulse to smack her.","Feng Wu felt rather guilty.","They raised their hands in the air and turned around.","Behind them was a large, old tree, and on it was a spider as big as a grown man. It stared at them with cold eyes.","Seeing them turn around, the golden spider stuck out its tongue.","Feng Xun felt his heart race.","“It’s the Sacred Imperial Spider!” He felt suffocated.","Feng Wu didn’t know what that meant, so she wasn’t afraid and even asked him what it was in a whisper.","Feng Xun said, “It’s one of the seven beast kings. It’s a peak Spiritual Overlord or a junior Spiritual Saint. We’re doomed!”","“Hahaha —”","The Sacred Imperial Spider found it ridiculous that the two humans were bold enough to talk to each other in front of it.","Since when were humans so bold?","The spider looked Feng Xun up and down and nodded in satisfaction. The teenager looked very yummy.","It then turned to Feng Wu and found her rather ordinary.","The Sacred Imperial Spider was female.","She began to wonder which human she should eat first.","She looked back and forth between Feng Wu and Feng Xun.","Feng Wu swallowed. “Why do I feel like it wants to eat us?”","Feng Xun said, “You think?! Even Elder Helian isn’t this spider’s match. How about this: I’ll hold onto its legs, and you run as fast as you can. Understand?”"]},{"number":3042,"title":"Chapter 3042 Eat You Up","paragraphs":["3042 Eat You Up","Feng Xun glared at Feng Wu.","He knew he would probably die here, but his death would be worth it if Feng Wu could get away.","Feng Wu shook her head. “No. We still have a chance.”","She had some poison. If the spider wanted to eat them, it would be killed by their dead bodies.","Maybe they could strike a deal.","Taking the poison was the last resort. If there was a chance to escape, of course, they would take it.","Feng Wu said, “Let’s run in opposite directions, and we’ll know which one of us the spider wants to eat! If you don’t run, I’ll come back for you even if I get away!”","Feng Wu had never sounded so serious.","Feng Xun had no choice but to agree with her.","They only managed to take three steps in opposite directions.","Whoosh!","Two golden spider webs flew in both directions.","Feng Wu was caught by the spider web in mid-air, and so was Feng Xun.","The harder she struggled, the tighter the web became.","Feng Wu knew if she kept struggling, her limbs would be cut off.","She was sure of it.","She looked in Feng Xun’s direction.","Just like her, Feng Xun was wrapped into a cocoon, and that cocoon hung from the spider’s fang on a string.","That was to say, Feng Wu dangled on the spider’s other fang.","Feng Wu turned to Feng Xun.","Feng Xun looked back at her.","Both of them were speechless.","They felt like two human meatloaves.","Feng Wu tried to cut the string with Fallen Star Sword, but the web wouldn’t budge.","She couldn’t free herself from the web.","Hm...","It was so hopeless.","The spider studied the ugly girl.","What’s she thinking? She’s as weak as an ant. Why does she think she can get away?","The spider finally made the difficult decision.","It would eat the ugly one first and keep the nice-looking one for later.","It opened one side of its mouth, lifting the web with Feng Wu inside. She was soon between its teeth.","She could see the spider’s red tongue and smell its stench.","“Are you really going to eat me? Would you like to make a deal?” Feng Wu tried to negotiate with it.","The spider was amazed.","Why did an ant think she could negotiate with her? Had she lost her mind?","Feng Wu said, “I’ve been poisoned, and you’ll die if you eat me. How about I find you more food? There are 50 healthy people on the other side!”","The spider glanced at Feng Wu.","It understood her language.","Feng Wu saw the expression in the spider’s eyes.","The disdain was quite apparent.","“I mean it. I can lure them here, and you can eat as much as you want!” Feng Wu thought she had a chance."]},{"number":3043,"title":"Chapter 3043 You Idiot","paragraphs":["3043 You Idiot","However, the spider shook its head.","Yes, that was what it did.","Feng Wu wanted to continue, but the spider smirked. “Ant, what makes you think you can talk to me?”","Feng Wu was astonished!","She rarely faced a creature so powerful.","Even when she did, they either ignored her or doted on her. None of them had ever sneered at her like this.","Feng Wu still had some cards up her sleeves.","For instance, she still had the Phoenix Pen from Master Linghu.","She wasn’t going to write inscriptions with it because her inscriptions wouldn’t be powerful enough to affect the spider.","She wanted to intimidate the spider with it.","She was confident that the spider was scared of Master Linghu.","That was why she had dared to come to the central region on her own.","She had just put her hand in her pocket, when something jumped out of her sleeve.","“Hey!","“You stupid spider!","“Do you have a death wish?!”","What?","Little Phoenix had come out.","It was such a small bird that it looked tiny on Feng Wu’s shoulder.","Its feathers were standing up, and its face was scarlet red.","It looked furious.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","What was the bird talking about?","This was a Sacred Imperial Spider that even Elder Helian couldn’t defeat!","Feng Wu was trying to push Little Phoenix back into her sleeve, when the spider halted.","It narrowed its eyes and studied Little Phoenix. The bird felt both familiar and unfamiliar. The spider was confused.","“You...”","The longer the spider looked at Little Phoenix, the more uneasy it felt. An old memory seemed to be waking up.","Feng Wu didn’t dare move a muscle.","She could feel the bird’s claws trembling on her shoulder.","At the same time, she could also feel the terrifying energy the bird emanated.","Had Little Phoenix remembered something from its past?","Had it dealt with the Sacred Imperial Spider before?","“Have you forgotten about me? I should have cut off more of your legs.”","Spiders should have eight legs.","When Feng Wu looked at the Sacred Imperial Spider, she realized it only had four.","What?","The Sacred Imperial Spider wasn’t certain at first.","Although it had sensed the bird’s energy, it had been so long that it couldn’t relate this fist-sized bird to Boss Phoenix back then.","The energy felt right, and what the bird said made sense.","Even the fear was the same.","All beasts had an instinctive fear of their superiors. It was an ingrained reaction.","“Why... why....” The spider swallowed.","Little Phoenix snorted. “Have I jogged your memory?”","The Sacred Imperial Spider said respectfully, “Yes, of course. Thank you for sparing my life back then.","Little Phoenix asked, “Now, did you want to eat my little ones?”"]},{"number":3044,"title":"Chapter 3044 Intimidation","paragraphs":["3044 Intimidation","“Your little ones?” the Sacred Imperial Spider repeated anxiously.","Little Phoenix raised its head and snorted.","It didn’t bother to answer that question.","The Sacred Imperial Spider said, “I’m so sorry. I didn’t know they were under your protection...”","“The girl’s so ugly,” the spider thought to itself.","Little Phoenix glowered. “Be nice to each other for the next few days! I need to sleep. Don’t wake me up!”","“Yes, of course...” The Sacred Imperial Spider lowered its head and saluted the terrifying creature that had once turned the Dayless Woods upside down.","Little Phoenix ran back to the storage space.","Feng Wu was perplexed.","So was Feng Xun.","They looked at each other in astonishment.","Feng Wu thought, “Since when was Little Phoenix so intimidating?”","Feng Xun thought, “What did I see just then?”","They both looked at the Sacred Imperial Spider in amazement.","“Phew...”","Little Phoenix sighed in relief once it was back in the storage space.","Feng Wu then communicated with the bird in her mind.","“I didn’t know you’re so amazing! Are you that much stronger than the spider? Can you defeat all the creatures in the Dayless Woods?”","“In your dreams!” Little Phoenix laughed. “What are you thinking?”","Feng Wu said, “What?”","Little Phoenix said, “Can’t you see what I’m like now?”","Feng Wu said, “Well...”","She knew the bird was about her level. As for the spider, it was somewhere between the Spiritual Overlord and Spiritual Saint stages.","Elder Helian was a Spiritual Overlord, and Jun Linyuan was a Spiritual Saint. That was to say, the spider’s capability was between the two of them.","Little Phoenix sighed.","Feng Wu said, “That’s to say... You were...”","Little Phoenix said, “I thought you would never get it. I was bluffing, but that spider is so powerful. It’s no longer that stupid little creature anymore. Sooner or later, it’ll realize what I’ve done.","“I used too much spiritual essence to scare it, and it’ll take me a while to recover. You’re on your own now.”","Feng Wu said, “So, you were bluffing...”","Little Phoenix said, “Of course I was! Creatures like that will back off when you show muscle.","“If I hadn’t done that, that spider would have eaten you! Understood?","“And there’s more —”","Little Phoenix sighed. “You were a little too generous.”","Feng Wu looked perplexed.","Little Phoenix said, “Essence crystals are great stuff, and you can’t find them anywhere else. Can you keep some essence crystals for yourself? If you don’t want them, you can give them to the cub and me.”","Feng Wu was about to reply, when she heard a noise.","Little Phoenix said, “Go. You need to fool the spider now.”","Little Phoenix then went back to its cultivation.","It needed to replenish its spiritual essence. Maybe it would need to do this trick again."]},{"number":3045,"title":"Chapter 3045 Eat Her","paragraphs":["3045 Eat Her","Feng Wu turned her attention to the outside world to find Feng Xun staring at the spider.","The spider was also staring at him.","Its fangs could produce venom, which was its most effective strategy.","The spider licked its fangs and smirked.","Boss Phoenix hadn’t said it couldn’t eat the boy.","“He’s so pretty. I bet he’s very yummy.”","The spider was so hungry that it opened its mouth and quickly approached Feng Xun.","Feng Xun thought he would have a heart attack.","He couldn’t believe what was happening.","Feng Wu returned to herself to find the spider trying to eat Feng Xun. She bellowed, “Hey! What do you think you’re doing?!”","She rested her hands on her waist and glared at the spider.","Feng Xun was speechless.","He didn’t know if he should cry or laugh.","Feng Wu was only a Spiritual King, but the spider was probably a peak Spiritual Saint.","They were a whole stage apart. Feng Wu was so bold.","The spider was confused by Feng Wu’s reprimand.","It stared at Feng Wu like it could eat her at any moment.","If it attacked Feng Wu, she wouldn’t stand a chance.","Feng Xun was so nervous that he didn’t dare make a sound, fearing that his breathing would affect Feng Wu.","His forehead was covered with sweat.","On the other hand, Feng Wu crossed her arms and stared at the spider.","“Aren’t you afraid of me?” the spider asked grimly.","Feng Wu smirked.","The spider said, “Say you’re afraid of me, and I’ll let you go.”","Feng Wu glanced at the spider. “Me? Afraid of you? What gave you that idea?”","The spider studied Feng Wu.","Feng Wu mimicked Jun Linyuan and radiated her energy.","She remembered what Jun Linyuan looked like when he threatened other people. She stopped blinking and fixed her gaze on one spot.","The spider thought, “The girl knows she has a patron. She’s not afraid of me at all.","“Boss Phoenix must be watching over her from somewhere.","“If I do the wrong thing, Boss Phoenix will reappear and chop off the rest of my legs...”","The spider stiffened and stared at Feng Wu.","The ordinary-looking girl brushed her hand over her face, and she suddenly looked completely different.","She was stunning now.","The spider had never seen anyone so pretty before.","“I want to eat her!”","The spider drooled.","To its surprise, the girl then removed her robe to reveal the pink dress underneath.","The bright color set off her alabaster skin, making her even more stunning.","“She’s so beautiful!”","That was all the spider could think of.","It felt dizzy. Was it because it was hungry, or was the girl too pretty?","“I want to eat her!”"]},{"number":3046,"title":"Chapter 3046 Let’s Work Together","paragraphs":["3046 Let’s Work Together","The spider looked around for Boss Phoenix.","Feng Wu smirked. “Do you have a death wish?”","Feng Xun wanted to applaud her.","She was such a good actress that he almost wanted to ask her for pointers.","The spider was a little intimidated.","It stared at Feng Wu. “What do you mean?”","Feng Wu said, “I know I’m not your match. You can eat us any time you want.”","The spider’s eyes lit up.","Feng Wu smirked. “Let me remind you: Boss Phoenix put me in your care. If he comes back and can’t find me... Do you need your memory jogged again?”","The memory was too painful.","The spider gave Feng Wu a dirty look and turned to Feng Xun.","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine.","Luckily, his sister was as smart as she was pretty. She glared at the spider. “Don’t you dare touch him! If you eat him, I’ll tell Boss Phoenix what you did, and he’ll cut off all your legs!”","Feng Xun was almost in tears. He was so glad that he had such a sister.","The spider grew impatient.","“Humans are so annoying! I can’t eat anything!”","Feng Wu had two pets, so she had some idea of how to get through to the spider.","“You don’t seem to have many friends. Everybody avoids this area, and hardly anyone comes in. Have you eaten so many people that no one dares come here?”","The spider glared at Feng Wu. Did she have to bring that up?","“So what if I eat a lot? I hunt my own food. No one can tell me what to do!”","Seeing the spider’s reaction, Feng Wu smiled. “Since we all follow Boss Phoenix’s instructions, why don’t we team up? We can help each other.”","Feng Wu knew that if she wanted to persuade the spider, she needed to come up with a solution.","Now would be a good time.","Before the spider could ask, Feng Wu said, “You’re hungry, but I don’t want you to eat my friend. That’s our main disagreement. In that case, we should find another solution.”","She pointed in the other direction. “There are 50 people in all shapes and sizes out there. I’ll lure them in, and you can have a feast. What do you think?”","What a great idea! The spider almost said yes.","However, it didn’t want to seem so eager.","The spider said arrogantly, “Are they your enemies? Do you want me to kill them for you?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","The spider was smarter than she expected.","Feng Xun was anxious. The spider had discovered Xiao Wu’s plan. Would it eat her?","Feng Wu only smiled. “Why do you care? Will it affect your appetite?”","It wouldn’t, but the spider didn’t want to help a human girl for no reason."]},{"number":3047,"title":"Chapter 3047 Leader of Team 3","paragraphs":["3047 Leader of Team 3","Feng Wu said calmly, “You’ve lived too comfortably for too long. You’re so short-sighted.","“When Boss Phoenix comes back and learns that you’ve been getting along with me, maybe he’ll teach you a thing or two, and you’ll reach the next level.”","The spider said proudly, “I’m a peak Spiritual Overlord!","“Magical beasts are naturally a level higher than humans. You’re only a Spiritual King. You must envy me so much!”","Feng Wu deliberately said, “Are you as good as you say? Will you be able to handle all those people if I lure them here?”","In the end, the spider was just a magical beast, and it reacted just like one.","It was furious.","“Of course I will! I can eat 100 people like you all at once!” said the spider.","Feng Wu said, “I hope you’re as good as you say.”","She grabbed Feng Xun and ran away from the spider, shouting, “We’ll be back!”","But right at that moment!","A gold spider web flew at Feng Xun.","The next second, Feng Wu realized he was no longer beside her.","Looking back, she saw Feng Xun dangling from the spider’s fang again.","She glared at the Sacred Imperial Spider.","The spider snorted. “He’s my hostage!”","Feng Wu couldn’t believe a beast would know what a hostage was.","Staring at the spider, Feng Wu realized it was serious.","“You can’t eat him!” Feng Wu warned the spider.","The spider only smirked in an arrogant manner.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She immediately headed for her destination.","The spider could speak the human language, but it was still a magical beast.","It could turn hostile at any moment.","She had to move fast.","If she didn’t lure the Dongsang teams here in time, the spider might eat Feng Xun.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder and gave Feng Xun a reassuring glance.","Feng Xun wanted to cry, but he shook his head at Feng Wu.","He was telling her to get out and not to return.","Feng Wu gave him one last look before dashing off.","There were seven beast kings in the central region, and the Sacred Imperial Spider was only one of them.","Its territory was only a medium-sized one.","Maybe it had eaten too many people. The Dongsang assassins hardly ever came here.","Until —","Feng Wu heard a noise.","It was those Dongsang assassins sent by Lord Pan.","She had found her target.","She then deliberately made a noise.","The Dongsang assassins had seen two people running into the woods and were looking for them, when they heard the noise.","They all looked up.","The team closest to Feng Wu was Lord Pan’s Team 3; she recognized the team leader.","Feng Wu stood on a tree. When she looked down, her eyes met the team leader’s."]},{"number":3048,"title":"Chapter 3048 Intercept","paragraphs":["3048 Intercept","What a pretty girl!","“Is she a mountain fairy?!”","The team leader was stunned when he first saw Feng Wu, but somebody next to him cried out, “She’s wearing a red dress!”","A red dress?","Those words sounded like a thunderclap in the team leader’s ears.","A stunning girl in a red dress... Feng Wu?!","“Show me that portrait!”","The team member who had alerted him was called Yamaya. He immediately took out a portrait with trembling hands.","He knew he had made a major discovery.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","These assassins were much slower than she expected.","She even had to wait for them to respond.","“It’s her!” The team leader glanced at the portrait and grew excited! “Catch her! She has the Divine Phoenix Blood! She’s Feng Wu!”","“The Divine Phoenix Blood? One mouthful of it can make me so much more powerful!”","“It can make me immortal!”","“Catch her!”","The assassins were so greedy that they seemed to have lost their minds.","Feng Wu pretended to be frightened. She screamed and dashed off.","“Don’t let her get away!”","“Catch her! My Divine Phoenix Blood!”","“Stop her! Tell everybody she’s here!”","“She’s going into the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory! What should we do?”","“Why are you even asking? The spider is dangerous, but the Divine Phoenix Blood is our top priority!”","“We must catch her! If the spider gets her first, even Mr. Sakiya can’t get her out!”","“Move!”","They ran after Feng Wu, regardless of where they were headed.","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder.","When there was enough temptation, even God wouldn’t be able to keep his head on straight, let alone these greedy humans.","Before long, another team arrived.","“What’s going on? Why are you all yelling?”","“It’s Feng Wu! She’s going into the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory! We must intercept her!”","“What? The Divine Phoenix Blood? Catch her!”","These were members of Team 2.","One team chased Feng Wu from behind while the other tried to flank her.","The spider looked at Feng Xun with cold eyes.","Feng Xun dangled at the corner of the spider’s mouth and could feel its patience running thin.","He thought, “Maybe I’ll die here.”","But right at that moment, he heard noise coming toward him.","Feng Xun could see well from where he was hanging.","His eyes widened.","Wearing her red dress, Feng Wu was moving nimbly in the woods.","Behind her was a group of people.","They held all kinds of weapons and were shouting excitedly.","Feng Wu would look over her shoulder and even stop to wait for them every now and then.","Soon, she was in front of the spider."]},{"number":3049,"title":"Chapter 3049 Badges","paragraphs":["3049 Badges","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Your takeaway is here. Enjoy your meal.”","Feng Wu ran behind the Sacred Imperial Spider after that.","The spider turned around and looked at the girl in astonishment.","What was so special about her?","Why were all these people chasing her?","The spider had made some baiting sounds before when it was extremely hungry, but no one took the bait.","It had to leave its territory to hunt for food. That was quite humiliating.","As a result, it would simply go to sleep when it was hungry. When it woke up, the hunger would be gone.","The spider’s mind wandered off, and Feng Wu had to urge it.","“Your web! Use your web!”","That was right!","The spider realized what it could do.","These people had willingly walked into its home.","The spider didn’t use a small web like it had with Feng Wu and Feng Xun.","A giant golden web fell from above.","It was over 100 meters wide.","The web made a whooshing sound as it fell.","“Shit!”","“It’s the Sacred Imperial Spider!”","“The spider web!”","“Run!”","When they had to choose between their lives and the Divine Phoenix Blood, they all chose the former, but it was too late.","The spider web caught them all.","“Ahhh —”","The two teams had ten people in total.","The harder they struggled, the tighter the web became, and the strings cut into their flesh.","The two team leaders knew better, so they shouted at their people to calm down.","But it was too late.","It had been a while since the spider ate, and the smell of human flesh was so tempting.","Feng Wu didn’t know the spider was so big."]},{"number":3050,"title":"Chapter 3050 Scavenger","paragraphs":["3050 Scavenger","Feng Wu’s plan killed over half of the best junior Spiritual Kings of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Of course, Mr. Sakiya didn’t know that yet, nor did Lord Pan.","After sending out his men, Lord Pan was lying comfortably on a tree branch and taking a nap in the sunlight.","He couldn’t imagine a scenario where 50 assassins failed to catch one girl.","He slept soundly, not worrying about anything.","Feng Wu picked up all the badges that the spider had spat out.","The spider couldn’t believe how poor the girl was.","It glanced at Feng Wu. “Why do you want all that rubbish? Are you a scavenger?”","Rubbish?","Feng Wu stared at the spider in amazement.","She could exchange these badges for a military ranking.","She hadn’t graduated yet. Maybe she could become a lieutenant colonel when she handed in these badges. That would be great!","Feng Wu retorted as she picked up the badges, “Rubbish? This is great stuff! I can exchange them for a military ranking!”","The spider snorted.","Feng Xun was astonished as he watched Feng Wu interact with the spider as if the latter were an ordinary person.","Feng Xun’s eyes had widened when Feng Wu lured in the first batch of Dongsang assassins.","However, she lured in even more after that.","Therefore, Feng Xun didn’t stop being astonished.","He watched as the spider killed all 50 assassins.","He calculated the badges in his head.","If those people were all majors, each badge would be worth 600 points. There were 50 badges here...","That was...","Feng Xun sucked in his breath.","That was 30,000 points!","Feng Xun was so shocked that it took him a while to remember how the points worked.","To become a major, one had to defeat ten enemies of their own level, which was equivalent to 6,000 points.","There were more than enough here!","Feng Wu had long passed that threshold.","How many points did a lieutenant colonel need?","36,000.","Yes!","6,000 more points and she would be a lieutenant colonel!","Holy crap...","Feng Xun was so shocked that he wanted to cry.","The girl was even chatting with the spider as if they were neighbors. Had the girl forgotten that she was only a junior Spiritual King?","Feng Wu didn’t like the spider’s tone.","She said, “Why are you laughing at me? I should be laughing at you! How can you eat so much?!”","The spider was so full that it lay on its side.","Once its stomach was full, it didn’t seem so sinister anymore.","It said, “I haven’t been this full for so many years.","“Since you’re a scavenger, there you go.” The spider pointed at a spot."]},{"number":3051,"title":"Chapter 3051 Laughter","paragraphs":["3051 Laughter","With a full stomach, the spider seemed almost amiable.","It pointed at a spot, but Feng Wu didn’t think much of it.","The more indifferent she was, the more insistent the spider became.","“It’s right over there, just past that big tree.” The spider lightly kicked Feng Wu in the butt. “Don’t be so lazy. Go.”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at the spider. Who was lazy here?","She decided not to argue with a peak Spiritual Overlord.","Wow!","Feng Wu’s eyes suddenly lit up.","The spider must have eaten quite a lot of people over the years, and they must all have badges.","The idea excited Feng Wu, and she went to fetch Feng Xun.","“Badges! It must be badges!” Feng Wu said affirmatively. “We hit the jackpot!”","Feng Xun eyed her suspiciously. “Are you sure? Why would that spider be so helpful?”","Feng Wu said, “Because we’re buddies now!”","Feng Xun rolled his eyes and knocked her on the head. “Wake up. That’s a peak Spiritual Overlord. What are you? Buddies? Do you know if it’s male or female?”","He almost left a red mark on Feng Wu’s forehead.","Feng Wu wouldn’t take it.","She would show Feng Xun she was right.","They reached a spot to find a pit in the ground.","To call it a pit was an understatement.","It was as large as a football field.","What was that smell?","“I think that’s the spider’s feces,” said Feng Xun.","Feng Wu couldn’t believe it.","Seriously?","Where were the badges?","She then heard a burst of laughter.","Turning around, Feng Wu saw the spider cracking up.","It laughed so hard that the woods shook. One would think it was an earthquake.","Seeing the look on Feng Wu’s face, it laughed even louder.","Blue veins popped on Feng Wu’s forehead.","That spider!","It was making fun of her!","She ran back to its side and kicked it from behind. “How dare you make fun of me! D*mn you!”","The spider laughed so hard that its voice turned hoarse.","Feng Xun didn’t react as fast as Feng Wu. By the time he knew what had happened, Feng Wu was kicking the spider.","Feng Xun’s eyes popped.","Did that girl have a death wish? What was she doing?!","To his disbelief, the man-eating spider was laughing so hard that it ignored what Feng Wu was doing.","Feng Xun felt the beast king wasn’t anything like he had been taught before.","Feng Wu kicked the spider again. “Stop laughing!”","By the time the spider stopped, it was already in tears."]},{"number":3052,"title":"Chapter 3052 Good Job","paragraphs":["3052 Good Job","“You’re so funny. Here’s a reward for you.” The spider then pointed at another spot 100m behind it.","Feng Wu said, “Do you think you can fool me again?”","The spider asked, “Are you going or not?”","Feng Wu said, “Fine; I’ll take a look!”","She then asked Feng Xun, “Are you coming?”","Feng Xun was tired of all the walking around. He sat down on a stump and waved Feng Wu off.","The spider was surprised again by how unpredictable Feng Wu was.","All the humans it had met were stiff and dull. None of them were as lively as this girl.","She was full of energy and very adorable.","The spider watched Feng Wu walk away before turning to Feng Xun.","The kindness was gone, and the greed was back.","It suddenly felt like it could have another snack.","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine.","“My dear sister! I’m coming!”","He ran as fast as his legs could carry him.","He almost looked like an afterimage.","The next second, he was by Feng Wu’s side.","Feng Wu was crouching by the edge of a pit, looking down with sparkling eyes.","“Our spider is so lovely! Look! There are so many badges!” Feng Wu didn’t look back when she spoke to Feng Xun.","Feng Xun was still covered in cold sweat.","“Lovely?!”","Feng Xun shouted, but he immediately changed his tone.","“Yes... I suppose it’s quite lovely...”","Feng Wu pointed at the pit the size of a basketball court. “Do you see those bones? Beneath them are the badges!”","Feng Xun said, “That’s right!”","Feng Wu nudged him. “Go get them.”","Feng Xun asked, “Why me?”","Feng Wu feigned a sad tone. “Well, if you want to see a pretty girl rummaging through a pile of bones, I guess I can go...”","“I’ll do it!” Feng Xun cut her off.","He was filled with guilt. “Aren’t I a good brother? A good brother would never let his sister do such a thing!”","“You’re the best brother in the world!”","Feng Wu used her most adorable voice.","Feng Xun scratched his head and felt like the happiest man.","After that, the young lord rolled up his trousers and crawled around in the pile of bones.","Feng Wu stayed on the surface and cheered for him.","“You’re the best!","“Good job!","“This is great!","“Brother...”","The spider then joined them and looked at her in surprise.","Feng Wu wanted to keep the partnership running. “Are you still hungry?”","The spider still felt full.","Feng Wu tried to provoke it. “Don’t tell me you’re full! You told me you could eat 100 people! Were you lying to me?!”","The spider said, “No, I wasn’t! I can eat 100 people!”"]},{"number":3053,"title":"Chapter 3053 Here You Go","paragraphs":["3053 Here You Go","Feng Wu smiled at the spider.","The spider glanced at Feng Wu. “I mean it!”","To prove itself, the spider said, “If you don’t believe me, you can bring more people here, and I’ll eat them!”","Feng Wu rubbed her nose. “Alright. I’ll find some more people, but it’ll take time.","“I heard there was a fire in the center of the woods, and a lot of people have gathered there.”","“You mean Peacock’s territory, don’t you?” The spider smirked. “That peacock isn’t the most friendly in the forest. If you upset it, you’re dead!”","Feng Wu said, “Boss Phoenix will protect me!”","“Boss Phoenix pulled off all its feathers, and it has been trying to take revenge ever since. It’s not as nice as me. Bring up Boss Phoenix’s name, and that bird will eat you alive!”","Feng Wu burst into a cold sweat.","She asked Little Phoenix in her head, and Little Phoenix searched its memory before telling Feng Wu in an uncertain tone, “I don’t remember anything from that far back.","“If my memory serves me right, I did do something like that to a fierce little peacock. I think I roasted it over a volcano, too.”","Feng Wu was astonished!","Over a volcano?","Was that supposed to be a barbecue?","Feng Wu was shocked.","How many magical beasts had this bird messed with?","Feng Wu sighed inwardly and turned to the spider. “Can the people of the Dongsang Kingdom move freely in its territory?”","The spider found it an idiotic question.","Feng Wu gave it an innocent look.","Now that the spider knew Feng Wu a little bit better, it couldn’t send Feng Wu to her death. “The people over there worship that peacock. They only need to ask for permission to go in.”","Feng Wu asked, “Do my people not worship it?”","The spider sighed. “You don’t even have a Semi-Divine medicine refiner. What can you offer us in worship?”","A Semi-Divine medicine refiner?","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Can I bribe a beast king with the medicine created by a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?”","The spider said proudly, “Not necessarily. We only accept certain types of pills. Why do you ask? You’re just a girl...”","The spider had complicated feelings about Feng Wu, finding her rather refreshing but also wanting to eat her.","When those people said she had the Divine Phoenix Blood, the spider had to fight hard to suppress the urge to eat her.","Feng Wu glanced at the spider. “You want to eat me, don’t you?”","The spider had a hard time suppressing its instinct. If Little Phoenix hadn’t threatened the spider, it might have done whatever it wanted.","The spider stared at Feng Wu, the look in its eyes becoming fierce.","Feng Xun felt a chill run down his spine.","He ran to Feng Wu’s side and shielded her with his own body. “Eat me! Leave her alone!”","Feng Wu patted him to calm him down.","Feng Xun said, “Quiet!”","The look in the spider’s eyes became sinister.","Feng Wu took out her little cauldron."]},{"number":3054,"title":"Chapter 3054 Immortal Spiritual Fruit, Wait for Me","paragraphs":["3054 Immortal Spiritual Fruit, Wait for Me","Feng Wu rather liked this portable cauldron.","She started making some pills in front of the spider.","The Sacred Imperial Spider didn’t know what Feng Wu was doing at first and only sneered at her.","The girl wasn’t very capable, and Boss Phoenix couldn’t protect her forever.","Yes, she was lovely, but that was negligible compared with the Divine Phoenix Blood.","When Feng Wu took out the mini cauldron, the spider didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu ignored the spider and started making her pills.","She alone would decide what her value was.","The spider was astonished when a Semi-Divine golden pill appeared in the cauldron.","“You —”","It stared at Feng Wu.","She was only a girl.","By the standard of magical beasts, she was just a cub.","However, she had just made such a pill.","The spider didn’t want to accept it, but it all happened right in front of its eyes.","It had to be blind to deny what had happened.","The Sacred Imperial Spider finally understood why the girl was so confident in herself.","She was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, which was very rare in human society.","The spider finally respected Feng Wu for what she was rather than seeing her as a pet.","“You’re good.” The Sacred Imperial Spider kept its gaze on Feng Wu and spoke in a solemn tone.","Feng Wu threw the pill at the spider.","“Shall we talk about our partnership now?”","Of course, the spider wouldn’t say no.","...","Apart from Feng Xun, nobody knew what their agreement was.","Feng Wu soon left, leaving Feng Xun behind.","The spider ignored him and started cultivating.","Before Feng Wu left, the Sacred Imperial Spider gave her a golden spider, which represented the Sacred Imperial Spider.","The other six beast kings would respect that golden spider. As long as Feng Wu didn’t offend them, they wouldn’t attack her.","Feng Wu carefully put the golden spider in her pocket and put on a disguise.","Before long, an ordinary-looking Dongsang girl with a dull face and thin frame appeared in the woods.","Feng Wu came out of the woods to discover in astonishment that Lord Pan was still sleeping.","He was snoring loudly.","Feng Wu had three choices.","She could sneak up on him and kill him right now.","Or she could ask the Sacred Imperial Spider to kill him.","The third option was to avoid him and head for the Peacock King’s territory.","Feng Wu made the decision after pondering for a minute.","Lord Pan was more capable than any of those Dongsang assassins. She wasn’t sure she could kill the man without disturbing him. Getting the spider here in time would be a problem, too.","Therefore —","Feng Wu sprinkled something when she walked past Lord Pan.","She then headed for the center of the woods without waking up the man.","Immortal Spiritual Fruit, wait for me!","The Sacred Imperial Spider was right. With the golden spider on her, all the beast kings let her through their territories without giving her any trouble.","The Sacred Imperial Spider had described to her how the central region was divided into seven areas and had shown her where they were."]},{"number":3055,"title":"Chapter 3055 Similarity","paragraphs":["3055 Similarity","If Feng Wu hadn’t demonstrated her strength as a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, the spider would never have treated her as an equal.","Feng Wu suddenly realized why this place seemed familiar.","It looked a lot like the city she used to reside in in her previous life.","The central area was the city center, and the seven beast kings’ territories were seven districts around it.","When the spider asked her if she had remembered the map, she immediately said yes.","The spider thought she was bragging, but she really remembered it.","The layout was very similar to the city in her previous life.","She just needed to travel along the borders of the districts, and she wouldn’t offend those beast kings.","She was right. Nothing happened during her trip, and she reached the Peacock King’s territory without incident.","The Peacock King knew somebody had entered its territory.","However, the Dongsang Kingdom worshiped the Peacock King, and it could live with the Dongsang people walking on its land.","Moreover, Feng Wu was giving off the energy of a Dongsang assassin, so the Peacock King ignored her.","It only turned around and went back to sleep.","The Peacock King snored, which wasn’t graceful at all.","Feng Wu sensed its intimidating energy, but she only smiled.","She had already figured out a way to handle the Peacock King.","The only thing she needed to take care of was that legendary Mr. Sakiya.","She would run into Dongsang assassins every now and then, but she looked like an assassin, just like them, so they didn’t pay her much attention.","Moreover, they usually covered their faces with masks, which made them even more unrecognizable.","They could only tell one another by the energy they gave off.","All Dongsang people had that unique energy, and a person from the Junwu Empire couldn’t fake it.","Because of that, they weren’t worried about spies.","The Dongsang Kingdom was quite relaxed in that aspect.","However, they shouldn’t have been too confident about that since Feng Wu was an exception.","After entering the Peacock King’s territory, she noticed much fewer assassins.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit tree grew somewhere near the crater of the volcano, so Feng Wu slowed down when she was close enough.","Mr. Sakiya could be nearby.","She heard noise up ahead, and she concealed her energy.","Hiding in the bushes, she looked through a gap in the leaves.","A fire burnt violently on a cliff nearby; even the sky seemed to be burning.","The color was magnificent.","Dense energy filled the air.","Feng Wu could sense that the spiritual essence was much denser here.","On the contrary, the air was much thinner.","To cultivate here, she would need to survive first.","Cultivation came later.","If she could live, it would only take her half the time to cultivate.","Feng Wu already felt light-headed after crouching here for a while.","She realized sadly that this place wasn’t suitable for cultivators below the Spiritual Overlord stage.","logo"]},{"number":3056,"title":"Chapter 3056 Bu Jingyu","paragraphs":["3056 Bu Jingyu","Feng Wu concentrated on the surroundings and looked down the slope.","There was a valley at the foot of the cliff.","The sun was setting, but Feng Wu could still see what was down there.","She was amazed.","There was a house near the crater of the volcano.","It wasn’t an ordinary courtyard with all four walls.","Rather, it was a cottage.","In front of the cottage was a lawn, which had been mowed.","The grass seemed so soft.","A table had been set, and someone was making tea on a small stove. The man had long hair and was reading in a chair.","He was an elegant and refined middle-aged man.","The book fitted perfectly in his hands.","Mr. Sakiya!","That name came to Feng Wu’s mind.","Her breathing quickened a little, and Mr. Sakiya immediately looked in her direction.","Luckily, Feng Wu moved away from that spot a second ago and slowed down her breathing again.","Mr. Sakiya returned to his book.","Feng Wu quietly left the bushes.","She only stopped holding her breath when she was over 1,000 meters away from Mr. Sakiya.","Her forehead was covered in sweat.","She didn’t know how sharp Mr. Sakiya was, but his cultivation alone already posed a great threat.","He was definitely more advanced than a Spiritual King.","He was probably a Spiritual Overlord.","Feng Wu wanted to cry.","She had worked so hard to become a Spiritual King, but when she came to Peace Grassland, she found this place overrun with Spiritual Overlords.","She crouched in the bushes, rubbed her chin, and racked her brain.","Only an disorganized person would think improvising was a good idea. Feng Wu always had a plan.","She saw the tree.","Mr. Sakiya almost spotted her, not because she had been excited to see him.","It was because she had seen the tree.","The tree weren’t hidden.","It was right there in plain sight.","Mr. Sakiya was sitting by it.","The Dongsang Kingdom had actually built a house next to it.","Mr. Sakiya was sitting there and waiting for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit to ripen.","Feng Wu saw a translucent fruit already dangling over Mr. Sakiya’s head.","It was so eye-catching.","It was right there.","Feng Wu wished she could grab the fruit and run, but she couldn’t do that.","She couldn’t handle Mr. Sakiya, let alone all the assassins nearby.","Feng Wu rubbed her nose as she tried to come up with a plan.","Just then, she heard a voice.","“Miss Mu Yan, do you think the Divine Phoenix Blood is real?”","It was a man’s voice.","Mu Yan? Feng Wu recognized that name.","She remembered that name because she recalled the gossip about Mu Yan, who seemed to have slept with the crown prince of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Feng Wu remained silent.","Mu Yan snorted. “The Divine Phoenix Blood? Bu Jingyu, since when did you become so stupid?”"]},{"number":3057,"title":"Chapter 3057 Action","paragraphs":["3057 Action","Bu Jingyu didn’t know what to say.","He flushed. “But according to the information I received, Feng Wu has the Divine Phoenix Blood. My master seems to believe it.”","Feng Wu thought, “If he can move freely in this area, he can’t be an ordinary soldier.”","Mu Yan was an important figure in the Dongsang Kingdom.","Who was Bu Jingyu’s master? Could it be...","That middle-aged man popped into Feng Wu’s mind, and she narrowed her eyes.","She was right!","Mu Yan cast a stern look at Bu Jingyu. “Are you using your master to intimidate me?”","Bu Jingyu said, “Of course not.”","Mu Yan said, “Mr. Sakiya is your master, not your father. He won’t like you flaunting his power like this. If he gets angry, he’ll kick you out. You won’t be the first.”","Bu Jingyu seemed scared. “My master is the best. He’s the cleverest man in the world.”","Mu Yan snorted. “Not necessarily.”","Bu Jingyu was surprised. “Do you mean that there is someone smarter than my master?”","Mu Yan said, “Yes, of course.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Who?”","He didn’t mention Night Owl, apparently already convinced that the crown prince wasn’t as wise as Sakiya.","Mu Yan pointed in the direction of the fortress. “He’s our enemy.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Do you mean that crown prince?”","Feng Wu kept very still at the mention of Jun Linyuan.","She wrapped her arms around her knees and hid in the tall grass. The two people had no idea she was there.","They didn’t use Jun Linyuan’s name and only referred to him as “that crown prince.” That was how much Jun Linyuan intimidated them.","The conversation continued, so Feng Wu sat down in the grass.","Mu Yan nodded, and her expression softened. “Yes, I’m talking about him. He’s so intelligent and resourceful that even Mr. Sakiya isn’t his match.”","“That’s impossible!” Bu Jingyu worshiped his master and would never tolerate such a statement.","Mu Yan smirked. “I know Mr. Sakiya is farsighted and prudent, but I saw with my own eyes how that crown prince defeated him. You weren’t around back then. That’s why you know nothing about it.”","Bu Jingyu puffed out his cheeks, displeased.","Mu Yan patted him on the head. “You’re only 12, and your master took you out of that place. No one’s stopping you from worshiping him. I know Mr. Sakiya is extremely intelligent, but this world is full of capable people.","“Don’t get angry, though. That crown prince won’t live for much longer.” Mu Yan’s voice was filled with sorrow.","“Of course he’ll die! When our crown prince takes the pill made from the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, he’ll wake up, and that crown prince will be in a coma forever. After that, our crown prince will destroy their fortress!”","Bu Jingyu spoke excitedly.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","In a coma forever?","Destroy the fortress?","That boy was dreaming!"]},{"number":3058,"title":"Chapter 3058 Into the Grass","paragraphs":["3058 Into the Grass","He looked into a girl’s bright eyes.","Before he could make a sound, Feng Wu raised her hand.","She jabbed a few of his acupoints, and he could neither speak nor move.","Bu Jingyu glared at Feng Wu, but she only grinned. “You’re very upset, aren’t you?”","The boy grunted and tried to struggle.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “You don’t need to know who I am, and I’m not letting you go either.”","Bu Jingyu thought, “My master will kill you!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “I don’t think your master can kill me. Enough with the chitchat. Answer my questions.","“Tell me your name, your identity, everything!”","Bu Jingyu stared at her.","Feng Wu sighed. “I don’t have much truth serum left. Why are you forcing me to use it?”","Truth serum?!","Bu Jingyu frowned, but Feng Wu had already poured the truth serum down his throat.","Bu Jingyu tried to resist, but Feng Wu wouldn’t let him.","Before feeding the truth serum to him, Feng Wu removed his robe and put it aside.","Bu Jingyu didn’t know what Feng Wu was doing, but he had a very bad feeling.","She was asking about his personal information and had removed his robe.","What did she want to do?","He didn’t want to tell her anything, but the serum was too potent, and he eventually told her everything she wanted to know.","Feng Wu now had a complete profile of the boy.","She needed it for her roleplay."]},{"number":3059,"title":"Chapter 3059 Not Stealing","paragraphs":["3059 Not Stealing","It had never taken her so much effort before to pretend to be somebody else, but this time, her opponent was Mr. Sakiya, who was supposedly the cleverest man in the Dongsang Kingdom. She couldn’t afford to make any mistakes, or she would be doomed.","These woods were filled with Dongsang assassins. If her cover was blown, she could only imagine how miserable her death would be.","Feng Wu made Bu Jingyu tell her all his habits and how he interacted with Mr. Sakiya.","Bu Jingyu panicked when he saw Feng Wu put on his robe.","“What are you doing?” Bu Jingyu’s voice shook.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “What do you think?”","She quickly put on her mask in front of him.","Because she had to copy Bu Jingyu’s expressions to a tee, she was more careful than ever.","She deliberately agitated Bu Jingyu so that she could see how Bu Jingyu looked when he was shocked, pleased, or in pain.","She had to nail all the nuances.","The devil was in the details.","Meanwhile, Bu Jingyu went through hell.","He thought he would have a nervous breakdown.","The girl made him feel like in heaven one moment and in hell the next.","The emotional roller coaster almost drove him insane.","While Bu Jingyu was in agony, Feng Wu suddenly turned away from him.","When she turned back to face Bu Jingyu, she looked exactly like him.","She stared at Bu Jingyu and asked in astonishment, “Who are you? What do you want?!”","Bu Jingyu was shocked.","Holy crap!","Her tone and expression were identical to his when he was shocked.","Even Bu Jingyu felt like he was looking at himself.","Feng Wu wasn’t very tall, but Bu Jingyu was only a slim 12-year-old boy. When she wore his robe, Feng Wu looked just like him from behind.","Bu Jingyu burst into tears.","Feng Wu patted him on the head and grinned. “Be a good boy and stay here. I’ll set you free when I finish my task.”","Bu Jingyu said, “Will you set me free?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Of course.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “What do you want?!”","Feng Wu was amazed. “Haven’t you already guessed?”","Bu Jingyu was confused, before terror filled his eyes.","He said, “Don’t tell me...”","Feng Wu nodded.","“No! That’s impossible!” Bu Jingyu shook his head repeatedly. “My master is guarding the fruit! You can’t steal it! You’re dreaming!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “Steal? It belongs to the person who can take it, understand?”","Bu Jingyu wanted to argue with Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t get so excited. Go to sleep now, and everything will be over when you wake up.”","She waved her hand, and the teenager fainted."]},{"number":3060,"title":"Chapter 3060 The Most Painful Choice","paragraphs":["3060 The Most Painful Choice","Feng Wu hid him in a cave hidden behind tall grass.","Would Bu Jingyu ever wake up?","Feng Wu cleared her throat, straightened her clothes, and headed for the cottage.","Bu Jingyu was about the same age as Feng Xiaoqi, and Feng Wu knew exactly how to mimic a boy of that age. She looked just like him.","She had a plan.","She would enter the cottage first to see the situation inside. Once she built up her confidence, she would go see Mr. Sakiya.","Sakiya was too observant and sharp. He might catch her tiniest mistake.","Although the Dongsang Kingdom thought no one could mimic their energy, what if there was an exception?","Feng Wu stuck to the other end of the yard to avoid Mr. Sakiya.","However —","“Ahem!”","Mr. Sakiya’s gaze was still on the book, but he suddenly cleared his throat.","Well...","She couldn’t pretend she hadn’t heard that.","Mu Yan found it rather strange. She told Feng Wu, “Your master is summoning you.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Fine. She couldn’t ignore him.","Luckily, the more complicated the situation was, the calmer she became.","She also needed to behave like Bu Jingyu.","According to Bu Jingyu, he was quite a naughty boy and skipped school a lot. His master often disciplined him for that. Sakiya had told him to memorize a text, but Bu Jingyu said he was going out for some fresh air.","Bu Jingyu swore to himself that he would never do such a thing again.","He didn’t know if he would get a second chance.","Feng Wu stopped when she was a meter away from Sakiya, and her slim shoulders trembled a little.","She stole a glance at Sakiya but immediately lowered her head, fearing that he might see through her cover.","All that information came from Bu Jingyu.","Feng Wu’s imitation was so precise that Sakiya didn’t realize that she wasn’t his student.","Sakiya kept his gaze on the book while he spoke to his student.","“Where were you?”","He didn’t sound angry, but his tone was still intimidating.","Feng Wu cringed. “I... I got tired when I was memorizing the text, so I went for a walk...”","It wasn’t the first time that his student had snuck off.","Sakiya pinched the bridge of his nose.","If his student didn’t come from a special background, he wouldn’t cut him so much slack.","Sakiya finally put down the book and stared at his young student. “You got tired?”","Feng Wu had been watching the Immortal Spiritual Fruit above Sakiya’s head. It was so tempting.","Immortal Spiritual Fruit...","Her Immortal Spiritual Fruit...","She just wanted to grab it and run!","She did some calculations and realized she could never pull it off.","Fine.","She took a deep breath and fought back the urge.","Wait!","Apart from the one dangling over Sakiya’s head, there was another one in the thick canopy.","Two Immortal Spiritual Fruits?!","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","She was thrilled.","She had been wondering about something until now.","Jun Linyuan needed the Immortal Spiritual Fruit to activate his bloodline, but Bao Er also needed it urgently. It was the hardest choice to make."]},{"number":3061,"title":"Chapter 3061 Two Immortal Spiritual Fruits","paragraphs":["3061 Two Immortal Spiritual Fruits","Feng Wu had been ignoring that fact.","However...","If she could take both Immortal Spiritual Fruits, she wouldn’t need to make that difficult choice.","Feng Wu frowned when she realized that the Immortal Spiritual Fruits wouldn’t ripen at the same time.","The one above Sakiya’s head was about ripe, but the one hidden in the leaves still needed a while.","That made things much trickier.","Feng Wu was racking her brain, but Sakiya frowned.","He was never pleased with this student, who was dumb, lazy, and liked to wander off. The boy had too many flaws.","Seeing that his student’s mind had wandered off again, Sakiya frowned.","He put the book on the table and glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was immediately wrapped in the energy of this capable cultivator.","Ssss —","Feng Wu drew in her breath!","She didn’t know if Sakiya was knowledgeable enough to teach the crown prince, but she was certain that he was capable enough to train the crown prince in his cultivation.","This capability...","It was terrifying!","Sakiya looked at his student in disappointment and shook his head.","He wanted to send the boy away, but he changed his mind when he recalled the boy’s background.","He only glanced at his student. “If memorizing the text gave you a headache, that means you put your heart into it.","“Recite ‘On Morals’ for me.”","Mr. Sakiya kept his sharp gaze on Feng Wu.","He had already anticipated what would happen.","The boy wouldn’t remember anything from that book.","“On Morals, is it?” Feng Wu looked at Sakiya.","Sakiya read his book and wouldn’t talk to her.","Feng Wu was speechless.","A few people stood in the distance, and one of them was Mu Yan.","As a Supreme Level medicine refiner, Mu Yan knew how to pick and preserve the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, which was why she was here.","A general was also among those people.","He was General Guchi, one of Sakiya’s capable subordinates.","Lord Pan, who was still sleeping, was General Guchi’s subordinate.","The third person was the steward of this team, and he was in charge of taking care of their daily necessities.","They looked in Sakiya’s direction when they heard the master testing his student.","Mu Yan sighed. “Bu Jingyu is finished.”","General Guchi asked, “Hasn’t he memorized that text?”","Mu Yan said, “No, he didn’t even try. He snuck off again. When I found him, he was watching some ants in the grass.”","Guchi frowned. “Mr. Sakiya’s patience is running out.”","Mu Yan nodded. “I think the boy will be on his way soon.”","Guchi and Mu Yan smiled wryly at each other.","However...","“It is quite meaningless to speculate upon unspoken thoughts...”","Feng Wu put her hands behind her back and started reciting the text.","“On Morals” was such an easy piece for her, an avid reader.","She hesitated when she recalled what Bu Jingyu was like.","She observed Sakiya’s expression as she recited the lines."]},{"number":3062,"title":"Chapter 3062 Master and Student","paragraphs":["3062 Master and Student","Feng Wu recited the text while stealing glances at Sakiya.","He was as mysterious as he was said to be.","He kept his eyes on the book and remained unperturbed.","Feng Wu couldn’t read anything on his face.","...","“The world knows that beauty is beauty because...” That was the second chapter.","“Don’t pay too much attention to prominent personages so that the people won’t fight for power...” That was the third chapter.","...","“On Morals” had 81 chapters in total.","Feng Wu had reached chapter 10 and felt that was enough for Bu Jingyu’s level.","However, Sakiya was still flipping through his book and paid little attention to her.","Feng Wu was speechless.","What choice did she have?","She sighed inwardly and went on reciting.","“Colors make a person blind. Music makes a person deaf...”","...","She kept going, and Sakiya closed his eyes at some point, listening to her recitation with great ease.","The three people’s eyes widened in surprise.","That boy couldn’t remember anything, but now, he had memorized On Morals!","He didn’t pause or hesitate.","He could only recite the first three chapters the day before, and Sakiya threw the book in his face.","“The way of heaven is to do benefit and do no harm...”","Finally, Feng Wu recited the entire On Morals without making a mistake.","She studied Sakiya’s expression, and the man seemed to have stiffened a little.","It was as if he was trying to control his facial expression.","She wondered if she was wrong.","Feng Wu looked around and happened to meet Mu Yan’s gaze.","She saw the astonishment on Mu Yan’s face.","Feng Wu became nervous. Had she done too well?","“Master...” Feng Wu stammered as if she didn’t know what to do.","Sakiya finally opened his eyes.","His expression remained unperturbed, but deep down, he was shaken to the core.","His student had recited 5,000 words without making a single mistake.","Only one day before, he was...","That was why he said he needed to take a walk. Memorizing so many words must have given him a headache!","Sakiya looked at his student, and his expression softened.","He waved at Feng Wu. “Come over here.”","Sakiya’s long white robe reached the ground. In the moonlight, he almost looked like a celestial being from another realm.","Feng Wu looked like the celestial being’s servant.","She had to convince herself that she was Bu Jingyu.","She knew Sakiya had the sharpest eyes, and it was very hard to fool him.","She could only convince him if she became a second Bu Jingyu.","If she failed, she would die."]},{"number":3063,"title":"Chapter 3063 An Old Acquaintance","paragraphs":["3063 An Old Acquaintance","Sakiya asked Feng Wu to move closer.","Of course, Feng Wu couldn’t say no, although moving closer meant her cover was more likely to be blown.","Feng Wu slowly walked to Sakiya’s side.","Sakiya rubbed her head. “Not bad.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","What was happening?","Didn’t Bu Jingyu say his master was very strict with him?","According to the boy, his master never said anything nice to him and would either scold him or give him more homework.","However, Sakiya was so kind to her. Feng Wu was perplexed.","Seeing how his student was surprised by this sudden expression of favor, Sakiya was hit by a pang of guilt.","He wondered if he had been too strict with his student.","He had only softened his tone a little, and the boy was so touched.","Sakiya chastised himself and waved at Feng Wu. “Off you go. Enjoy your night off.”","My night off?!","Feng Wu was astonished once more.","Bu Jingyu had told her that his master never gave him any free time.","That boy lied to her!","She would kill him when she could!","She was glad she could get away from Sakiya for a while because that man was too clever!","Feng Wu happily ran into one of the cottages, and Mu Yan was waiting for her there.","There were over a dozen cottages, and Sakiya occupied the three in the middle.","Mu Yan and Guchi took up the other cottages.","As for the other assassins, they could sleep in the trees at night. Building too many houses would enrage the Peacock King.","This place belonged to that bird.","Mu Yan dragged Feng Wu to the side as soon as she went inside.","She stared at Feng Wu in amazement. “Bu Jingyu, that was amazing! How did you memorize all those things?”","How would the real Bu Jingyu react?","Feng Wu had talked to the boy and knew how vain and proud he was. He wouldn’t show any modesty.","Hence, she raised her eyebrow and glanced at Mu Yan. “What’s so difficult about that? Those are just words!”","Mu Yan sighed. “You couldn’t do it before!”","Feng Wu said, “You don’t know how hard I worked! I didn’t know I had it in me!”","She knew Sakiya could hear their conversation.","Her words were for him.","She didn’t know Sakiya felt guilty for how he treated his student.","Just then, a person came out.","“Miss Mu, the raw materials are ready.”","Feng Wu immediately recognized the person.","Wasn’t her name Sakurin?","Feng Wu had fought this girl in a leather dress in the arena earlier.","The girl had a child-like face but was very well-endowed. Many teenage boys couldn’t take their eyes off her chest.","Sakurin was the one who had asked for Fuhara’s help, but Fuhara was later decapitated by Feng Wu.","Why was she here?","Seeing Feng Wu stare at Sakurin, Mu Yan smacked her on the head. “Bu Jingyu, you’re only 12! You’re way too young to stare at a girl like that!”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She had just been feeling amazed at the difference between their cup sizes.","She was sure she was the more adorable one.","Mu Yan suddenly asked Sakurin, “I heard you fought that Feng Wu earlier?”"]},{"number":3064,"title":"Chapter 3064 Are You Serious?","paragraphs":["3064 Are You Serious?","Mu Yan suddenly asked Sakurin, “I heard you fought that Feng Wu earlier?”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","They were talking about her!","She had to listen carefully.","Feng Wu pricked up her ears.","Mu Yan and Sakurin walked away as they talked, and Feng Wu followed them.","The two young women didn’t notice Feng Wu.","Sakurin said, “Yes, I’ve met that Feng Wu.”","Mu Yan sat down and gestured for Sakurin to sit down beside her.","She then asked in a seemingly casual tone, “I heard Feng Wu is very pretty?”","Feng Wu couldn’t help but glance at Mu Yan.","She then looked at Sakurin.","She was curious about what other people thought about her.","Her mother was the most beautiful woman in the Junwu Empire, so she was very confident in her own beauty.","However, Sakurin seemed to be describing a different person.","Sakurin smirked. “Pretty? I don’t think so.”","Mu Yan’s eyes lit up.","“She’s not?”","Sakurin said grimly, “No, she’s not pretty at all. I don’t think she’s that different from every other human being.”","Of course, Sakurin hated Feng Wu.","After Feng Wu defeated her, Sakurin fetched Fuhara to help her, but Fuhara was killed by Feng Wu in the end.","Sakurin hated Feng Wu to the bone.","She could never view Feng Wu in an objective way.","“I see.” Mu Yan was relieved.","Sakurin said, “She’s nowhere near as pretty as you.”","She wanted to work for Mu Yan. Seeing the latter feeling threatened by Feng Wu’s beauty, Sakurin began to slander Feng Wu.","Truth or not, Mu Yan liked what she heard.","“You flatter me.” Mu Yan shook her head. “There’s no need to say such nice things about me. I know I’m the prettiest person only in the Dongsang Kingdom.”","Sakurin didn’t know what to say.","Mu Yan asked, “I heard Feng Wu is very capable. Is that true?”","Sakurin couldn’t bring herself to tell Mu Yan that she was indeed the prettiest person in the Dongsang Kingdom. Hearing the question, she was glad to change the subject. “Who told you that? That’s such an overstatement.”","Mu Yan was pleased, but she still feigned a surprised tone. “Is that not true?”","Sakurin said, “Of course not! Feng Wu is only a Level 2 Spiritual King!”","Mu Yan said, “I heard she won battles in the junior arena.”","Sakurin said, “Well... Well, that’s because all our capable people are here, guarding the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","In fact, the Dongsang Kingdom had been watching the tree for a while.","Night Owl was bold enough to fight to the death because he knew what the fruit could do.","Fearing that Mu Yan wouldn’t believe her, Sakurin said, “Lord Pan has the best Level 3 and Level 4 Spiritual Kings in our kingdom. Any of them can kick Feng Wu’s ass!”","Feng Wu stared at Sakurin in astonishment. Was she serious?"]},{"number":3065,"title":"Chapter 3065 Abashed","paragraphs":["3065 Abashed","Sakurin had no idea that Lord Pan’s talented assassins had been swallowed up by the Sacred Imperial Spider before being spat out as bones.","“All Feng Wu knows is to brag about herself!” Sakurin smirked.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Mu Yan was glad to hear that.","“There’s something else...” Mu Yan finally got to the question she wanted to ask the most.","“I heard that Jun Linyuan...” Her tone softened when she mentioned that name. She paused a little before asking, “Is Jun Linyuan in love with Feng Wu?”","Sakurin almost jumped to her feet.","She stared at Mu Yan. “Please don’t tell jokes like that! It’s not funny!”","Mu Yan was surprised by her reaction.","Sakurin said angrily, “That’s impossible! Who told you that? It’s a malicious lie!”","Mu Yan asked, “Is that not the case?”","Sakurin said, “Of course not!","“You have no idea what Feng Wu is like...”","Feng Wu watched Sakurin curiously.","Sakurin made a displeased noise. “Feng Wu is willing to die for the crown prince; that’s how much she likes him!”","Feng Wu had been listening with her chin resting on her hands, but she was dumbfounded when she heard this.","No! I’m not! That’s not true! thought Feng Wu. She sat up and had “no” written all over her face.","However, Sakurin was so focused on slandering Feng Wu that she didn’t notice the look on the “boy’s” face.","Nor did Mu Yan notice Feng Wu’s reaction.","She was very pleased, but she still feigned a concerned tone. “Is that so? That’s a bit over the top.”","Sakurin said, “If the crown prince is in love with Feng Wu, I’ll chop my head off!”","Feng Wu blurted out, “Great!”","Her stomach lurched when she said that.","She wondered why she was confident enough to say that. Surely, His Royal Highness wasn’t...","Oh, no.","Feng Wu felt so abashed that she wanted to bury her face in her hands.","Sakurin and Mu Yan were surprised by her loud voice. They both turned around and glared at “Bu Jingyu.” “What can you possibly know about this subject? This isn’t a place for kids. Get lost.”","They pushed Feng Wu out of the room.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She looked back at Sakurin and Mu Yan and thought about the quickest way to form a friendship.","The best way was to find a common enemy and say bad things about the latter together.","With a common enemy, two people would soon become best friends.","Feng Wu was speechless.","That worked every single time.","Sakurin was much lower in status, but she and Mu Yan were holding hands now.","Feng Wu never thought she would contribute to their “friendship.”","There was nothing new about their conversation, so Feng Wu decided to leave them. She had much more important things to do.","She stood by the door and looked at the tree."]},{"number":3066,"title":"Chapter 3066 The Fruit Is Ripe","paragraphs":["3066 The Fruit Is Ripe","She would use one Immortal Spiritual Fruit for Jun Linyuan and keep the other one for Bao Er.","Perfect!","A smile appeared on Feng Wu’s face.","Wait!","She suddenly returned to her senses.","She was daydreaming!","The two Immortal Spiritual Fruits would ripen at different times.","One was almost ready, while the other one needed over two weeks.","How was she going to steal the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit, wait here for two weeks, and take the other fruit?","Another option was to remove the entire tree.","Was that doable?","Feng Wu inched toward the tree until she was right next to it.","She looked at the roots and shook her head.","Moving the tree would be extremely difficult.","Somebody had set up a formation around the tree.","It was a Level 9 formation.","Feng Wu was astonished!","What did that mean? A formation of that level cost a tremendous amount of energy.","The frightening question was, who created this formation?","Elder Mei of Imperial College was only a Level 8 formation master.","How expensive!","Feng Wu scratched her head. She was a Level 8 formation master at most, and there was nothing she could do here.","She hadn’t gained enough experience yet.","It was deep into the night, and Sakiya was resting in a chair.","He was following his student’s every move.","“What are you looking at?”","Sakiya glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was speechless.","So, he wasn’t asleep.","Had he seen how she was drooling over the fruit? Feng Wu was flustered.","“Come over here,” Sakiya said solemnly.","Feng Wu cringed a little and wondered what Sakiya was up to.","She moved as slowly as possible, but had to stand by Sakiya in the end.","Sakiya rubbed his temples when he saw his student’s reaction.","“If you’re interested in formations, put your heart into it,” said Sakiya with his eyes closed. “I told you to memorize the manual on Level 3 formations. Have you done that yet?”","Sakiya didn’t know what else he could do.","He was the only Level 9 formation master in the Dongsang Kingdom, but his student was so lazy and dumb.","“Memorize that book. Don’t come out until you’ve done that!” Sakiya said harshly.","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow.","It seemed Sakiya was the Level 9 formation master who had set up this formation.","Sakiya was as talented as he was said to be.","Sakiya suddenly moved, and the next second, he was holding the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Feng Wu was astonished!","That fruit!","Her fruit!","Why did it have to come off now?","The other one was still in the tree, and she was flustered when she saw the one in Sakiya’s hand.","Was it impossible for her to obtain both of them?","Feng Wu suppressed her heartbeat so that Sakiya wouldn’t sense it.","There was no need to do that, though.","Sakiya was as excited as she was.","Of course, he didn’t let any of his emotions show."]},{"number":3067,"title":"Chapter 3067 No Other Way","paragraphs":["3067 No Other Way","Sakiya headed for the cottage, and Feng Wu followed him.","He had the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Things were happening so fast and out of her control.","Feng Wu followed Sakiya and racked her brain.","!!","The fruit had come off so suddenly. How could she get it back?","It had to fall into Sakiya’s hands, of all people. How hopeless...","Feng Wu looked at the tree.","The other fruit would need at least half a month to ripen, not to mention it was protected by a Level 9 formation.","Maybe she could try to solve it, but Sakiya was watching her every move. How could she steal that fruit?","No, that fruit could wait. This fruit was more important.","Sakiya reached the cottage when Mu Yan and Sakurin came out of it, holding hands.","Mu Yan was thrilled to see the fruit.","“Mr. Sakiya, is it ripe?”","Sakiya nodded. “The first one is. Refine it now. His Royal Highness is waiting.”","Mu Yan held the fruit with both hands in excitement. “Of course! Once I make the medicine, His Royal Highness can take it, and his cultivation ability will recover.”","Sakurin said, “After His Royal Highness takes this medicine, the other crown prince will...”","Sakiya gave her a cold glance.","Sakurin immediately stopped talking.","“Go,” Sakiya told Mu Yan.","Mu Yan nodded, “Yes, of course.”","To keep the Immortal Spiritual Fruit fresh, they had built a refinement room here.","The fire they used was from the volcano.","That was why they had picked this spot.","The medicine made by the fire of the volcano would be extraordinary.","Feng Wu watched as Mu Yan took the Immortal Spiritual Fruit into the room and closed the door behind her.","Sakiya then set up a formation outside the room.","A Level 9 formation would consume too much spiritual energy, so he set up a Level 8 formation instead. However, he added a series of inscriptions on top of it.","How meticulous!","Feng Wu’s plans were rendered futile by these defensive mechanisms.","Feng Wu searched her brain.","Sakiya suddenly looked up and glanced at her. “Why are you still here?”","“What?” Feng Wu was caught off guard.","“There.” Sakiya pointed at the room next door. “Don’t come out until you’ve memorized the Level 3 manual!”","Feng Wu said, “But, Master...”","Sakiya stuffed a book into Feng Wu’s hands.","“Memorize this as well while you’re at it.”","Feng Wu put on a disappointed expression.","Sakiya didn’t leave. He stood on the porch and looked up at the sky.","Everything was under his control.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to do.","Why wouldn’t the man get a life? Why did he have to watch over everything?"]},{"number":3068,"title":"Chapter 3068 Tread Carefully","paragraphs":["3068 Tread Carefully","“Understand?” Sakiya stared at Feng Wu, his tone calm but intimidating.","It seemed he was losing his patience.","Feng Wu ran inside and closed the door.","What should she do now?","She paced up and down the room, her head spinning.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit wasn’t that hard to refine. With Mu Yan’s skills, it would take her about two hours to finish the job.","After that...","Feng Wu put herself in Sakiya’s shoes.","If she were him, would he send the medicine back this very night, knowing that his crown prince was in urgent need of it?","Obviously, the answer was yes.","Would he do it himself?","Definitely!","The next two hours would be the only time that Sakiya would be separated from the fruit. If she wanted to do something, now was her only chance.","Feng Wu took a deep breath and asked herself, “Shall I take the risk?”","It would be dangerous. She had to tread carefully, or she would be killed.","If she didn’t do something now, she would lose the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, and Night Owl would recover his strength earlier than Jun Linyuan.","After that, Night Owl would attack the fortress...","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched when she imagined the possible consequences.","She didn’t have a choice. She had to do it!","Taking a deep breath, she recalled how Sakiya set up the formation.","That was Sakiya’s mistake.","He could never have expected that his student had been replaced.","The “boy” not only wasn’t his student, who couldn’t understand a Level 3 formation, “he” was also a Level 8 formation master!","Feng Wu never forgot anything she had seen, and she had the Phoenix Pen.","Feng Wu recalled all the details of the formation and knew she could solve it.","However, when she looked out the window, she saw Sakiya still standing in the same spot and looking to the horizon.","She tried to figure out how to solve the formation and sneak into the refinement room without making a sound.","Her gaze landed on the wall.","The refinement room was covered by Sakiya’s formation, and that room was right on the other side of the wall.","That was her only chance.","Feng Wu crouched down by the wall and worked on the formation.","A Level 8 formation was within her capability. She moved very slowly so that Sakiya wouldn’t hear her.","She finally opened a crack in the formation and erased the inscriptions with the Phoenix Pen.","When she stole a glance at the window, she saw Sakiya still standing there with his back to her.","Even the wisest man could make a mistake.","Sakiya thought all he needed to do was guard the door, and had overlooked what was going on inside the room.","Feng Wu just happened to be a skillful formation master, and she possessed the Phoenix Pen.","She quietly dug a tunnel under the wall.","The room was right next door, so she didn’t need to do much.","Before long, she dug a tunnel wide enough for her to pass through.","And there was no time to lose.","She entered the tunnel and emerged behind Mu Yan, who was refining the Immortal Spiritual Fruit."]},{"number":3069,"title":"Chapter 3069 Clever Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3069 Clever Feng Wu","Mu Yan murmured to herself, “I’m so good at this. I’m a Supreme Level medicine refiner. That Feng Wu isn’t my match!”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Mu Yan then sighed. “If Night Owl uses this fruit, what about Crown Prince Jun? I feel sorry for him. Do I like him more than Night Owl?”","Feng Wu listened in amazement.","She didn’t know what to say!","The woman should be concentrating on her work!","She was so distracted that her refinement could fail at any moment!","She was working on the Immortal Spiritual Fruit!","However —","It seemed her worst fear was about to come true.","Something suddenly happened.","Mu Yan paled because she had made a mistake.","Flames rose out of the cauldron, almost burning her face.","Feng Wu wanted to slap this woman.","What was she thinking? She would never succeed!","Feng Wu hit the woman on the back of her neck.","Feng Wu was a Level 3 Spiritual King, and she spared no effort. Mu Yan passed out right away.","The fire was still burning.","It contained the Peacock King’s terrifying energy.","Feng Wu was going to grab the half-finished potion and leave the room, but she heard Sakiya’s voice outside.","He must have noticed the noise.","“Mu Yan?” Sakiya’s tone was still very authoritative.","Feng Wu sighed when she saw Mu Yan lying on the ground with half her clothes burned off. She had no choice but to reply, “Yes, sir?”","Sakiya asked, “Is everything alright?’","Feng Wu said, “It’s nothing serious.”","Sakiya said, “Alright.”","He was silent after that, but Feng Wu knew he had become more vigilant.","Feng Wu looked at the potion and knew she had no choice but to finish the refinement.","She was a much better medicine refiner than Mu Yan. Using the fire from the volcano, she made a golden potion that gave off the most pleasant aroma.","The smell filled the room and floated out the window.","Sakiya must have smelled it because Feng Wu heard his footsteps.","He walked back and forth outside, and even his footsteps sounded pleased.","Feng Wu could guess what he was thinking.","With this potion, Night Owl would recover first. They could destroy the fortress and Northern Border City. After that, they could invade the entire empire.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","She would never let them do that.","The potion was finished.","As for Mu Yan... Feng Wu had refined the skin of the Immortal Spiritual Fruit while making the potion, and the liquid was green.","Ordinary Immortal Spiritual Fruit potion was indeed green.","Only Feng Wu knew what she had put in that green potion.","She left it in the cauldron and returned to her room with the golden one.","To stop the aroma from spilling out, Feng Wu put the potion in her storage space.","She returned to her room safely."]},{"number":3070,"title":"Chapter 3070 Astonished","paragraphs":["3070 Astonished","She returned to her room safely.","After that, she filled in the tunnel, leaving no traces behind.","Even if Sakiya noticed something, he wouldn’t suspect “Bu Jingyu.”","After noticing that there were two Immortal Spiritual Fruits, Feng Wu had been thinking of how to use Bu Jingyu’s status.","If she wanted to blow her cover, she could slip away now.","However, she would need to make some arrangements if she wanted to use this identity again.","Luckily, Feng Wu had been preparing for that the whole time.","Sakiya frowned, feeling he had waited for too long.","Guchi asked, “Shall I check on her?”","It had been two hours, and Mu Yan had said it wouldn’t take her longer than that.","Sakiya nodded.","Guchi knocked on the door, but Mu Yan was still lying unconscious on the floor.","Feng Wu’s blow knocked her out for an hour, and the knocking woke her up.","What?","Mu Yan slowly opened her eyes.","She had a slight headache and struggled to sit up.","She was suddenly struck by a thought, and she jumped to her feet.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","She remembered something had gone wrong, and there was a big fire...","“Gosh!” she cried out.","That potion was for Night Owl. If something went wrong, Sakiya would kill her!","Her cry startled the people outside.","Guchi and Sakiya looked at each other.","The next second, Sakiya broke his own formation without knocking on the door.","“What happened?” Sakiya asked Mu Yan, his face darkening.","Mu Yan was quite a sorry sight.","Nearly half of her clothes had been burned off. She had some of her eyebrows, and her face was blackened by the smoke.","Sakiya rushed to the cauldron.","He couldn’t care less if Mu Yan died, but nothing could happen to the Immortal Spiritual Fruit!","He was relieved when he saw the green potion in the cauldron.","He then asked Mu Yan, “What happened?”","Mu Yan wanted to cry. She couldn’t bring herself to tell him that she had failed.","She had promised him that it would be a piece of cake.","“I... I...”","Mu Yan was about to apologize for her failure, when she spotted the green potion in the cauldron.","Holy crap!","Wasn’t that the potion she had been trying to make?","It couldn’t be anything else!","But...","Mu Yan remembered there had been an accident halfway through the refinement, but she couldn’t remember what happened after that.","Mr. Sakiya had set up a formation, and it was impossible for anybody to come in. That was to say...","Mu Yan reached a shocking conclusion.","And that was...","I made the potion in my sleep!","OMG!","I’m amazing!","Mu Yan was astonished by her supposed talent."]},{"number":3071,"title":"Chapter 3071 She’s the Devil (1)","paragraphs":["3071 She’s the Devil (1)","Sakiya frowned and stared at Mu Yan. “What’s wrong?”","He had very keen senses.","Mu Yan now realized that the potion had been made.","She had to say she made it, regardless of what actually had happened.","She met Sakiya’s gaze and said solemnly, “Mr. Sakiya, I did run into some problems during the refinement, but it was nothing serious.","“Look. Here’s the potion.”","She put the liquid in a bottle and handed it to Sakiya.","Sakiya still felt something was off and kept his gaze on Mu Yan.","Mu Yan smiled wryly. “Mr. Sakiya, you set up a formation around this room. No one could come in.","“I’ve been here by myself this whole time.","“Everything is perfectly fine,” Mu Yan promised.","Only then did Sakiya take the potion.","Feng Wu had been eavesdropping.","She pricked her ears like a rabbit.","She thought Sakiya would head for the Dongsang castle known as “Sun” and give the potion to Night Owl.","In that case...","That would be perfect!","Feng Wu was very pleased.","However...","The world didn’t revolve around her.","Now was a perfect example.","Sakiya didn’t head for Sun Castle right away.","Instead, he knocked on Feng Wu’s door.","Knock, knock, knock —","She was confused.","Why was he here?","She had no choice but to open the door. “Yes, master?”","She couldn’t tell anything from Sakiya’s expression.","He was as unperturbed as always.","He only glanced at her and said, “Ask the Peacock King to come here.”","The Peacock King?","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","Why did he need the Peacock King here?","Why did she have to do it?","Why couldn’t it be Guchi?","Guchi chuckled. “Only Jingyu can do the job because the Peacock King doesn’t talk to anybody else.”","Sakiya nodded.","Feng Wu was amazed. She didn’t expect that ordinary boy to be so useful.","Why didn’t that little b*stard tell her?","Sakiya said, “The Peacock King favors you; you should be honored. Don’t step over the line. You may offend that creature.”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, master.”","She left the cottage after that.","She knew where the Peacock King was, but she couldn’t understand why Sakiya wanted to talk to the Peacock King when he already had the potion.","Feng Wu was confused, but she knew one thing.","She had to send the potion back first.","Jun Linyuan had to get well.","The whole empire depended on him.","Feng Wu soon formed a plan.","Instead of going to see the Peacock King, she went to fetch Bu Jingyu first.","The real Bu Jingyu.","She tapped Bu Jingyu a few times, and the boy slowly woke up.","He was confused at first."]},{"number":3072,"title":"Chapter 3072 She’s the Devil (2)","paragraphs":["3072 She’s the Devil (2)","He jumped to his feet as soon as he recalled what happened.","However, he was still tied into a bundle, so he fell to the ground right away.","“Y- you —”","Bu Jingyu stared at the girl.","He remembered that she had knocked him out, and he had been lying on the ground.","After that...","The last thing he could remember was her hitting him on the back of his neck.","Feng Wu smiled and handed him a roast chicken.","“There you go.”","Bu Jingyu said proudly, “I don’t accept handouts!”","Feng Wu clapped her hands. “That’s very honorable of you. So be it. You can stay here and starve to death.”","“You!” Bu Jingyu glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure you don’t want it? Shall I gag you and leave you in the cave?”","Bu Jingyu said, “How dare you?!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “I’ve done that already, haven’t I?”","Bu Jingyu was from a highly respected family, and his master was the famous Sakiya. However, there was nothing he could do about Feng Wu’s threat.","As he stared at the roast chicken, his stomach rumbled.","He had been left here for so long without water or food.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Bu Jingyu snatched the chicken from her hands and wolfed it down.","Feng Wu watched him with a smile.","What an interesting boy.","Bu Jingyu only realized something when he finished the chicken.","“Why are you so nice to me all of a sudden?”","Feng Wu grinned.","Bu Jingyu’s eyes widened.","“You! You!”","He glared at Feng Wu. “You didn’t put poison in that chicken, did you?”","Feng Wu smiled mysteriously.","Bu Jingyu tried to throw up, but Feng Wu patted his stomach. “Don’t worry. I didn’t poison you.”","Bu Jingyu stared at her. “Really?”","Feng Wu said, “Yup.”","However, he saw her as a devilish person and didn’t believe a word she said.","Feng Wu said, “Your master told you to fetch the Peacock King. You should get going now.”","She then handed him the robe she had taken from him.","Bu Jingyu ground his teeth and hesitated.","Somehow, he felt the pretty girl had set him up.","Feng Wu stood up and waved at him. “See you next time, baby boy.”","She soon walked out of his sight.","Baby boy?!","Bu Jingyu was terrified.","Something felt terribly wrong.","What did she mean by “see you next time”?","He never wanted to see her again!","The poor boy didn’t understand what Feng Wu meant. If he did, he would burst into tears.","Bu Jingyu was utterly confused. He had to tell his master to catch that evil girl!","At that thought, Bu Jingyu cleaned himself up and rushed back to the cottage.","“Master! Master!”","Mu Yan was kneeling at Sakiya’s feet.","Sakiya turned his cold gaze on Bu Jingyu when he returned.","“Where’s the Peacock King?” Sakiya asked.","Bu Jingyu thought, What Peacock King?"]},{"number":3073,"title":"Chapter 3073 She’s the Devil (3)","paragraphs":["3073 She’s the Devil (3)","He then recalled what Feng Wu had said earlier.","“Your master told you to fetch the Peacock King.”","The Peacock King could wait. The most important thing was...","Before Bu Jingyu could say anything, Sakurin, who was also kneeling on the ground, said, “Mr. Sakiya, I think Mu Yan did something to the potion.”","Bu Jingyu frowned. He had only been locked up for a while, but why couldn’t he understand what everybody was talking about?","Sakiya glanced at Sakurin, encouraging her to continue.","Sakurin said, “Mu Yan is in love with Crown Prince Jun.”","Sakiya stared at Mu Yan.","Mu Yan said, “I’m not! Sakurin, how can you say that?!”","Bu Jingyu was dumbfounded.","What was going on?","Nothing seemed to make sense.","Bu Jingyu turned to Guchi for help.","Guchi whispered, “The potion Mu Yan made went wrong. She cut down on the materials and kept some potion for herself.","“That’s not it. She even poisoned the crown prince’s potion!”","Bu Jingyu said, “What?!”","He had only been gone for a little while; why was the Immortal Spiritual Fruit already ripe and had been turned into a potion? What about that poison?","He then recalled the smile on Feng Wu’s face when she left.","That girl was the devil!","She, she...","“Jingyu, I thought you went to invite the Peacock King. Where is it?” Guchi asked.","Bu Jingyu didn’t know what to say.","Guchi’s face darkened. “Jingyu, I know you’ve memorized On Morals, but it’s way too early to be so proud of yourself!”","Bu Jingyu was dumbfounded. Since when could he do that?","He couldn’t understand a word in that book!","He was clever enough to deduce what had happened from what Guchi and Feng Wu said.","The discovery made him want to cry.","Not only did she impersonate him, she also interacted with the people here.","Mu Yan was said to have cut down on the materials. Could it be...","Bu Jingyu wanted to tell the truth, but he realized something else.","The girl had fooled somebody as wise as his master. Not only that, she had also taken the real potion and framed Mu Yan for it.","Was that girl even human?","Bu Jingyu was panic-stricken.","He felt his master might not be the girl’s match.","Guchi frowned. “Jingyu, is there something wrong?”","Everything was wrong!","He had all these secrets, but the problem was that Feng Wu had done those things while pretending to be him. If these people found out what happened, he would be dead!","Bu Jingyu finally understood why the girl gave him food and set him free.","She knew he would keep the secret for her.","Not only that, he would also cover her tracks.","She was the Devil itself!"]},{"number":3074,"title":"Chapter 3074 Show Off (1)","paragraphs":["3074 Show Off (1)","Mu Yan and Sakurin started bickering.","They blamed each other for what happened.","Sakurin pointed at Mu Yan. “You’re in love with the enemy’s crown prince. You told me so!”","Mu Yan said, “You’re lying!”","Sakurin said, “If you’re not in love with him, what happened to the potion? There’s less of it, and the concentration is wrong!”","Mu Yan said, “I’m not good enough, alright?!”","Sakurin said, “What happened to the remaining juice?”","Mu Yan said, “I wasn’t careful enough and burnt it in the refinement!”","Sakiya kept his gaze on Mu Yan the entire time.","He let Sakurin argue with Mu Yan, hoping to find some clues.","However, Mu Yan didn’t reveal anything.","Sakiya glanced at Bu Jingyu. “Where’s the Peacock King?”","Bu Jingyu cringed.","He had forgotten all about it!","“I...”","Just then, they heard an eerie chuckle outside.","It was the Peacock King.","Bu Jingyu couldn’t believe it.","He never went to see the bird. Why was it here?","The girl’s face popped into his head.","Could it have been her?","If that were the case, she would have to predict every move.","Was she a clairvoyant?","Bu Jingyu was so frightened that he froze.","Once the Peacock King was here, the atmosphere became strange.","Bu Jingyu believed his master was about as capable as the Peacock King, because Sakiya didn’t stand up to greet it.","“You wanted to see me?” the Peacock King asked arrogantly.","Sakiya nodded and threw that bottle of potion to the Peacock King.","He was good at many things, but medicine wasn’t one of them.","Because of that, he let Mu Yan refine the Immortal Spiritual Fruit instead of doing it on his own.","If he hadn’t been such a meticulous person, he wouldn’t have examined the concentration of the potion with his spiritual essence. That was how he had discovered something was wrong.","Being a magical beast, the Peacock King had acute senses when it came to medical potions.","The Peacock King glanced at Sakiya. “Is it for me?”","Sakiya said politely, “Would you please examine it for me?”","The Peacock King felt the bottle before unplugging and smelling it. The bird then dipped its talon into the potion and gave it a little taste.","Sakiya never looked away from the Peacock King’s face.","The Peacock King was thinking about the girl in the red dress.","It had never seen such a bold human before.","She had stood in front of it and stretched out her hand.","She asked, “Would you like to cooperate with me?”","The Peacock King almost laughed.","The girl was only a junior Spiritual King, which was an ant in comparison to the Peacock King. Why did she think she had a bargaining chip?","However, the Peacock King glanced at the girl’s hand to find a pill there.","It was a Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill.","The Peacock King’s eyes lit up.","Magical beasts fought and got injured all the time.","They would usually find some herb to eat afterward.","However, that was only because they didn’t have any other choice."]},{"number":3075,"title":"Chapter 3075 Show Off (2)","paragraphs":["3075 Show Off (2)","If herbs were so useful, human cultivators could eat them directly. They wouldn’t value medicine refiners so much.","Medicine refiners could combine hundreds of herbs together, and the medicine was much more effective than individual herbs.","Moreover, that was a Semi-Divine pill.","The seven beast kings in the central area all had tempers, and they fought all the time.","Fights led to injuries.","If one of them could get their hands on such a pill, it would be like having an extra life.","Hence, the Peacock King put away its arrogance and smiled at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you afraid I’ll snatch it from you?”","To its surprise, the human girl only beamed at it.","“If you do that, you won’t have any more pills. Do you want it to be a once-off thing, or would you like a constant stream of Semi-Divine pills? I think the answer is obvious.”","The Peacock King was amazed by the girl.","By the time the Peacock King realized what had happened, it had agreed to her terms.","The Peacock King then realized Sakiya was staring at it.","The bird felt a little flustered.","“Ahem!”","The Peacock King stared back at Sakiya. “Do you want it or not?”","Sakiya asked, “Is it toxic?”","The Peacock King said, “No, it’s not.”","Sakiya asked, “Are you sure?’","The Peacock King recalled what that girl said.","She said, “If Sakiya shows any signs of doubt...”","The next moment, the Peacock King poured the potion down its throat.","Everybody was astonished.","Sakiya frowned a little.","Of all the magical beasts, the Peacock King knew herbs the best. That was why there was an Immortal Spiritual Tree in its territory.","The Dongsang Kingdom had to pay a small fortune to buy that tree from the Peacock King.","But now, it had drunk all the potion.","The Peacock King wasn’t afraid.","The girl said she had poisoned the potion and had given the antidote to the Peacock King.","If Sakiya doubted the Peacock King’s conclusion, it could simply drink the potion.","It wouldn’t be poisoned and could have the potion for nothing. Moreover, she would give it another Semi-Divine pill afterward.","What a sweet deal!","Feng Wu’s prediction was right.","Sakiya was a paranoid man. Once he started questioning something, he wouldn’t stop until he found an answer.","Even Mu Yan couldn’t fool him, let alone Bu Jingyu.","Therefore, the Peacock King would have to tie up the loose end.","Bu Jingyu was relieved when the Peacock King drank the potion.","When his master glanced at him, he thought he was going to be caught.","Sakiya glared at the Peacock King.","The Peacock King said indifferently, “You didn’t believe me, so I had to prove it to you. What’s wrong with that?”","Sakiya didn’t know what to do with the greedy Peacock King.","Either way, he didn’t dare give the potion to the crown prince.","He glanced at the Immortal Spiritual Tree.","Fortunately, there was one more."]},{"number":3076,"title":"Chapter 3076 Touch and Go (1)","paragraphs":["3076 Touch and Go (1)","Just then, they heard hurried footsteps approach them.","“General Guchi! General Guchi!”","The person sounded like he was about to cry.","Wasn’t that Kim Pan?","If Feng Wu were here, she would immediately recognize this man.","It was none other than Lord Pan, who had been sleeping in a tree while his people went out to hunt Feng Wu.","Lord Pan couldn’t understand it.","He had only been going to take a midday nap, but when he woke up, it was already dark.","That shouldn’t have been an issue because he didn’t need to personally go after Feng Wu.","However, where was she?","Lord Pan knew he had ten teams that consisted of his best junior Spiritual Kings.","General Guchi had done him a favor by making him the leader of the ten teams.","Where was everybody?","At first, Lord Pan just thought the others had traveled further than expected.","However, the longer he waited, the more uneasy he felt.","He tried to contact those people through the badges to tell them to come back.","To his horror, no one responded.","He wanted to talk to individual team members, and found their names had turned gray.","That was to say...","No!!!","Lord Pan’s eyes widened in terror.","How was that possible?","He looked in the direction of the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory and seemed to feel the cold gaze of the spider.","Terrified, Lord Pan ran toward the Peacock King’s territory.","The Dongsang Kingdom worshiped the Peacock King, and it normally wouldn’t kill the Dongsang people.","Lord Pan’s arrival disturbed the peace in the cottage.","“General Guchi, Mr. Sakiya, something terrible has happened!","“They’re all dead!”","...","Sakiya and Guchi looked at each other, and Sakiya frowned. “Who’s dead?”","“Those 50 people!","“The 50 junior and intermediate Spiritual Kings in my group are all dead!”","Guchi’s pupils contracted.","Even Sakiya couldn’t believe his ears.","There were many junior Spiritual Kings, but Pan’s teams had the most elite ones.","“You —”","Sakiya almost had a heart attack.","He had just lost the potion, and his best 50 assassins were gone. Sakiya felt his head pound.","“Mr. Sakiya!”","Sakiya’s face was so livid that Guchi thought he was going to faint.","Taking a deep breath, Sakiya said, “Tell me what happened!”","Pan was about to speak, when Sakiya smirked. “If you keep anything from me...”","The threat in his tone couldn’t be any more obvious.","Pan trembled but didn’t dare withhold any information.","His teeth chattered when he spoke again.","“There was a girl in a red dress. It had to be Feng Wu!” Pan described how they had met Feng Wu in the woods. “I saw them follow her into the woods before I took my nap.”","“A nap?” Sakiya asked differently.","Pan was scared out of his wits. “Sir, I was... Please forgive me!”"]},{"number":3077,"title":"Chapter 3077 Touch and Go (2)","paragraphs":["3077 Touch and Go (2)","Sakiya asked mildly, “Are you referring to Feng Wu, the girl with the Divine Phoenix Blood?”","Pan nodded. “Yes, it was her.”","Sakiya nodded. “Did your 50 people disappear in the spider’s territory?”","Pan said, “Yes.”","Sakiya almost felt sorry for Pan. “That’ll be all.”","Pan was surprised.","Was Sakiya letting him off?","Before he could do anything else, he realized his head had separated from his body.","His head flew, and blood gushed out of his neck.","Sakiya decapitated the man with a wave of his sleeve.","Pan couldn’t make another sound.","He was dead.","The last thought in his mind was what he used to say.","Mr. Sakiya always killed someone with a smile on his face.","That was why Sakiya had seemed sorry for Pan.","Pan only knew how terrifying Sakiya was when he was killed.","“Master, where are you going?”","Bu Jingyu followed his master.","Instead of answering the question, Sakiya said to the Peacock King, “Since you don’t have anything else to do, how about another deal?”","The Peacock King smiled. “I’m listening.”","“Do my kingdom a favor, and I’ll give you three Supreme Level Golden Crow pills.”","Despite having lost 50 excellent junior Spiritual Kings, Sakiya soon calmed down.","They would have no useful junior Spiritual Kings for a while.","Before, the Peacock King would have agreed to the terms, but Feng Wu had raised its expectations, so it shook its head.","“What about five?” Sakiya frowned.","“I want a Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill,” the Peacock King said greedily.","Sakiya was a little displeased, but he still nodded. “Alright.”","He and the Peacock King then headed for the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory.","Bu Jingyu and Mu Yan were very curious.","Everybody followed Sakiya.","At the same moment, Feng Wu was heading for the Junwu Empire’s border, right after she made that deal with the Peacock King.","It was still very dangerous.","She didn’t know if she could fool the Peacock King.","As soon as Jun Linyuan drank the potion that was in her pocket, he would get his ability back.","All problems would be solved.","QUICKLY!","Jun Linyuan must have the potion!","The Dongsang Kingdom was on the move.","In the fortress, Elder Helian was shocked by the news Xuan Yi brought him.","“What?!","“Feng Wu went to look for the Immortal Spiritual Fruit on her own?!","“In the central region?!","“Is she even human?","“Has she forgotten what her capability is like?","“She’s only a junior Spiritual King!","“I know she’s talented. Her grades are proof of that, but it still can’t change the fact that she has only been cultivating for a few years.","“The seven beast kings can kill her without breaking a sweat!”","Elder Helian was panic-stricken. He raised his head to look into a pair of terrifying eyes."]},{"number":3078,"title":"Chapter 3078 Feng Wu’s Fault","paragraphs":["3078 Feng Wu’s Fault","Elder Helian was so anxious, but when he raised his head, he met a pair of terrifying eyes.","His Royal Highness?!","Elder Helian greeted the teenager. “Your Royal Highness!”","The crown prince had woken up! How exciting!","!!","Jun Linyuan asked coldly, “What were you talking about?”","Elder Helian couldn’t help but complain to Jun Linyuan.","“Your Royal Highness, that Feng Wu is ridiculous! She went into the Dayless Woods all by herself!","“Not only that, she also went to the central region to find the Immortal Spiritual Fruit!”","The central region?","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","There was a murderous look in the crown prince’s eyes.","Elder Helian went on. “We’ve just received news that the fruit is indeed there. It’s in the Peacock King’s territory, but the Dongsang Kingdom learned the fact earlier than we did. Sakiya himself is guarding the tree!”","Elder Helian looked like he was about to cry. “That girl is only a junior Spiritual King; she’s as weak as an ant in those woods! How can she be so bold?!”","Xuan Yi gave Jun Linyuan an anxious glance.","He hadn’t expected to see Jun Linyuan when he came to see Elder Helian.","Seeing the look on Boss Jun’s face, Xuan Yi knew they were in trouble.","The crown prince turned around, supporting himself on the doorframe.","Xuan Yi panicked and went after the crown prince.","Elder Helian was perplexed. “What’s wrong? Where are you going?”","Xuan Yi shouted, “Gather our people! We’re going to the Dayless Woods, the Peacock King’s territory!”","It took Elder Helian a moment to digest that information.","What?","What?!","Holy crap!","Elder Helian finally realized the crown prince was going to rescue that girl!","Yes, she was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, which was very important. Even if His Royal Highness didn’t do anything, Elder Helian would get that girl back.","His Royal Highness was so weak that he needed to support himself on the wall just to walk around. Go into the woods?","Oh no!","It was all Feng Wu’s fault!","If anything happened to the crown prince, what would become of the Junwu Empire? Elder Helian couldn’t imagine it.","What should he do now?!","He had to stop the crown prince!","However, when Elder Helian blocked Jun Linyuan’s way, Jun Linyuan glared at him. “Helian, do you have a death wish?!”","Elder Helian was speechless.","How terrifying!","The crown prince didn’t need his spiritual energy to intimidate other people.","He had no choice but to let Jun Linyuan go.","Jun Linyuan stumbled along the wall and took out a jade plate.","“Feng Tian!","“I don’t care if you’ve found that thing. Come back to me now!”","There was no warmth in Jun Linyuan’s voice.","Feng Tian?","Feng’s calm voice came from the other end. “Your Royal Highness, I’ll need two hours.”","“You have the two hours. One minute late, and you can collect my body.”","Even without his spiritual essence, the crown prince was as handsome as ever.","People followed him with admiration in their eyes.","Like Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan also carried a concealing jade."]},{"number":3079,"title":"Chapter 3079 Do We Have to Save Her?","paragraphs":["3079 Do We Have to Save Her?","There were no more than three pieces of concealing jade in this world, and Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan each had one.","Outsiders didn’t know that the crown prince had lost his ability. They only saw that he was a little pale.","If Jun Linyuan wanted to do something, no one could change his mind.","The only person who could do that was in the Dayless Woods.","!!","Xuan Yi was worried sick, but there was nothing he could do but stay by Jun Linyuan’s side.","Meanwhile, Elder Helian was exasperated.","He had to gather his people.","Their three most capable cultivators were confronting the three bosses of the Dongsang Kingdom and couldn’t be distracted.","He couldn’t let them know.","Elder Helian was the highest-ranking official below them.","Elder Dongfang was also of that level.","Below them were the ordinary Spiritual Overlords like Elder Wu.","Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang were both senior Spiritual Overlords.","Yes!","Elder Dongfang!","Elder Helian told Elder Wu to inform the elders of the Imperial College, while he went to fetch Elder Dongfang.","For a major event like this, the two schools would join hands to fight against the Dongsang Kingdom.","Elder Helian went to see Elder Dongfang with that conviction.","Elder Dongfang said, “What? Are we going to the Peacock King’s territory in the Dayless Woods?”","Elder Helian said, “Yes! Now! Quickly!”","Elder Dongfang wasn’t alone.","Next to her was Dongfang Ziyun, her favorite niece.","Elder Dongfang was perplexed. “Why? Why has war broken out? I must have an explanation!”","Elder Helian had to tell her what happened to Feng Wu.","According to him, it was a war between the two fortresses. All personal vendetta, if there was any, had to be put aside.","He thought Elder Dongfang would go with him right away, but Elder Dongfang and Dongfang Ziyun only looked at each other before they told him, “You go ahead. We’ll be there in a minute.”","Elder Helian said, “Hurry up!”","He then joined the ten elders waiting outside and entered the Dayless Woods first.","Dongfang Ziyun rose to her feet as soon as Elder Helian left.","“Aunt Dongfang!”","She tugged at Elder Dongfang’s sleeve. “Did you hear that?”","Elder Dongfang nodded and started putting on her battle suit.","However, her movements were exceptionally slow.","Dongfang Ziyun was flustered. “Don’t go!”","Elder Dongfang stared at her.","Dongfang Ziyun said righteously, “Feng Wu went into the Dayless Woods of her own accord. We didn’t make her. Why should we help her now?","“You have no idea how arrogant Feng Wu is. She’s never thought of me as her equal!","“If she’s dead, I’ll be the best medicine refiner in the fortress!”","Seeing that her aunt was still putting on the suit, Dongfang Ziyun grabbed the robe.","“If Feng Wu’s dead, no one will steal His Royal Highness from me...”","Her voice sounded as tiny as a mosquito."]},{"number":3080,"title":"Chapter 3080 We’re Rich","paragraphs":["3080 We’re Rich","Elder Dongfang sighed. “Let go.”","“Aunt Dongfang...”","Dongfang Ziyun wanted to cry, thinking her aunt didn’t want to help her.","Elder Dongfang said, “How can you be so stupid?”","!!","Dongfang Ziyun said, “What?”","Elder Dongfang said, “When the Dongsang Kingdom is involved, the two schools must join hands and fight our common enemy. No one can defy that rule.","“What you said makes sense. Feng Wu brought this on herself, and we’re not obligated to help her. However, we have to look the part.","“Do you know what to do now?” Elder Dongfang gave Dongfang Ziyun a stern look.","Dongfang Ziyun knew her aunt well.","Her eyes lit up. “We have to go, but there’s no need to hurry. We can take our time. Right?”","“You’ve finally come to your senses,” Elder Dongfang said grumpily.","Dongfang Ziyun flushed with excitement.","Elder Dongfang added, “His Royal Highness will owe us a favor, and that’s very hard to come by.”","Dongfang Ziyun nodded obediently.","Elder Dongfang liked the feeling of being respected, and enjoyed Dongfang Ziyun’s obedience, so she decided to teach her a little more.","“If your favor didn’t seem to take much, the other party may not remember it.","“However, if you come to their rescue at the critical moment, they’ll remember it for a long time.”","Dongfang Ziyun was thrilled. “Let’s do that! We’ll save His Royal Highness, and he’ll owe us a favor. In that case...”","Dongfang Ziyun flushed.","Elder Dongfang didn’t stop her but enjoyed seeing this.","At the same moment, Feng Wu was running as fast as she could.","QUICKLY!","She had to move faster!","All problems would be solved once Jun Linyuan drank the potion.","She couldn’t avoid the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory on her way back to the fortress.","She got there in no time and was going to take Feng Xun with her so that the spider wouldn’t eat him.","Even if the spider didn’t eat him, Lord Pan might harm him later.","Feng Wu had played a little trick on Lord Pan, and the man should still be sleeping.","Her stomach lurched when she saw that the branch was empty.","It wasn’t her luckiest day.","She had wanted to kill Lord Pan, but it wouldn’t have been an easy job, and Feng Wu had been in a hurry.","More trouble.","Feng Wu rushed into the woods to find the happy teenager digging for badges in the pit.","There was mud on his face, but his eyes were exceptionally bright.","He was thrilled to see that Feng Wu was back. “Xiao Wu, we’re rich! We’ll be very rich! You have no idea how many badges I’ve found!”"]},{"number":3081,"title":"Chapter 3081 Confrontation","paragraphs":["3081 Confrontation","Feng Wu looked like she was about to cry. She grabbed Feng Xun’s arm. “My dear brother, we should get going!”","Feng Xun wanted to stay. “There are so many badges. I haven’t collected them all yet.”","Feng Wu wanted to drag him away.","In a critical moment like this, badges were the last thing on her mind. They had to hurry up!","Feng Wu saw a black bag, which was very heavy when she picked it up.","It was filled with badges!","Apart from the bag, Feng Wu also saw Feng Xun’s robe on the ground.","He had made it into a bundle, which was also filled with badges of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Feng Wu didn’t know how many badges there were in total.","She threw the bag and the bundle into her storage space before dragging Feng Xun out of the pit. “Go!”","She turned around to look into the black eyes of the Sacred Imperial Spider.","It was less than half a meter away from Feng Wu.","Those eyes made Feng Wu jump, and she almost fell back into the pit.","The spider stared at Feng Wu. “Are you leaving?”","Feng Wu grew anxious.","If her prediction was right, Sakiya should be after her now.","He would hunt her down for the potion and for what happened to Lord Pan’s people. This place would be too dangerous.","As for the spider’s safety...","Feng Wu shook her head.","She had asked the Peacock King about the spider when they struck the deal.","Why did the seven beast kings live in the Dayless Woods between the two forces? Why hadn’t any of them died yet?","The Peacock King bragged to Feng Wu about the bond between the seven kings. No matter how many conflicts they had on a daily basis, they would always join hands and fight against humans.","That was why all the capable cultivators in Peace Grassland had been balancing each other out over the years, and only Spiritual Kings took part in the actual fighting.","Feng Wu wasn’t worried about the spider’s safety now because Sakiya couldn’t kill it.","She told the spider, “We must get back to our fortress. I’ll visit you some other day.”","The spider took her words very seriously.","“Some other day? When is that?”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She scratched her head. “How about ten days later?”","The spider thought about the suggestion.","Feng Wu was so anxious.","“You and the other six beast kings aren’t worried about your safety, but we are.","“Just let us go!”","Each second felt as long as an hour.","Finally, the spider sighed. “If you really want to go, then...”","Feng Wu dashed off before the spider could finish.","But right at that moment...","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Someone landed in front of Feng Wu.","It was Sakiya.","Another figure followed Sakiya.","It was the Peacock King.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Before she could say anything, Feng Xun shouted, “It’s you, Sakiya!”","The spider was alarmed when it saw the Peacock King.","What was that bird doing in its territory?","Sakiya was surprised to see Feng Wu."]},{"number":3082,"title":"Chapter 3082 Unexpected Encounter","paragraphs":["3082 Unexpected Encounter","Sakiya immediately spotted Feng Wu.","He had never met Feng Wu before, but that didn’t stop him from recognizing her since he had seen her portrait.","Feng Wu was too unique to miss.","Wearing her red dress, the girl was a sight one couldn’t ignore. Her eyes were as bright as stars, and she reminded one of a fairy in the woods.","There was no one like her, certainly not in Peace Grassland.","Sakiya immediately said, “You’re Feng Wu.”","What other choice did Feng Wu have?","She regretted putting her red dress back on and removing her disguise.","She had let her guard down.","There was no point in denying who she really was now.","She nodded at Sakiya. “Hello, Mr. Sakiya.”","Their eyes met, and indescribable energy filled the air.","Two capable cultivators were communicating with their eyes.","Mr. Sakiya was a polite, wise and calm man.","His quality made him a very tough opponent.","Mr. Sakiya knew himself well, and he knew only a handful of people wouldn’t be intimidated by his presence.","Mu Yan was a Supreme Level medicine refiner, but she was still uneasy around Sakiya.","However, now that Sakiya had met Feng Wu, he realized in surprise that the girl was remaining perfectly calm.","“She’s the third one,” Sakiya thought.","The first was Jun Linyuan, the second was Night Owl, and Feng Wu was the third teenager who impressed him.","So many talented people were found in this era!","However, Sakiya knew how rare this chance was, so he wouldn’t show Feng Wu any mercy.","Sakiya turned to the Sacred Imperial Spider. “You ate 50 of my junior Spiritual Kings.”","The spider shook its head innocently. “I didn’t! It wasn’t me!”","In any other situation, Feng Wu would have laughed at the spider.","Sakiya said coldly, “That wasn’t a question.”","The spider was speechless.","Sakiya would hold it accountable no matter what.","The spider was angry.","“Aren’t you supposed to show me the evidence? Where’s your evidence?!” The spider was furious.","Sakiya said calmly, “I’ll have my evidence when I cut open your stomach.”","The spider looked down at its abdomen.","It both hated and was afraid of Sakiya.","That had nothing to do with Sakiya’s cultivation level.","Sakiya had never fought the spider before, and the spider didn’t know what his real capability was.","However, the man could command all the forces in his fortress, and the spider hated that.","Sakiya didn’t beat around the bush. “If you back off now, I’ll forget what you’ve done.”","The spider wasn’t stupid.","Sakiya hadn’t looked away from Feng Wu ever since he arrived.","She was his target.","As long as the spider didn’t intervene, Sakiya wouldn’t look into the matter of the spider eating his 50 subordinates."]},{"number":3083,"title":"Chapter 3083 Make an Offer","paragraphs":["3083 Make an Offer","To be honest, the spider hesitated.","It had never had a friend before, but this human girl seemed to have just become its first one.","Friends would help each other out, wouldn’t they?","Feng Xun tried to shield Feng Wu from Sakiya.","Feng Wu patted him, telling him not to worry.","She walked past Feng Xun and met Sakiya’s gaze.","“Mr. Sakiya, you insist on taking me, don’t you?” Feng Wu smiled.","Sakiya said apologetically, “I’m sorry, but you’ll have to come with us.”","Feng Wu asked, “Have I broken a law of the Dongsang Kingdom? Why should I go with you?”","What concerned her the most was her disguise as Bu Jingyu.","It would determine if she could obtain the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Sakiya said directly, “Your Divine Phoenix Blood is useful to us.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “And?”","Sakiyas said, “And what?”","Feng Wu almost laughed.","She had never talked to anyone so presumptuous.","This man believed he had the right to snatch her because her Divine Phoenix Blood was useful.","“Mr. Sakiya, I thought I could reason with you, but...” Feng Wu shook her head. “You’re only human.”","Sakiya knew what she meant.","He didn’t refute, but calmly told Feng Wu, “Morality changes when one crosses the border.”","Feng Wu didn’t agree with him.","“I don’t think so. It should be the same everywhere.”","She even formed a friendship with the spider despite being from a different species.","Sakiya glanced at Feng Wu, amazed by how sophisticated she sounded.","“Come with me.” Sakiya didn’t say anything else.","Feng Xun was on guard.","He kept looking over his shoulder, feeling uneasy.","Hadn’t Xuan Yi gone to the fortress to get reinforcements?","Where were they?","What was taking them so long?","Feng Wu asked, “What if I refuse?”","Sakiya frowned. “Do you want to turn down my polite invitation?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, I do.”","Sakiya said, “Then I won’t be too civil.”","Feng Wu said, “Do you mean what I think you mean?”","Sakiya nodded, “I think so.”","Feng Wu only smiled at the Peacock King behind Sakiya. “Can I make you an offer?”","The Peacock King didn’t say anything.","Sakiya glanced at the Peacock King.","Feng Wu didn’t sound like she was talking to a beast king. She acted as if it was her equal.","The Peacock King hesitated.","It was a great opportunity. The girl’s Semi-Divine pills were very effective. However, it had a long-term relationship with the Dongsang Kingdom. Although their pills weren’t as effective, they would keep coming.","That put the peacock in a difficult spot.","Feng Wu asked, “What are they offering you?”","Sakiya stared at the Peacock King.","The peacock and girl knew each other, and they were on talking terms.","That shocked Sakiya.","He had always thought only someone at his level could talk to the Peacock King.","The Peacock King’s eyes darted between Feng Wu and Sakiya. In the end, it stuck out two talons.","Sakiya was astonished."]},{"number":3084,"title":"Chapter 3084 Which Plan?","paragraphs":["3084 Which Plan?","He didn’t let his astonishment show.","The Peacock King had raised its price.","He had offered the Peacock King a Semi-Divine pill, but the Peacock King was asking Feng Wu for two.","The price had gone up.","Sakiya didn’t know how to react.","Feng Wu told the Peacock King, “I’ll give you four.”","The Peacock King was intrigued but hadn’t made up its mind.","Feng Wu then said, “Plan A: I give you four, and you stay out of this conflict, helping no one.","“Plan B: I give you eight, but you’ll have to stall Mr. Sakiya while my brother and I get away.","“Plan C: I give you ten, and you kill Mr. Sakiya for me.”","Feng Wu smiled at the Peacock King. “Which plan do you prefer?”","The Peacock King was astonished.","She talked about Semi-Divine pills like she was giving out candy!","Sakiya wouldn’t believe it, and nor would the Peacock King.","Feng Wu ignored Sakiya and only talked to the Peacock King. “You don’t need to worry about me having the pills or not. Would I make the offer if I didn’t have them? Just tell me which plan you want to choose.”","Feng Wu was luring the Peacock King into a trap.","When it made a choice, the Dongsang Kingdom wouldn’t trust it anymore.","Any of the three plans would benefit Feng Wu.","She had deliberately set the reward of Plan B so high, just to make the Peacock King choose it.","The Peacock King was tempted.","Four was a sweet deal. It was one pill more than what Sakiya offered, and it wouldn’t put the Peacock King in any danger.","Eight pills sounded irresistible.","Plan C was too difficult. It was out of the question.","The Peacock King couldn’t decide which plan it should choose.","Sakiya looked from the Peacock King to Feng Wu in surprise.","He hardly ever lost control of his emotions, but it was probably because no one had ever been able to surprise him.","He never thought a junior Spiritual King could talk to the Peacock King, let alone fool it.","He regretted letting Feng Wu talk to the Peacock King.","He stopped forward, blocking the Peacock King’s sight.","He then narrowed his eyes. “Young lady, you’re such a surprise.”","Feng Wu thought, “You have no idea.”","A group of people appeared behind Sakiya.","They were all familiar faces.","There were Guchi, Mu Yan, Bu Jingyu, Sakurin and some capable assassins.","Sakiya heard them, but he never took his eyes off Feng Wu.","This girl with the Divine Phoenix Blood had amazed him.","“Do you know what you’re talking about?” Mu Yan stepped forward and sneered at Feng Wu. “Semi-Divine pills aren’t like Supreme pills! You can never produce so many!”","Sakiya had suspected Mu Yan before, and Mu Yan was eager to ingratiate herself with Sakiya.","Feng Wu gave her a curious look."]},{"number":3085,"title":"Chapter 3085 Why Force Me?","paragraphs":["3085 Why Force Me?","Sakiya nodded at Feng Wu, agreeing with what Mu Yan said.","Bu Jingyu stumbled back when he saw Feng Wu.","It was her! That fiend!","Feng Wu glanced at Bu Jingyu with a smile.","Bu Jingyu almost screamed, and his face went ghastly pale.","He kept falling back and didn’t dare meet Feng Wu’s eyes.","That was so frightening!","He was worried about his master. Would he be that fiend’s match?","Feng Wu looked at the Peacock King. “You know what my Semi-Divine pills are like.”","Of course the Peacock King knew.","It had tried them before. They were very effective.","“My Lord Peacock, don’t let her fool you!” Mu Yan couldn’t wait to show her talent to make up for her previous mistakes. She jumped at the opportunity to slander Feng Wu.","Mu Yan stared at her.","She only had a glimpse of Feng Wu at first, but now, she finally saw Feng Wu’s face clearly.","The girl’s features were exquisite, and her skin was as fair as snow.","Mu Yan couldn’t begin to describe how beautiful the girl was.","She was dumbfounded.","She had never met Feng Wu until now.","She knew Feng Wu had the Divine Phoenix Blood and was a young genius.","She also remembered what Sakurin said.","Sakurin told her Feng Wu looked just like anybody else.","Yes, she didn’t have an extra nose or mouth, but not everybody looked as beautiful as she was!","Mu Yan had never met anybody so stunning before.","Feng Wu was the epitome of beauty.","No!","Mu Yan refused to think so highly of Feng Wu.","She glared at Feng Wu, overwhelmed by jealousy.","Feng Wu looked innocently at her.","Mu Yan hated her even more.","She smirked. “Do you realize the Peacock King is talking about Semi-Divine pills?”","Feng Wu said lightly, “I do.”","Mu Yan didn’t know what to say.","She then laughed. “You don’t know what you’re talking about.","“Do you know how precious Semi-Divine pills are? You’re offering ten at a time!","“Only an ignorant person would make such a promise.","“Do you know who I am?","“I’m a Supreme Level medicine refiner. Yes, you heard me right. A Supreme Level medicine refiner!”","Feng Wu found Mu Yan rather idiotic.","So did Feng Xun.","They looked at each other without saying a word.","Mu Yan thought Feng Wu was scared, so she snorted.","She then told the Peacock King, “Please don’t let her fool you. She’s a fraud.”","The Peacock King grew suspicious.","Feng Wu rubbed her temple. “Why are people always forcing me to show my real capability?”"]},{"number":3086,"title":"Chapter 3086 Demonstration","paragraphs":["3086 Demonstration","Everybody stared at Feng Wu in amazement and wondered how stupid she could be.","Mu Yan couldn’t help but laugh.","She had never met anyone so shameless, and decided that Feng Wu was just a pretty face.","She was so happy.","Feng Wu told the Peacock King, “Name your terms.”","The Peacock King was confused.","Feng Wu gave it two choices. “Which would you like? A Semi-Divine Enhancement pill or a Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill?”","The Peacock King blurted out, “The Golden Crow pill.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Alright?","You can produce that out of the blue? thought Mu Yan.","Sakiya thought Feng Wu was stalling for time and wanted to stop her.","Suddenly, a tiny cauldron appeared; Feng Wu was about to create some pills right in front of them.","They all felt the way Elder Dongfang had before. No one believed Feng Wu could do it.","She was only a teenager. How could she be a Semi-Divine medicine refiner?","However, the aroma of the herbs soon filled the air.","The Peacock King and the Sacred Imperial Spider looked at each other in amazement.","Interesting.","Realizing something was wrong, Sakiya frowned and stepped forward.","Feng Xun immediately blocked his way and shouted, “Mr. Sakiya, are you going to take Xiao Wu back to the Dongsang Kingdom so that you can make her refine medicine only for you?”","Those words were meant for the two beast kings.","As expected, the Sacred Imperial Spider and Peacock King turned their cold gaze on Sakiya.","Sakiya frowned.","He could handle the spider, but if the Peacock King joined hands with the spider, he didn’t think he could defeat them both.","The Peacock King said grimly, “Mr. Sakiya, why are you in such a hurry?”","The Sacred Imperial Spider said, “It’ll be over soon. We’ll see how the refinement goes.”","Mr. Sakiya was a clever man, but Feng Wu was better.","He didn’t believe Feng Wu could succeed.","To confirm his belief, Sakiya glanced at Mu Yan.","Mu Yan gave him a reassuring nod.","“She’ll never succeed!” Mu Yan said confidently. “Even in the Dongsang Kingdom, we only have one Semi-Divine medicine refiner, and that is my master. How can the Junwu Empire have one? Even if they do, it won’t be her, a teenage girl. By the way she speaks, she’s not even a medicine refiner.”","Sakiya was a clever man, but he knew very little of refining medicine. Mu Yan didn’t always tell him the truth, however, so he had no idea what he was getting into.","However, he didn’t know that yet.","He chose to believe Mu Yan for the time being.","He decided to let Feng Wu proceed, and see how far she would get.","Sakiya calmed down and told the Peacock King. “I’ll give her two hours and no more.”","The Peacock King nodded.","However, as Feng Wu added more materials to the cauldron, Mu Yan was shocked by how skilled the girl seemed.","Her movements...","Her calculations...","Her deductions..."]},{"number":3087,"title":"Chapter 3087 Return the Favor","paragraphs":["3087 Return the Favor","Mu Yan suddenly felt uneasy.","Just then!","Feng Wu shouted, “Now!”","All eyes were on her tiny cauldron.","A small platform slowly rose from the bottom of the cauldron.","On it was a glowing pill that looked like a bead.","It was like the sun rising, and faint light seemed to veil the sky.","The Peacock King was astonished. “That’s a Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill!”","It was so excited that its feathers stood on end.","The spider was right behind the Peacock King.","Sakiya was perplexed.","A Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill?","He wouldn’t believe it.","How could a girl so young make such a pill? That didn’t make any sense.","Sakiya involuntarily turned to Mu Yan.","Mu Yan’s face was ghastly pale, and she stiffened as if she had been struck by lightning.","Sakiya felt his throat dry. “Are you saying that’s a Semi-Divine Golden Crow pill?”","He stared at Mu Yan, who wished she could be somewhere else.","She didn’t dare look into Sakiya’s eyes.","Although she was only a Supreme Level medicine refiner, she could still recognize a Semi-Divine pill when she saw one.","Sakiya didn’t know what to say.","He looked at Feng Wu, and there was no warmth in his eyes.","He knew he had underestimated her.","It seemed the surprises never stopped coming.","His eyes flickered, and he clenched his hands behind his back.","The next second!","Sakiya dashed toward Feng Wu.","He had to have that girl!","He regretted having given her that chance, and he wouldn’t let it happen again.","However, Feng Wu seemed to have anticipated this. Before Sakiya got to her, she grabbed Feng Xun and hid behind the Peacock King and the Sacred Imperial Spider.","Thump!","Sakiya exchanged a blow with the Peacock King, and both stumbled back.","It all happened so fast that the other people didn’t have time to react.","By the time they realized what had happened, the two parties had separated.","Bu Jingyu hid behind the crowd and stole glances at Feng Wu.","He admired Feng Wu for her intelligence.","She had set up his clever master and the Peacock King.","She had been at such a disadvantage, but she had somehow turned Sakiya and the Peacock King against each other.","Bu Jingyu rubbed his temple.","He knew it. His master wasn’t her match.","Sakiya narrowed his eyes and scolded the Peacock King. “Can’t you think of anything else apart from the Golden Crow pill?!”","Those words woke up the Peacock King.","He was right...","The Dongsang Kingdom gave it more than enough pills each year.","The Peacock King hesitated.","Sakiya needed to take care of the Sacred Imperial Spider.","He told the spider, “Whatever the Dongsang Kingdom offers the Peacock King in the future, we’ll prepare the same gifts for you.”","The spider had eaten 50 Dongsang men, and Sakiya was offering it gifts.","How generous."]},{"number":3088,"title":"Chapter 3088 Jun Linyuan Freezes","paragraphs":["3088 Jun Linyuan Freezes","The truth was that the Sacred Imperial Spider was tempted.","It glanced at Feng Wu, showing off how important it was.","Feng Wu smirked. “I can make Semi-Divine pills myself.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider woke up from its reverie.","She was right...","The Dongsang Kingdom was only giving it an empty promise, but if it made friends with this girl, it could have an endless stream of pills in the future.","She made them so much more easily than expected.","At that thought, the spider decided to side with Feng Wu.","Sakiya’s face darkened.","He couldn’t wait anymore, or the Junwu Empire’s fortress would take action.","However, as soon as he had that thought, he heard a cold voice behind Feng Wu.","“No one touches her!”","Those simple words seemed to contain enough power to shake the continent.","That voice...","Everybody turned around, and their pupils contracted.","Two men had arrived.","The teenager with deep-set features had the most handsome face.","The look in his eyes reminded one of tigers and eagles.","Who else could it be, but the crown prince of the Junwu Empire?","“Jun...”","Bu Jingyu couldn’t utter another word.","Mu Yan stared at Jun Linyuan in a trance-like state.","The Peacock King immediately hid behind Sakiya and closed up its huge tail.","It moved very slowly, in case Jun Linyuan noticed it.","The Sacred Imperial Spider lowered its head, pretending it wasn’t there.","The teenager’s fame was unparalleled.","When Jun Linyuan stood there, even if he didn’t activate his spiritual essence, he was still the most intimidating figure.","“Jun Linyuan!”","Feng Wu was ecstatic.","She was genuinely excited.","God knew how much she wanted to see him.","She had taken so much trouble to obtain that golden potion in her hand.","Jun Linyuan might seem intimidating, but Feng Wu knew he was bluffing.","Sakiya was a clever man. How long could Jun Linyuan put up that facade?","All she needed was to use the potion on Jun Linyuan.","That was all!","Feng Wu didn’t want to complicate things further.","She ran toward Jun Linyuan while everybody was watching. “Your Royal Highness!”","Before anyone could react, Feng Wu threw herself into the crown prince’s arms.","Jun Linyuan was astonished!","The girl was so enthusiastic!","Everybody else was terrified.","What was going on?","Mu Yan looked like her eyes were going to pop out of their head.","“What’s their relationship?!”","Feng Wu had a syringe in her hand when she jumped into Jun Linyuan’s arms.","The crown prince smelled her fragrance and felt her breath on his ear.","His earlobes turned pink.","He glared at Feng Wu, wishing she could control her passion.","Covering her movement with her wide sleeves, Feng Wu jabbed the needle into the crown prince’s butt.","The potion was injected.","Jun Linyuan suddenly stiffened.","The crown prince had never been treated like this before.","What a sensation.","He almost lost control.","Feng Wu whispered, “Don’t move!”"]},{"number":3089,"title":"Chapter 3089 The Crown Prince’s Gaze","paragraphs":["3089 The Crown Prince’s Gaze","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu like he wanted to kill her with his eyes.","Feng Wu cringed and whispered, “It’s the potion! The potion made from the Immortal Spiritual Fruit!”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes lit up.","He couldn’t begin to describe how surprised he was.","Of course, Jun Linyuan knew how important the Immortal Spiritual Fruit was.","He had run into Feng Wu back in Northern Border City when looking for one.","However, how could she find it in such a short time, let alone make the potion?","It sounded too good to be true.","However, the sensation in his butt told him otherwise. His fiancee was as amazing as ever.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","He felt embarrassed about what happened.","Elder Helian and his people arrived shortly afterward.","After them came Elder Dongfang and Dongfang Ziyun.","Elder Helian saw Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan in each other’s arms, and Feng Wu’s hand was on the crown prince’s butt.","He wanted to cover his eyes. How could they behave this way in broad daylight?","Elder Wu was glad to see this. He reminded Elder Helian, “Xiao Wu is from Imperial College.”","Elder Helian’s eyes lit up. Yes!","His Royal Highness had chosen a girl from Imperial College! The Military Academy would be furious!","Elder Dongfang and Dongfang Ziyun were astonished when they saw this.","Dongfang Ziyun thought she was going to faint.","Of course, all this happened in a brief moment.","It took Feng Wu less than three seconds to finish the injection.","In a critical moment like this, she couldn’t care about what other people thought. All she wanted was to give Jun Linyuan the potion.","Now that her mission was accomplished, she realized what it must look like.","Everybody was watching her.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She slowly let go of Jun Linyuan.","However, before she could leave his side, the crown prince spoke in a voice so low that only she could hear. “Help me.”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything, but he trembled a little.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched.","She knew what was happening.","The potion could work wonders, but it needed a moment to take effect.","Jun Linyuan didn’t have any spiritual essence, and his willpower was what had kept him going so far.","Feng Wu was so moved that she put an arm around Jun Linyuan’s waist, supporting him.","Xuan Yi glanced at her arm before looking upward.","Jun Linyuan had been running faster than him, who hadn’t lost his cultivation ability. And his legs only gave out now? Xuan Yi wanted to roll his eyes.","Meanwhile, Sakiya finally met Jun Linyuan’s gaze.","Feng Wu saw regret in Sakiya’s eyes.","He probably thought he shouldn’t have given Feng Wu that chance.","Sakiya suddenly smiled. “Your Royal Highness, it’s been a while. How have you been?”"]},{"number":3090,"title":"Chapter 3090 Has He Recovered?","paragraphs":["3090 Has He Recovered?","Jun Linyuan kept his gaze on Sakiya. “Yes, it’s been a while.”","Sakiya studied Jun Linyuan’s face and couldn’t believe the latter had woken up.","His own crown prince was still in a coma.","Had Jun Linyuan’s spiritual essence recovered?","Sakiya didn’t think so.","The Peacock King had drunk the potion, so he didn’t believe Jun Linyuan could regain his ability.","At that thought, Sakiya looked at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, do you want to take her away?”","Jun Linyuan gave Sakiya a sidelong glance.","He didn’t say another word, but the look in his eyes was full of pride and defiance.","Sakiya smiled. “I guess a battle is inevitable.”","Both sides had some capable members.","Elders Helian and Dongfang were peak Spiritual Overlords. They also had ten intermediate Spiritual Overlords about the same level as Elder Wu.","Sakiya was a junior Spiritual Saint. Behind him were six intermediate Spiritual Overlords and Guchi, a junior Spiritual Overlord.","The two beast kings were also by his side.","They had been trying to stay unnoticed ever since Jun Linyuan’s arrival.","The Peacock King said, “This is a conflict between humans. Don’t get us involved!”","The spider usually didn’t agree with anything the Peacock King said, but this time, it blurted out, “That’s right!”","The two beast kings fell back immediately after that, but didn’t stay very far.","They sat on a tree a short distance away and were ready to watch the battle.","Meanwhile, Sakiya kept his cold gaze on Jun Linyuan.","Even without any spiritual essence, the teenager could still intimidate everyone. He was about the only person who could do that.","Sakiya couldn’t help but think about Night Owl.","His crown prince was inferior in comparison. The thought made Sakiya a little jealous.","However, he smirked when he thought about the spiritual essence that Jun Linyuan no longer had.","All cultivators needed to keep their minds relatively calm. Sakiya felt if he could humiliate Jun Linyuan today, the teenager’s cultivation would be greatly affected.","Sakiya hatched a plan.","“Your Royal Highness, I won’t stop you from leaving.” Sakiya smiled. “However, we’ll be humiliated if you take her away like this. You’ll have to defeat me if you want to do that.”","Many people found that request idiotic.","Had Sakiya lost his mind?","Had he forgotten about the crown prince’s capability?","He had just asked for a duel.","He must be eager to lose.","Jun Linyuan sneered at Sakiya.","Sakiya suddenly felt like a fool.","He admitted he had done a stupid thing, but to shake Jun Linyuan’s determination, Sakiya decided to take the risk.","“If you can withstand three strikes from me, you can take Feng Wu away with you,” said Sakiya. “If Your Royal Highness thinks I’m too tough to fight against, you can pick anyone from my side.","“Bu Jingyu, come here.” Sakiya dragged his disciple out of the crowd. “You can take Feng Wu away if you defeat him.”","Bu Jingyu was terrified."]},{"number":3091,"title":"Chapter 3091 Lovey-Dovey","paragraphs":["3091 Lovey-Dovey","Bu Jingyu’s face went ghastly pale.","He stared at his master, and his mind went blank.","He couldn’t help but ask himself, “Who am I? What is this place? What am I doing here?”","Sakiya gave him an encouraging look.","Bu Jingyu shook his head repeatedly, wondering what he had done to make his master treat him like this.","Guchi patted him on the shoulder. “Jingyu, he doesn’t have any spiritual essence left.”","He knew Sakiya had appointed Bu Jingyu to humiliate Jun Linyuan.","If Jun Linyuan couldn’t defeat a mere Spiritual King, he would have no reason to be so proud.","Sakiya wanted to mess with Jun Linyuan’s mind.","No spiritual essence?","Bu Jingyu almost jumped to his feet.","He knew Feng Wu had tricked them and taken the real potion away, and she had held the crown prince for so long that she must have used it on him.","However, Jun Linyuan moved before Bu Jingyu could warn his master.","Nobody knew how he did it, but everybody saw it.","To be more precise, they saw Sakiya move.","Thump!","Jun Linyuan punched Sakiya with his right fist.","It looked like Sakiya had been hit by a tornado.","The air seemed to twist and warp.","Sakiya had always struck one as a tough man, but the impact made him stumble back.","The ground cracked under his feet.","With each step, his feet sunk deeper into the ground.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","Sakiya kept falling back.","He only stopped twelve steps later.","Bu Jingyu turned pale and looked at Guchi.","Didn’t he just say that Jun Linyuan didn’t have any spiritual essence?","Guchi was dumbfounded.","Night Owl blew himself up with Jun Linyuan, and both of them should have lost their spiritual essence.","“Mr. Sakiya!”","Guchi rushed to Sakiya’s side.","Meanwhile, everyone from the Junwu Empire who knew Jun Linyuan’s real condition was relieved.","Elder Dongfang and Dongfang Ziyun weren’t among them, so they looked at Sakiya in bewilderment.","Had this man lost his mind? Didn’t he know how formidable the crown prince was?","Sakiya was completely baffled by the outcome.","He didn’t know how this had happened to him.","Feng Wu had tricked him several times, and Jun Linyuan had just humiliated him in front of everybody.","Guchi and Sakiya were wondering the same thing.","Had Jun Linyuan regained his power?","If that were the case, Night Owl would lose whatever advantage he had.","Not only that, but Night Owl had also put himself in a difficult spot.","Sakiya fought back the blood rushing up his throat.","He couldn’t spit out blood now.","But the crown prince...","He stood still after that single strike.","“Give me a hand,” he whispered to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu stared at him. “Again?”","His punch could have destroyed a hill. Why did he need her help now?","The crown prince didn’t say a word, but he swayed a little.","Feng Wu immediately caught him by his waist.","Dongfang Ziyun was furious.","Would these two people stop being lovey-dovey?!"]},{"number":3092,"title":"Chapter 3092 Symptoms","paragraphs":["3092 Symptoms","Dongfang Ziyun looked like she was spitting fire from her eyes.","Xuan Yi glanced at Feng Wu’s tight grip on Jun Linyuan, feeling a little envious.","She seemed to be very much in love with him.","Somehow, Xuan Yi felt he had been left out.","Feng Wu could feel Jun Linyuan shivering.","He seemed to be trying to keep something under control.","What was it?","Feng Wu was perplexed.","Meanwhile, Sakiya cupped his fists at Jun Linyuan. “Goodbye, Your Royal Highness. I’ll see you around!”","He promptly left after that, and his assassins followed him. So did Guchi.","Bu Jingyu looked between Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan, and Feng Wu looked back at him.","Bu Jingyu panicked when he met Feng Wu’s eyes.","He dashed off without another moment of hesitation.","Mu Yan was the last to leave, but she would look over her shoulder almost after each step to glance at Jun Linyuan.","She didn’t try to hide the passion in her eyes.","However, nobody paid her any attention because too many people gave him that look. Dongfang Ziyun was doing it right now.","Elder Dongfang wondered why the crown prince stopped when he could have captured or killed Sakiya.","It was such a wonderful opportunity.","Jun Linyuan glanced at the two beast kings perched on a branch nearby.","The two beast kings dashed off and ran out of the woods like two streaks of light.","Feng Wu was about to introduce the Sacred Imperial Spider, her new friend, to the crown prince, but it was already gone.","She was amazed. This place was the spider’s home. Why did it run away?","Just then, Jun Linyuan let go of Feng Wu’s hand. “You guys can leave now.”","He was ordering everybody, Feng Wu included, to leave.","Feng Wu was bewildered. Jun Linyuan had needed her help only a moment ago, so why did he want her to leave now?","A thought suddenly struck her.","She remembered her symptoms when she absorbed the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Somebody was running toward them.","Feng Wu turned around and saw it was Dongfang Ziyun.","She bumped into Feng Wu when she ran past her, probably on purpose.","Unfortunately, Feng Wu wasn’t as fragile as Dongfeng Ziyun expected.","The impact almost knocked Dongfang Ziyun to the ground.","Holding her painful shoulder, Dongfang Ziyun glared at Feng Wu, wishing she could dig a hole in her with her eyes.","Feng Wu only gave her an innocent glance.","Dongfang Ziyun stopped in front of Jun Linyuan.","She was a spoiled and short-tempered rich young heiress when dealing with Feng Wu, but her demeanor had completely changed now.","She tilted her head and looked at Jun Linyuan with admiration. She looked as innocent as a kitten.","Feng Wu was astonished!","She rubbed her eyes, thinking she was seeing somebody else.","Yes, it was Dongfang Ziyun.","“Your Royal Highness...”","The girl spoke in a soft, childlike voice.","Feng Wu was amazed.","That tone practically gave her the creeps."]},{"number":3093,"title":"Chapter 3093 Hold It In","paragraphs":["3093 Hold It In","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","She couldn’t believe those words were coming from that Supreme Level medicine refiner.","The crown prince cast a stern look at Dongfang Ziyun and walked in the opposite direction.","Dongfang Ziyun panicked and followed him.","She didn’t know why he was walking away from her.","“Your Royal Highness, I...”","She flew backward before she could finish her sentence.","Feng Wu was speechless.","So was everybody else.","Elder Dongfang was dumbfounded.","The crown prince hadn’t treated Dongfang Ziyun like this before. He would ignore her at most. Did she repulse him now?","Elder Dongfang was filled with despair.","Seeing how fast Jun Linyuan was walking, Feng Wu knew he was having a difficult time. She immediately told the others, “Leave! Now! Stay as far away as you can!”","She glanced at Elder Helian.","Although the elder didn’t know why she said that, he trusted her.","The girl had proven to be reliable many times over.","Elder Helian told his people, “Let’s go!”","Elder Dongfang also grabbed Dongfang Ziyun and dashed off.","As for Feng Xun and Xuan Yi, they only needed one glance from Feng Wu.","Before long, Feng Wu was the only one there.","She realized she shouldn’t be here either.","She should get lost!","However, she only lifted one foot before she heard the fart that Jun Linyuan had been holding back for so long.","It lasted for quite a while.","Feng Wu felt like she had been struck by lightning, and stopped moving.","Her mind went blank for a moment.","What did she just hear?","However, that was such a long fart!","Needless to say, she couldn’t laugh.","She fought the urge to laugh so hard that the muscles in her stomach twitched.","The only thing that could give her away was her trembling shoulders.","What should she do now?","Could she pretend she hadn’t heard anything and just walk away?","That seemed to be the only option.","Feng Wu was about to slip away, when she heard another fart.","It was much louder.","She was astonished.","The crown prince farted even louder than other people.","It would be ridiculous to pretend she hadn’t heard that.","Feng Wu straightened her face and slowly turned around.","She wondered why Jun Linyuan hadn’t dashed off.","Why was he still here?","He shouldn’t have wanted her to hear that.","She turned around to see Jun Linyuan about ten meters away.","An extremely venomous snake had coiled around his leg.","By now, the snake had fainted from the smell of the fart.","When Feng Wu took a closer look, she saw the snake even had white bubbles around its mouth.","If she could, she would burst out laughing.","She never thought Jun Linyuan could make her want to laugh so much.","I can’t laugh!","Stop!","Feng Wu took a deep breath, patted her face, and approached Jun Linyuan.","She looked into a pair of angry eyes."]},{"number":3094,"title":"Chapter 3094 Cheer Him Up","paragraphs":["3094 Cheer Him Up","How should she describe Jun Linyuan’s expression?","He had embarrassment written all over his face.","When Feng Wu saw the look in his eyes, her first reaction was to flee.","But Jun Linyuan was exceptionally good-looking now.","!!","He had exquisite features and the smoothest skin. Usually, he looked like he was sulking, but the embarrassment brought some color to his cheeks, and he reminded Feng Wu of a tiger cub trying to look scary.","How adorable!","The crown prince had always been an intimidating figure, and Feng Wu couldn’t remember ever seeing him so abashed.","Jun Linyuan glared at Feng Wu. “Get lost!”","The temperature seemed to drop.","His cheeks were so red that one would think they were bleeding.","He kept his gaze on her.","Feng Wu didn’t know how to react.","She knew Jun Linyuan was a balloon that could pop at any moment.","She carefully approached him, acting as if nothing had happened.","That was her first strategy.","“Jun Linyuan, why are you still here? I thought you had left.”","She could tell Jun Linyuan wasn’t as tense as before, but he was still staring at her.","She then tried to change the subject.","She asked in a soft voice, “Aren’t you curious how I found the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","“It was so intense! I almost died!”","A murderous look flickered in Jun Linyuan’s eyes when Feng Wu mentioned death.","“They could have killed me.”","Her gentle voice made him feel sorry for her.","When Feng Wu led him to sit on a rock, he followed her and sat down, despite his reluctance.","What Feng Wu didn’t know was if she hadn’t shown up, the crown prince would have killed a lot of people in these woods.","She really wanted to laugh when she looked at the snake around Jun Linyuan’s leg.","It had to be the most unlucky snake of the year. Of all the people here, it had to pick Jun Linyuan as its prey.","Jun Linyuan stepped on the snake, instantly killing it.","The snake never knew what it had done wrong.","Feng Wu didn’t know what she was getting into either. She was busy cheering up the crown prince.","Although Jun Linyuan had sat down, he didn’t look any happier than before.","All the plants around him bent away from him, intimidated by his energy.","He still had “I’m mad” written all over him.","Feng Wu was speechless.","She put her arm through his and started telling him how she had tricked Sakiya.","Listening to her gentle voice, he gradually relaxed.","Suddenly!"]},{"number":3095,"title":"Chapter 3095 D*mn Her","paragraphs":["3095 D*mn Her","Feng Wu felt the rock under her move.","She turned around to find it covered with cracks that looked like a spiderweb.","Feng Wu’s eyes widened.","She involuntarily turned to Jun Linyuan, who was looking back at her.","Their eyes met, and everything fell silent for a second.","It was as if all sound had disappeared.","Feng Wu tried so hard to fight back her laughter that she almost had a cramp.","In order not to upset Jun Linyuan further, Feng Wu said, “When I was in the peacock’s territory...”","Jun Linyuan suddenly farted.","Feng Wu fought so hard to stop herself from laughing and had to pretend she heard nothing.","She told herself to keep her face straight, if she still wanted to live.","Rubbing her face, Feng Wu said, “I was in those woods when...”","There came the familiar sound again.","Feng Wu said flatly, “I was...”","She was interrupted by more farting.","She couldn’t hold it anymore.","Laughter burst out of her chest.","“Hahahaha —","“I’m sorry, but I really tried.","“Jun Linyuan, I can’t hold it anymore.","“Please stop doing that!”","Feng Wu really tried not to hurt the crown prince’s dignity, but she couldn’t help it.","She laughed so hard that she buried her face in Jun Linyuan’s arms.","Jun Linyuan blushed at first. His face then turned livid.","Seeing the laughing girl in his arms, he didn’t know what to do.","He had never felt so embarrassed before.","Terrifying energy filled the air.","All the trees were pulverized, and the ground cracked open.","Still, they couldn’t change what Jun Linyuan had done.","“Jun Linyuan, I didn’t mean it. I tried so hard...","“Just give me one minute. I’ll stop. I promise!”","Feng Wu had briefly stopped laughing, but when she realized how hard Jun Linyuan had tried to maintain his image, she started laughing again.","The crown prince was furious.","He wanted to leave, but the girl seemed to be stuck to him, and he couldn’t break free.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t let him run off.","Although she couldn’t stop laughing, she knew she had to keep him here.","If he ran away, she might not be able to get him back.","“Are you done?” Jun Linyuan asked coldly.","Feng Wu immediately backed off.","To prove that she didn’t want to laugh but couldn’t help it, she grabbed Jun Linyuan’s hand and put it on her stomach.","She said matter-of-factly, “See? I have a cramp. I mean it. I really tried not to laugh.”","Jun Linyuan’s face darkened, and his eyes were as cold as ice.","He could feel her soft stomach quivering.","“Are you in pain?”","Feng Wu said softly, “I am. It’s all because of you. Rub my stomach for me.”","“Because of me?","“Rub your stomach?”","Jun Linyuan wanted to push her away.","However, Feng Wu’s eyes suddenly lit up.","She felt that something amazing was about to happen!"]},{"number":3096,"title":"Chapter 3096 Level 5 Spiritual King","paragraphs":["3096 Level 5 Spiritual King","Feng Wu felt that something amazing was about to happen.","When Jun Linyuan rubbed her stomach, she felt the urge to make a breakthrough.","Was that possible?","Did Jun Linyuan’s touch have that effect?","That was it!","Feng Wu suddenly remembered how her fart from the Immortal Spiritual Fruit had helped people make breakthroughs.","She immediately sat on the ground.","Something happened before her spiritual essence ran two full cycles.","Rumble —","Feng Wu felt the signs of her own breakthrough.","She was already a junior Level 3 Spiritual King, and just now, she became a junior Level 4 Spiritual King.","However, it seemed she wasn’t done yet.","Feng Wu’s breakthrough continued.","When she opened her eyes, the sun had risen, and she noticed she had made another breakthrough.","She was a Level 5 Spiritual King.","Yes, a Level 5 Spiritual King.","Nobody would believe this.","Why would they?","Even Feng Wu was astonished.","She looked up at Jun Linyuan and realized he had just put down his hand.","During her breakthrough, he had kept his hand on his back to provide her with spiritual essence.","Feng Wu felt rather guilty.","Jun Linyuan was so mad at her, but he still helped her with her breakthrough.","She had this opportunity because he farted after digesting the potion.","All in all, she had Jun Linyuan to thank for her breakthrough, but she had laughed so hard.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She looked at Jun Linyuan, genuinely feeling sorry.","The crown prince’s cheeks were red.","Was he ill?","Feng Wu touched his head and cried, “You have a fever!”","Feng Wu pitied him even more.","“You’re ill! It’s so cold out here at night, and you haven’t recovered yet. You sat here with me for so long and provided spiritual essence for me. I...”","She was overwhelmed with guilt.","Jun Linyuan had wanted to tell her it was a symptom of his waking bloodline, but when he saw how worried Feng Wu was, he kept his silence.","Recalling how hard Feng Wu had laughed, he turned away from her and wouldn’t talk to her.","Feng Wu immediately saw what he was doing.","She held his arm and said softly, “It’s so cold out here. Let’s get back to the fortress.”","She looked up at the sky. “It’s going to rain. We can’t let you get wet.”","Jun Linyuan wouldn’t respond.","Feng Wu took his hand and led him toward the fortress, and he let her, despite looking rather reluctant.","As soon as they set foot in the fortress, all eyes were on their joined hands.","Wow.","Their hands!","Many people had been cultivating, but their friends dragged them out to the corridor to watch.","This wasn’t something they saw every day.","Feng Wu was embarrassed by the attention and wanted to let go."]},{"number":3097,"title":"Chapter 3097 Bad Public Opinion","paragraphs":["3097 Bad Public Opinion","Feng Wu wanted to let go, but the crown prince tightened his grip.","She couldn’t release his hand.","So many people had gathered on the fortress wall.","Sun Yu and the others all came out.","!!","Countless people were talking about Feng Wu and the crown prince. They had different opinions, but they were all equally shocked.","“Isn’t that Feng Wu from the junior arena?”","“That’s right. She punched Sakurin, kicked Fuhara, and killed Hoshimi.”","“I was so in love with her. Why is she and His Royal Highness holding hands?”","“Wake up! Can you see yourself in the mirror? What makes you think you’re good enough for her?”","“Can’t I dream about it? Yes, she’s pretty and talented, but that’s our crown prince!”","What did Jun Linyuan mean to the people of this fortress?","He was invincible!","When he was a little over ten years old, he went into the Dayless Woods alone and defeated the seven beast kings.","All seven of them!","No one knew what kind of energy he possessed, but they all knew it worked on magical beasts.","Even those more powerful than him had to bow their heads.","How strange.","Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan and wanted him to let go.","The crown prince wouldn’t loosen his grip.","Feng Wu looked up at the sky.","All these people were putting her under a lot of pressure.","Sun Yu and the other team members were thrilled to see this.","“Are they making it official now?” Chu Qu cried out.","Official?","The other people around them asked excitedly, “What do you mean? Has this been going on for a while?”","That was a Level 4 Spiritual King.","Before, he wouldn’t even speak to Chu Qu.","Right now, he couldn’t wait to hear some gossip.","He couldn’t help it.","Chu Qu wanted to show off how much he knew. “That’s right. Didn’t you hear about it before?”","More people around them moved closer to listen in.","Chu Qu described how Jun Linyuan behaved during the competition between the two schools.","“That’s so sweet,” somebody said.","“No, it isn’t!” said a girl.","Not everybody was as happy.","“Look at their hands. Feng Wu is holding onto His Royal Highness’s hand!”","“You’re right. She’s so passionate.”","“It’s understandable that His Royal Highness can’t help himself. She’s offering herself to him. Why won’t he accept her?”","“She’s a Level 2 Spiritual King, isn’t she? She must have put all her efforts into this sort of thing. That’s why she hasn’t made any progress.”","...","Gradually, public opinion turned against Feng Wu.","Sun Yu and the others argued with those people.","However, their opponents were great in number and were much better at arguing. Sun Yu and his friends weren’t capable enough to fight them."]},{"number":3098,"title":"Chapter 3098 Rub Her Head","paragraphs":["3098 Rub Her Head","In the end, Sun Yu and his friends had to run away from those people.","“Why do I feel Xiao Wu is in danger?” Chu Qu rubbed his chin.","He had thought this was good news, but it seemed Feng Wu had gained more enemies than friends.","Sun Yu snorted. “They think too highly of themselves and have funny ideas. Just wait and see.”","Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan had no idea of how big a sensation they had caused.","Once they were back at the general’s quarters, Feng Wu walked Jun Linyuan back to his room.","Jun Linyuan said, “Don’t run.”","Feng Wu was bewildered. “What?”","The crown prince said, “I’ll be absorbing the potion for a while.”","He also had to activate his Dragon Phoenix Bloodline.","However, he kept the second part from Feng Wu.","He decided to tell her after he succeeded.","Recalling what happened in the woods earlier, the crown prince blushed and stared at Feng Wu. “It’ll take me ten to fourteen days. Don’t go anywhere. Just stay here in the fortress. Got it?”","The teenager was so beautiful in the sunlight that Feng Wu felt bewitched. She almost couldn’t understand what Jun Linyuan said and only nodded as she listened.","The crown prince rubbed her head and went into his cultivation room before she had a chance to ask any questions.","Feng Wu only realized what had happened after Jun Linyuan left.","Huh?","He had rubbed her head.","Only her beautiful master used to do that.","Feng Wu touched the top of her head where Jun Linyuan had rubbed it.","She didn’t feel uncomfortable about it.","His touch was easier to accept than she had thought.","Huh?","“Am I in love with Jun Linyuan","“No! I can’t be!","“We’re buddies! That’s all!”","Feng Wu managed to convince herself and put that thought aside.","She then ran out of the room.","She had brought back so many badges, and her friends could use some of them.","She was right.","Sun Yu, Chu Qu and a few others had gathered together in the current students’ quarters.","They all looked at one another in frustration.","As current students, they had very few opportunities to earn badges. They could only explore the outer ring, where essence crystals were hard to come by.","Because they hadn’t graduated yet, they couldn’t go to the middle ring, and they had been making slow progress.","Chu Qu said, “We’re all Spiritual Kings and should be qualified to graduate and enter the middle ring.”","Sun Yu said, “We don’t have enough points.”","Chu Qu said, “Those senior sisters were so mean, but we can’t argue with them because we can’t get into their area.","“We need 3,000 points to graduate. One essence crystal is 100 points, and one major’s badge is 600 points.","“But majors hardly ever come to the outer ring, and we never get the chance to fight them. Are we ever going to graduate?","“I really want to go to the middle ring...”","“Forget about that. We have to get Ziyun out. He’s locked up.","“Let’s go to Xiao Wu. I’m sure...”","They were about to ask Feng Wu for help, when they heard a knock on the door."]},{"number":3099,"title":"Chapter 3099 Kick Ass","paragraphs":["3099 Kick Ass","Feng Wu walked in and dumped the bag of badges on the table.","“I’ve brought you a gift!” she said generously.","She hadn’t sorted out the badges that Feng Xun had dug out of the spider’s pit, and had brought everything here.","“Guys, take whatever you want.”","Feng Wu sat down like the richest person in the world.","However...","Sun Yu was eager to tell Feng Wu what had happened to Chen Ziyun, so he ignored the bag and told her, “Xiao Wu, please help our captain!”","Their captain?","Chen Ziyun?","Feng Wu thought her offer would be greeted with cheers, but they were asking her for help instead.","She leaned forward and asked, “What’s going on?”","Sun Yu said, “Captain Chen has been arrested. Please help him!”","Feng Wu became serious. “How did that happen? Why was he arrested? Who did it? Where is he now?”","Sun Yu and the others calmed down after Feng Wu came back.","Chu Qu said, “The other day, Captain Chen said His Royal Highness was in love with you. Miss Dongfang Ziyun said he slandered His Royal Highness, so she had him arrested and locked him up.”","Feng Wu blushed.","Sun Yu said, “But it’s the truth. You and His Royal Highness held hands when you came back, right? How can that be slander?”","Feng Wu’s earlobes turned red.","Chu Qu swayed Feng Wu’s arm back and forth. “Xiao Wu, let’s rescue Captain Chen. We’ve tried to visit him several times, but they never let us see him. We don’t know what his condition is like.”","Feng Wu thought about Chen Ziyun.","He had always been friendly to her. He went with her to the Dayless Woods even when he knew how dangerous it was.","He was a true friend.","Feng Wu rested her hands on her hips. “What do we do when someone messes with our friend?”","The others said, “Kick their asses!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s go!”","Everybody followed her out.","Xiao Wu was the crown prince’s future wife, and His Royal Highness was madly in love with her. Of course they would follow her.","Feng Wu told Chu Qu, “Take that bag.”","That bag?","What was in it?","Feng Wu hadn’t told them, and they didn’t dare ask.","All they could think of was to save Cheng Ziyun now, and no one paid much attention to the bag.","They soon arrived at the jail.","“Hey! Stop!”","The guards immediately stopped them.","“Do you know what place this is? You can’t just go in!”","Feng Wu glanced at them.","Peace Grassland was indeed an incredible place. Even the guards were Level 4 Spiritual Kings.","No wonder Sun Yu and the others couldn’t get in.","Both schools shared the same jail, and each school also provided one elder to run the place together.","Even the two guards came from one school each.","The one who shouted at them was from the Military Academy.","Feng Wu frowned a little.","She didn’t say anything, but Chu Qu stepped forward and announced, “We’re here for our friend! Let us in!”"]},{"number":3100,"title":"Chapter 3100 The Great Feng Wu","paragraphs":["3100 The Great Feng Wu","Sun Yu glanced at Chu Qu, wondering if the latter was too confident in this team.","Chu Qu wasn’t scared because Feng Wu was with them.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead.","Before she could say anything, the Level 4 Spiritual King from the Military Academy smirked.","“Are you breaking a prisoner out of jail? You’re only students. Don’t make me laugh!”","His shoulder strap said his name was Chang Wen.","“Are you trying to stop us?” Feng Wu glanced at him.","Chang Wen smirked. “So what? Do you want to force your way in?”","Feng Wu said, “No, I’ll just walk in.”","Chang Wen glanced at her and noticed her badge. She was also a student. Why was she so arrogant?","“I told you, you can’t go in. Are you deaf?!” Chang Wen was always hostile toward the people of Imperial College.","He thought none of the students here could do anything to him, but he was very much mistaken.","Thump!","Feng Wu only used one strike, and Chang Wen flew backward.","Just like that.","Chu Qu looked at Feng Wu in astonishment.","So did everybody else.","The other guard was a senior sister named Bai Ning from Imperial College, and she was also shocked.","Chang Wen was a Level 4 Spiritual King.","How could a current student’s punch have such power?","Bai Ning backed off a little and told someone to fetch the prison officials.","Something was about to happen!","Chang Wen crashed to the ground. The pain was excruciating, but it was nothing compared with how much his feelings had been hurt.","He had been beaten up by a current student.","She had only used one strike, and he had no power to fight back.","So...","That was crazy!","Feng Wu walked into the building without looking at Chang Wen.","Of course, Bai Ning didn’t try to stop her.","She couldn’t even if she wanted to.","Chang Wen almost spat out blood when he saw all the people swagger inside.","He put a hand on his chest and stumbled to his feet.","He had to complain to someone!","He would go to Dongfang Ziyun, the only Supreme Level medicine refiner in the fortress!","He would also go to Mr. Dai, the highest-ranking prison official.","“You’ll never get out alive!” he shouted after Feng Wu.","Feng Wu smirked. That man had no idea what cards she had up her sleeve.","She led the team into the building.","Chu Qu had never tried something like this before and felt uncertain.","“Xiao Wu, where’s His Royal Highness?” he whispered.","“He’s in seclusion,” said Feng Wu.","What?","Everybody felt dizzy.","His Royal Highness was in seclusion?!","How could they do this without him?","“Xiao Wu, is that true?” Chu Qu felt his heart sink. “Will he come out soon?”","Feng Wu said, “No, it’ll take him at least two weeks.”","Chu Qu almost fainted.","Two weeks? They would be buried by then!","“Xiao Wu, why don’t we leave now?” Chu Qu and the others panicked.","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Why?”"]}]);
